            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c6f29313caabd72c31'), 'plot': 'A musician travels a great distance to return an instrument to his elderly teacher.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Music'], 'runtime': 117, 'cast': ['Marciano Martènez', 'Yull Nèèez', 'Agustin Nieves', 'Jose Luis Torres'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjEyNzUyOTY1Nl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMDU3NTMyMw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Wind Journeys', 'fullplot': 'For most of his life, Ignacio Carrillo traveled the villages of northern Colombia, playing traditional songs on his accordion, a legendary instrument said to have once belonged to the devil. He eventually married and settled in a small town, leaving the nomadic life behind. But after the traumatic death of his wife, he vows to never play the accursed accordion again, and embarks on one last journey to return the instrument to its rightful owner. On the way, Ignacio is followed by Fermín, a spirited teenager determined to become his apprentice. Tired of loneliness, Ignacio accepts the young man as his pupil and together they traverse the vast Colombian terrain, discovering the musical diversity of Caribbean culture. Hardened by a life of solitude, Ignacio tries to discourage Fermín from following in his footsteps, but destiny has different plans for them.', 'languages': ['Spanish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2009, 4, 30, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Ciro Guerra'], 'writers': ['Ciro Guerra'], 'awards': {'wins': 7, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '7 wins & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-04 00:26:54.147000000', 'year': 2009, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.3, 'votes': 1319, 'id': 1426374}, 'countries': ['Colombia', 'Germany', 'Argentina', 'Netherlands'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 361, 'meter': 84}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2010, 7, 6, 0, 0), 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 4, 19, 29, 45)}}\n",
