            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c7f29313caabd73b2d'), 'plot': 'A tribute to the late German choreographer, Pina Bausch, as her dancers perform her most famous creations.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 103, 'metacritic': 83, 'rated': 'PG', 'cast': ['Regina Advento', 'Malou Airaudo', 'Ruth Amarante', 'Jorge Puerta'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTMyMTI1NDA5MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzM1NTY5Ng@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Pina', 'fullplot': 'In modern dance since the 1970s, few choreographers have had more influence in the medium than the late Pina Bausch. This film explores the life and work of this artist of movement while we see her company perform her most notable creations where basic things like water, dirt and even gravity take on otherworldly qualities in their dancing.', 'languages': ['German', 'French', 'English', 'Spanish', 'Croatian', 'Italian', 'Portuguese', 'Russian', 'Korean'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 2, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Wim Wenders'], 'writers': ['Wim Wenders'], 'awards': {'wins': 12, 'nominations': 20, 'text': 'Nominated for 1 Oscar. Another 11 wins & 20 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-19 00:30:55.907000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.7, 'votes': 10536, 'id': 1440266}, 'countries': ['Germany', 'France', 'UK'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.pina-film.de/', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 8256, 'meter': 81}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 1, 22, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 8.3, 'numReviews': 93, 'meter': 95}, 'boxOffice': '$3.5M', 'consensus': 'Pina is an immersive, gorgeously shot tribute to the people who express life through movement.', 'rotten': 5, 'production': 'IFC Films', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 14, 18, 56, 28), 'fresh': 88}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
