            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c7f29313caabd73bd9'), 'plot': \"Nono, a Dutch kid lacking two days being thirteen, runs away from problems at home and, disguised as a girl, takes up with the world's cleverest thief, who unbeknownst to Nono, may hold the bizarre key to his true identity.\", 'genres': ['Adventure', 'Drama', 'Family'], 'runtime': 95, 'cast': ['Thomas Simon', 'Fedja van Huèt', 'Jessica Zeylmaker', 'Burghart Klauèner'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTk0MzYxMTQxOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzc1MDc1OQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Zigzag Kid', 'fullplot': \"Nono wants to be like his father - the best police inspector in the world - but he constantly gets in trouble. Two days before his Bar Mitzvah, he is sent away to his uncle Sjmoel, who is supposed to get him back on track. However, during the train ride Nono gets one last chance to prove himself... Together with master-burglar Felix Glick - an old acquaintance of his father - he stops the train and enters a world of disguises, chases, French chansons and Zohara, a mysterious woman whose secrets will change Nono's life forever.\", 'languages': ['English', 'Dutch', 'French'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 10, 3, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Vincent Bal'], 'writers': ['David Grossman (novel)', 'Vincent Bal (scenario)', 'Jon Gilbert (scenario)'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '3 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-10 17:13:34.893000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.5, 'votes': 287, 'id': 1441083}, 'countries': ['Netherlands', 'Belgium', 'UK', 'Spain', 'France'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.6, 'numReviews': 31, 'meter': 60}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2014, 12, 22, 0, 0), 'website': 'http://www.menemshafilms.com/zigzag-kid', 'production': 'Benelux Film', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 13, 17, 39, 42)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c7f29313caabd73a81'), 'plot': 'A hunter in a remote and idyllic forest stumbles on a make shift tent fashioned from sheets of plastic and containing the mummified remains of a corpse. A detailed journal found on site ...', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 87, 'cast': ['Peter Mettler', 'Alexander Tschernek'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYzI0ZWE2YzctMzdhYi00YjQ1LTg0MzItYzQyZGM0MDQ2YmZiXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNzI2NzgzMzc@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Sound of Insects: Record of a Mummy', 'fullplot': \"A hunter in a remote and idyllic forest stumbles on a make shift tent fashioned from sheets of plastic and containing the mummified remains of a corpse. A detailed journal found on site reveals the man committed suicide by self-imposed starvation. Who was this man? Why did he kill himself in such a manner? Inspired by this true event and by the novella 'Until I Am a Mummy' by Shimada Masahiko, Insects sensuously evokes the mysterious man's last days.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 12, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Peter Liechti'], 'writers': ['Peter Liechti', 'Masahiko Shimada (novel)'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '3 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-07 00:08:34.460000000', 'year': 2009, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.0, 'votes': 345, 'id': 1439573}, 'countries': ['Switzerland'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.6, 'numReviews': 695, 'meter': 67}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2011, 7, 19, 0, 0), 'website': 'http://www.kinolorber.com', 'production': 'Lorber', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 25, 18, 51, 42)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c7f29313caabd73b73'), 'fullplot': \"Cheyenne, a wealthy former rock star (Penn), now bored and jaded in his retirement embarks on a quest to find his father's persecutor, an ex-Nazi war criminal now hiding out in the U.S. Learning his father is close to death, he travels to New York in the hope of being reconciled with him during his final hours, only to arrive too late. Having been estranged for over 30 years, it is only now in death that he learns the true extent of his father's humiliation in Auschwitz at the hands of former SS Officer Aloise Lange - an event he is determined to avenge. So begins a life-altering journey across the heartland of America to track down and confront his father's nemesis. As his quest unfolds, Cheyenne is reawakened by the people he encounters and his journey is transformed into one of reconciliation and self discovery. As his date with destiny arrives and he tracks down Lange, Cheyenne must finally decide if it is redemption he seeks ....or revenge. Starring two time Academy Award winner Sean Penn and marking the much-anticipated English-language debut of acclaimed director Paolo Sorrentino, THIS MUST BE THE PLACE is a gripping examination of a man on the precipice of obsession.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 23316, 'id': 1440345}, 'year': 2011, 'plot': 'Cheyenne, a retired rock star living off his royalties in Dublin, returns to New York City to find the man responsible for a humiliation suffered by his recently deceased father during W.W.II.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 61, 'title': 'This Must Be the Place', 'lastupdated': '2015-08-27 00:29:00.633000000', 'languages': ['English', 'Hebrew'], 'writers': ['Paolo Sorrentino (screenplay)', 'Umberto Contarello (screenplay)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.3, 'numReviews': 9261, 'meter': 58}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 3, 12, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.1, 'numReviews': 82, 'meter': 65}, 