            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c8f29313caabd78a95'), 'fullplot': \"Frank Darrbo is a hapless fry cook. When his wife Sarah falls off the wagon and dumps him for Jacques, a drug dealer, Frank tries to get her back by reporting her kidnapped, grabbing her from Jacques' car, and wailing for her to return. After watching Christian TV and having a vision, he becomes a superhero to fight evil. He sews a costume, finds a weapon (a pipe wrench) and looks for crimes to stop. He has problems: his wrench inflicts real injury, so the cops want him for being a vigilante, his sense of boundaries is flawed, and Jacques' gang has guns. Libby, a clerk at a comic book store, becomes his sidekick, and it's time to go save Sarah. What chance do they have?\", 'imdb': {'rating': 6.8, 'votes': 56987, 'id': 1512235}, 'year': 2010, 'plot': 'After his wife falls under the influence of a drug dealer, an everyday guy transforms himself into Crimson Bolt, a superhero with the best intentions, but lacking in heroic skills.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Crime'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 50, 'title': 'Super', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-10 17:48:36.423000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['James Gunn'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.thecrimsonbolt.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.3, 'numReviews': 21923, 'meter': 55}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2011, 8, 9, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.5, 'numReviews': 116, 'meter': 48}, 'boxOffice': '$0.3M', 'rotten': 60, 'production': 'IFC Midnight', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 18, 18, 6, 30), 'fresh': 56}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTcxMDkxNjI1NF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzE5Njc1NA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 6, 10, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'cast': ['Rainn Wilson', 'Ellen Page', 'Liv Tyler', 'Kevin Bacon'], 'directors': ['James Gunn'], 'runtime': 96}\n",
