            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd79464'), 'plot': 'A train runs into a cow on the tracks; with the captain nowhere to be found, the fireman is forced to desperately improvise in order to keep the train going.', 'genres': ['Animation', 'Short', 'Comedy'], 'runtime': 9, 'cast': ['Richard Condie', 'Muriel Hogue', 'Leonard Waldner'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'Runaway', 'fullplot': 'A train may be racing toward a crash with a cow. The engineer, who calls himself captain and poses in Napoleon hat and uniform with epaulets, is distracted by a lady who enters the engine car looking for a small, black dog. The captain accompanies her back through a car of swells in top hats. The fireman, a small and polite but dutiful man, sees danger ahead and searches for the captain. The train is low on fuel with a high mountain in front and a ruined behind, so the fireman calls on the passengers to donate fuel. The swells negotiate with a carload of revelers, so all might end well. But what of the captain, lady, dog, and cow?', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2009, 6, 8, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Cordell Barker'], 'writers': ['Cordell Barker'], 'awards': {'wins': 4, 'nominations': 5, 'text': '4 wins & 5 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-03-29 01:32:20.767000000', 'year': 2009, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 185, 'id': 1520380}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 13, 18, 0, 35)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd792a8'), 'fullplot': \"The year is 1845, the earliest days of the Oregon Trail, and a wagon team of three families has hired the mountain man Stephen Meek to guide them over the Cascade Mountains. Claiming to know a short cut, Meek leads the group on an unmarked path across the high plain desert, only to become lost in the dry rock and sage. Over the coming days, the emigrants must face the scourges of hunger, thirst and their own lack of faith in each other's instincts for survival. When a Native American wanderer crosses their path, the emigrants are torn between their trust in a guide who has proven himself unreliable and a man who has always been seen as the natural enemy.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 6.5, 'votes': 7601, 'id': 1518812}, 'year': 2010, 'plot': 'Settlers traveling through the Oregon desert in 1845 find themselves stranded in harsh conditions.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Western'], 'rated': 'PG', 'metacritic': 85, 'title': \"Meek's Cutoff\", 'lastupdated': '2015-08-29 00:58:09.467000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Jonathan Raymond (screenplay)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://meekscutoff.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.1, 'numReviews': 8798, 'meter': 54}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2011, 8, 8, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 7.5, 'numReviews': 124, 'meter': 85}, 'boxOffice': '$1.0M', 'consensus': \"Moving at a contemplative speed unseen in most westerns, Meek's Cutoff is an effective, intense journey of terror and survival in the untamed frontier.\", 'rotten': 18, 'production': 'Oscilloscope Pictures', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 17, 17, 26, 49), 'fresh': 106}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTM0MzQzMjUxM15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzgyNjg0NA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 4, 15, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 6, 'nominations': 7, 'text': '6 wins & 7 nominations.'}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'cast': ['Michelle Will