            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd79c4d'), 'plot': \"For a rich upper-class family locked into their own little world, Bolivia's social changes threaten to burst their bubble.\", 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 108, 'cast': ['Ninèn del Castillo', 'Pascual Loayza', 'Nicolès Fernèndez', 'Juan Pablo Koria'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTMyMzcxNjI3N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNDA5NzkxMw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Southern District', 'fullplot': 'In La Paz -as opposed to many other cities- the rich live below, which is the Southern District. Life goes on without major mishaps in a large house surrounded by a beautiful garden. It is a wonderful world, a great bubble of comfort, where different personal spheres coexist: the mother, along with her three children and the Aymara inhabitants of the house. The drama surfaces slowly, without narrative ploys, observing day-to-day activities until internal and external forces make the bubble burst. The film relates the story of the final days of an upper-class family, at a time when the country is undergoing social changes.', 'languages': ['Spanish', 'Aymara'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 3, 11, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Juan Carlos Valdivia'], 'writers': ['Juan Carlos Valdivia (screenplay)'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '3 wins & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-14 00:14:31.677000000', 'year': 2009, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.6, 'votes': 232, 'id': 1526317}, 'countries': ['Bolivia'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 1}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 14, 18, 22, 17)}}\n",
