            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd7a07f'), 'fullplot': \"A suburban family is torn apart when fourteen-year-old Annie (Liana Liberato) meets her first boyfriend online. After months of communicating via online chat and phone, Annie discovers her friend (Chris Henry Coffey) is not who he originally claimed to be. Shocked into disbelief, her parents (Clive Owen and Catherine Keener) are shattered by their daughter's actions and struggle to support her as she comes to terms with what has happened to her once innocent life.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 7.0, 'votes': 32114, 'id': 1529572}, 'year': 2010, 'plot': 'A teenage girl is targeted by an online sexual predator.', 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama', 'Thriller'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 60, 'title': 'Trust', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-17 04:38:31.440000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Andy Bellin', 'Robert Festinger'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://trustmovie2011.com', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.5, 'numReviews': 9883, 'meter': 65}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2011, 7, 26, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.7, 'numReviews': 64, 'meter': 78}, 'boxOffice': '$0.1M', 'consensus': 'Director David Schwimmer gets some gut-wrenching performances out of his actors but he still lacks the chops to fully ratchet up story tension.', 'rotten': 14, 'production': 'Millenium Entertainment', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 17, 18, 11, 3), 'fresh': 50}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMzM2Mjc0Nzc4NF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNDk0MjY0NA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 4, 28, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '1 win & 3 nominations.'}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'cast': ['Clive Owen', 'Catherine Keener', 'Liana Liberato', 'Jason Clarke'], 'directors': ['David Schwimmer'], 'runtime': 106}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd7a263'), 'plot': 'Thirteen year-old city brat Ben (Brandon Tyler Russell) has done it again... and his struggling, single mother (Mira Sorvino) has had enough of him getting into mischief. Now, Ben has to ...', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Family'], 'runtime': 94, 'rated': 'PG', 'cast': ['Brandon Tyler Russell', 'Freddie James', 'Peter Fonda', 'Mira Sorvino'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNzY1NDI5NDQwNF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMzExNDA2MDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Smitty', 'fullplot': 'Thirteen year-old city brat Ben (Brandon Tyler Russell) has done it again... and his struggling, single mother (Mira Sorvino) has had enough of him getting into mischief. Now, Ben has to choose between going down the path of Juvi hall or spending the summer in Iowa on a farm with his estranged grandfather, Jack (Peter Fonda). The day after arriving, Ben is ready to leave. To help Ben get a friend, Jack gets him a smart farm dog from an animal shelter to keep Ben company and in line. Between the dog and a friendly neighbor (Louis Gossett, Jr.), Ben soon learns life lessons about friendship, family and responsibility. It may take a village to raise a child, but when you only have a handful of people and a dog at your side, you have to make do with what you have. Through it all, Ben has the most memorable summer of his life.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 4, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['David M. Evans'], 'writers': ['Michael Baumgarten'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '3 wins & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-26 00:21:01.510000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.3, 'votes': 335, 'id': 1531914}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.5, 'numReviews': 32, 'meter': 75}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 8, 6, 0, 0), 'website': 'http://www.phase4films.com/', 'production': 'Phase 4 Films', 'lastUpdated': da