            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd79fa3'), 'plot': \"James Benning's worrying and also reassuring vision of the Ruhr Valley, shot in six fascinating takes of a tunnel, a forest, a factory, a mosque, graffiti and a chimney.\", 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 120, 'title': 'Ruhr', 'countries': ['Germany'], 'fullplot': 'The American independent film maker James Benning has built up over the period of almost 40 years an oeuvre focusing on places and time. In long, unedited scenes, he shows his vision of, or amazement at, phenomena or landscapes that have long been considered a part of everyday reality. In Ruhr, Benning allows his camera to roam the Ruhr Valley in Germany, where his parents came from. There are six meticulously framed takes at places where apparently little happens: a tunnel with a single car, a forest where planes race overhead, a factory with glowing rods of steel, a mosque with a hundred bowing heads, a wall where someone takes up arms against graffiti and an enormous chimney from which smoke is occasionally belched out. They seem to come from a different reality, but are also familiar: worrying and reassuring at the same time.', 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'released': datetime.datetime(2009, 11, 2, 0, 0), 'directors': ['James Benning'], 'writers': ['James Benning'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-08 00:31:27.443000000', 'year': 2009, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.0, 'votes': 104, 'id': 1528792}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 6, 26, 20, 20, 26)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd79efe'), 'plot': 'Inspired by the true story of teenagers at Gloucester (Mass.) High School who agreed to get pregnant at the same time.', 'genres': ['Biography', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 87, 'rated': 'TV-PG', 'cast': ['Thora Birch', 'Madisen Beaty', 'David Clayton Rogers', 'Max Ehrich'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTY0MTAxMDI1NF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDkwNDA2MDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Pregnancy Pact', 'fullplot': \"Sidney Bloom (Thora Birch) is a Internet blog reporter who travels to her hometown of Gloucester, Massachusetts to investigate a string of teenage pregnancies and stumbles upon a clique of gullible and naive schoolgirls who have formed a pack to get themselves all pregnant to stick together. As Sidney seeks more answers to why, she also hits obstacles from the conservative community who are in denial as to what's going on right in front of them and being forced to ignore the realty of teen parenting.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 1, 23, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Rosemary Rodriguez'], 'writers': ['Pam Davis', 'Teena Booth'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-18 00:34:20.563000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.0, 'votes': 1422, 'id': 1528227}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.0, 'numReviews': 523, 'meter': 42}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2011, 2, 1, 0, 0), 'production': 'ITV Studios, Inc.', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 16, 20, 43, 3)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd7a462'), 'plot': 'The story of matinee idol Tab Hunter from teenage stable boy to closeted Hollywood star of the 1950s.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 90, 'cast': ['Clint Eastwood', 'Tab Hunter', 'Paul Newman', 'Natalie Wood'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjI5MzIxOTgyNl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDk4MzA2NjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Tab Hunter Confidential', 'fullplot': \"In the 1950s, Tab Hunter is number one at the box office and number one on the music charts. He is Hollywood's most sought-after star and America's boy next door. Natalie Wood, Debbie Reynolds and Sophia Loren are just a few of the actresses he is romantically linked to. Nothing, it seems, can damage his skyrocketing career. Nothing, that is, except for the fact that Tab Hunter is secretly gay. Now, Tab Hunter's secret is out. In TAB HUNTER CONFIDENTIAL we will meet, for the first time, the real Tab Hunter as he shares with us the whole story of a happy, healthy survivor of Hollywood's roller coaster.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 10, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jeffrey Schwarz'], 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '5 wins & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-04 00:18:56.240000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.8, 'votes': 282, 'id': 1533089}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.5, 'numReviews': 28}, 'website': 'http://tabhunterconfidential.com/', 'production': 'Film Collaborative', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 25, 18, 44, 44)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13c9f29313caabd7a484'), 'plot': 'After ambushing and killing his rival, losing everything in the process, dispirited warlord Hou Jie turns to a Shaolin monastery seeking salvation.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 131, 'metacritic': 53, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Shaoqun Yu', 'Chen Zhiui', 'Xing Yu', 'Wu Jing'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTMzNDc2NzI0MF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzg3Nzk0Ng@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Shaolin', 'fullplot': \"China is plunged into strife as feuding warlords try to expand their power by warring over neighboring lands. Fuelled by his success on the battlefield, young and arrogant Hao Jie sneers at Shaolin's masters after killing a rival warlord on their temple grounds. But the glory comes before a fall. His own family is wiped out in an unexpected turn of events and Hao is forced to take refuge with the monks. As the civil unrest spreads and the people suffer, Hao and the Shaolin masters are forced to take a fiery stand against the evil warlords. They launch a daring plan of rescue and escape.\", 'languages': ['Mandarin', 'Cantonese'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 1, 27, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Benny Chan'], 'writers': ['Alan Yuen (original screenplay)', 'Chi Kwong Cheung', 'Quiyu Wang', 'Kam Cheong Chan', 'Tan Cheung'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-05 00:30:15.457000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 14935, 'id': 1533749}, 'countries': ['Hong Kong', 'China'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.shaolinmovie-us.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.7, 'numReviews': 7427, 'meter': 71}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2011, 10, 25, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.2, 'numReviews': 27, 'meter': 74}, 'boxOffice': '$64.3k', 'rotten': 7, 'production': 'Variance Films', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 31, 18, 59, 54), 'fresh': 20}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
