            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13caf29313caabd7e557'), 'fullplot': \"In 2008 while rehearsing for a charity event, actor Joaquin Phoenix, with Casey Affleck's camera watching, tells people he's quitting to pursue a career in rap music. Over the next year, we watch the actor write, rehearse, and perform to an audience. He importunes Sean Combs in hopes he'll produce the record. We see the actor in his home: he parties, smokes, bawls out his two-man entourage, talks philosophy with Affleck, and comments on celebrity.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 6.2, 'votes': 13887, 'id': 1356864}, 'year': 2010, 'plot': \"Documenting Joaquin Phoenix's transition from the acting world to a career as an aspiring rapper.\", 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama', 'Music'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 48, 'title': \"I'm Still Here\", 'lastupdated': '2015-09-10 22:16:27.693000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Casey Affleck', 'Joaquin Phoenix'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.imstillheremovie.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 2.8, 'numReviews': 20357, 'meter': 38}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2010, 11, 23, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.4, 'numReviews': 127, 'meter': 53}, 'boxOffice': '$0.4M', 'consensus': \"As unkempt and inscrutable as Joaquin Phoenix himself, I'm Still Here raises some interesting questions about its subject, as well as the nature of celebrity, but it fails to answer many of them convincingly.\", 'rotten': 60, 'production': 'Magnolia Pictures', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 17, 19, 10, 24), 'fresh': 67}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNTE5NjA2NzM5Ml5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODg5NTE3Mw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 9, 16, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '1 win & 2 nominations.'}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'cast': ['Joaquin Phoenix', 'Antony Langdon', 'Carey Perloff', 'Larry McHale'], 'directors': ['Casey Affleck'], 'runtime': 108}\n",
