            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13caf29313caabd7e780'), 'plot': 'After a series of pipe dream ventures go belly up, retired pro soccer player Kim Won-kang happens to visit East Timor, where he finds children playing the game barefoot on rocky pitches. ...', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 121, 'cast': ['Gabriel Da Costa', 'Junior Da Costa', 'Zefancy Diaz', 'Osvaldo Freitas'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjEyMjMxNjE3Ml5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMDgxMDUxNQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'A Barefoot Dream', 'fullplot': \"After a series of pipe dream ventures go belly up, retired pro soccer player Kim Won-kang happens to visit East Timor, where he finds children playing the game barefoot on rocky pitches. Sensing a new business opportunity on finding the country doesn't have a single sporting goods store, he embarks on a scheme to get rich quick by purveying athletic shoes to the unshod youngsters. Sadly, no one there can afford to pay $60 for a pair of shoes, even on a generous installment plan, and before he knows it, he is reduced to coaching a team of ragged 10-year-olds and prospects are looking grim.\", 'languages': ['Japanese', 'Indonesian', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 6, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Tae-gyun Kim'], 'writers': ['Kim Gwang Hun'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-29 00:00:26.687000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.2, 'votes': 275, 'id': 1583213}, 'countries': ['South Korea'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13caf29313caabd7e5df'), 'plot': 'Ernesto Bolta is the accountant of LEDA, a big agribusiness. Its founder, Amanzio Rastelli, appointed several of his relations to managerial positions and the firm decided quite lightly to ...', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 110, 'cast': ['Toni Servillo', 'Remo Girone', 'Sarah Felberbaum', 'Fausto Maria Sciarappa'], 'title': 'The Jewel', 'fullplot': 'Ernesto Bolta is the accountant of LEDA, a big agribusiness. Its founder, Amanzio Rastelli, appointed several of his relations to managerial positions and the firm decided quite lightly to think internationally and now it is heavily in debt. Luckily for the Rastellis, Bolta is on the watch. He uses all the tricks of his art to cook the books. But rushing headlong will not avoid the coming catastrophe...', 'languages': ['Italian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 3, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Andrea Molaioli'], 'writers': ['Andrea Molaioli', 'Ludovica Rampoldi', 'Gabriele Romagnoli'], 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 7, 'text': '5 wins & 7 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-07-18 00:30:00.770000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 806, 'id': 1582207}, 'countries': ['Italy', 'France'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13caf29313caabd7e606'), 'plot': 'A David and Goliath law drama about a drug-addicted lawyer who takes on a health supply corporation while battling his own personal demons.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 100, 'metacritic': 54, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Chris Evans', 'Mark Kassen', 'Marshall Bell', 'Brett Cullen'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTYzODIxNjAxNV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwOTcxNzQzNg@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Puncture', 'fullplot': 'Idealistic lawyers Mike Weiss and Paul Danziger are partners. Mike is a drug-addict and Paul is a family man with a pregnant wife. When nurse Vicky Rogers seeks them out, they learn that she contracted AIDS a couple of years ago when she was accidentally pinpricked with a contaminated needle by a violent patient. Vicky shows a retractable safety needle invented by engineer Jeffrey Matthew Dancort, who owns the Safety Point Company, but is unable to sell his product to any hospital from the United Medical group, apart from San Antonio Memorial. Danziger and Weiss accept the case and go to court against United Medical, defended by powerful lawyer Nathaniel Price. Soon, they see all the doors closed in their fight against the powerful mafia of the medical supply system.', 'languages': ['English', 'French'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 3, 15, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Adam Kassen', 'Mark Kassen'], 'writers': ['Paul Danziger (story)', 'Chris Lopata', 'Ela Thier (story)'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '2 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-13 00:28:33.293000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 17485, 'id': 1582248}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13caf29313caabd7e1b2'), 'plot': '\"The Baron\" wanted to commit the perfect heist involving 3 tons of money and no violence. For this he would need the right people willing to get 1 million dollars to take part in this job. ...', 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 101, 'cast': ['Milhem Cortaz', 'Eriberto Leèo', 'Hermila Guedes', 'Lima Duarte'], 'title': 'Federal Bank Heist', 'fullplot': '\"The Baron\" wanted to commit the perfect heist involving 3 tons of money and no violence. For this he would need the right people willing to get 1 million dollars to take part in this job. Based on true events, in 2005, 168,000,000 Brazilian Real (almost 80,000,000 US dollars) were stolen from a Brazilian Central Bank (Federal Reserve), making it the biggest peace-time robbery in history. It was perhaps the most audacious bank heist ever.', 'languages': ['Portuguese'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 7, 22, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Marcos Paulo'], 'writers': ['Rene Belmonte', 'Lucio Manfredi (collaborating writer)', 'Tais Moreno (research)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 8, 'text': '8 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-18 01:00:24.797000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.8, 'votes': 1498, 'id': 1579223}, 'countries': ['Brazil'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13caf29313caabd7e8ba'), 'plot': \"Young filmmakers document their colleague's budding online friendship with a young woman and her family which leads to an unexpected series of discoveries.\", 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 87, 'metacritic': 65, 'cast': ['Yaniv Schulman', 'Ariel Schulman', 'Henry Joost', 'Angela Wesselman-Pierce'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYzFkMjE5NDYtZTU1OS00MzRkLWI4NjYtM2YwODU5NmU0MzJmXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMTQxNzMzNDI@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Catfish', 'fullplot': \"In late 2007, filmmakers Ariel Schulman and Henry Joost sensed a story unfolding as they began to film the life of Ariel's brother, Nev. They had no idea that their project would lead to the most exhilarating and unsettling months of their lives. A reality thriller that is a shocking product of our times, Catfish is a riveting story of love, deception and grace within a labyrinth of online intrigue.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 10, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Henry Joost', 'Ariel Schulman'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 6, 'text': '2 wins & 6 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-21 00:44:50.080000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.1, 'votes': 32643, 'id': 1584016}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd7ee47'), 'plot': 'JW (Joel Kinnaman, Robocop, The Killing), the promising business student who became an organized coke smuggler in Easy Money, is serving hard time in prison and struggling to get back on an...', 'genres': ['Action', 'Crime', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 99, 'metacritic': 57, 'cast': ['Joel Kinnaman', 'Matias Varela', 'Dragomir Mrsic', 'Fares Fares'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTExMDc3NDgzNzFeQTJeQWpwZ15BbWU4MDI4MzU3MDEx._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Easy Money II: Hard to Kill', 'fullplot': \"JW (Joel Kinnaman, Robocop, The Killing), the promising business student who became an organized coke smuggler in Easy Money, is serving hard time in prison and struggling to get back on an honest path. There are glimmers of hope in his life - some venture capitalists are interested in a new piece of trading software he's developed, and while behind bars he's made peace with an old enemy. This all proves to be an illusion. On leave from prison, and back in contact with his former gang, JW learns that once you've walked in the shoes of a criminal there just may be no going back.\", 'languages': ['Swedish', 'Spanish', 'English', 'Serbian', 'Arabic', 'Croatian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 2, 14, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Babak Najafi'], 'writers': ['Maria Karlsson (screenplay)', 'Peter Birro (collaborating writer)', 'Babak Najafi (collaborating writer)', 'Fredrik Wikstrèm (collaborating writer)', 'Jens Lapidus (novels)'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '1 win & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-04 00:04:55.130000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.2, 'votes': 4853, 'id': 1588342}, 'countries': ['Sweden'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13caf29313caabd7e843'), 'plot': 'After losing his job, a middle-aged man reinvents himself by going back to college.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 98, 'metacritic': 41, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': ['Tom Hanks', 'Sarah Mahoney', 'Roxana Ortega', 'Randall Park'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYjQ4MzlmZDUtN2ViMi00ZTAwLWFkMmItNGRlZmM1NjQ1ZmJjXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMzI0NDc4ODY@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Larry Crowne', 'fullplot': \"Until he was downsized, affable, amiable Larry Crowne (Hanks) was a superstar team leader at the big-box company where he's worked since his time in the Navy. Underwater on his mortgage and unclear on what to do with his suddenly free days, Larry heads to his local college to start over. There he becomes part of a colorful community of outcasts, also-rans and the overlooked all trying to find a better future for themselves...often moving around town in a herd of scooters. In his public-speaking class, Larry develops an unexpected crush on his teacher Mercedes Tainot (Roberts), who has lost as much passion for teaching as she has for her husband. The simple guy who has every reason to think his life has stalled will come to learn an unexpected lesson: when you think everything worth having has passed you by, you just might discover your reason to live.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 7, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Tom Hanks'], 'writers': ['Tom Hanks', 'Nia Vardalos'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-28 00:07:09.160000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.0, 'votes': 44944, 'id': 1583420}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
