            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd7ee3f'), 'plot': 'Dispatched from his basement room on an errand for his widowed mother, slacker Jeff might discover his destiny (finally) when he spends the day with his unhappily married brother as he tracks his possibly adulterous wife.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 83, 'metacritic': 60, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Jason Segel', 'Ed Helms', 'Susan Sarandon', 'Judy Greer'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTgyNzQ0MjY5Ml5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNDgyNzkyNw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Jeff, Who Lives at Home', 'fullplot': 'Jeff, at 30, lives in his mom\\'s basement, unemployed, looking for signs about what to do with his life. He answers a wrong-number call for \"Kevin\". Later, on a bus, he sees someone wearing a jersey with \"Kevin\" on the back. Jeff follows him. Meanwhile, Jeff\\'s brother, Pat, a tone-deaf salesman, upsets his wife by buying a Porsche they cannot afford; Pat runs into Jeff soon after and they see Pat\\'s wife with another man. At her job, Jeff and Pat\\'s mom receives e-mails from a secret admirer; she tries to figure out who it is. Misunderstandings, errors, and confrontations abound. A backup on the Lake Pontchartrain Causeway brings things to a head.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 5, 11, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jay Duplass', 'Mark Duplass'], 'writers': ['Jay Duplass', 'Mark Duplass'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-19 00:28:21.297000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.5, 'votes': 53739, 'id': 1588334}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13caf29313caabd7e84f'), 'plot': 'The G.I. Joes are not only fighting their mortal enemy Cobra; they are forced to contend with threats from within the government that jeopardize their very existence.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Adventure', 'Sci-Fi'], 'runtime': 110, 'metacritic': 41, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': ['Dwayne Johnson', 'Jonathan Pryce', 'Byung-hun Lee', 'Elodie Yung'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNzk5ODM0OTQ0N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODg2ODE4OA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'G.I. Joe: Retaliation', 'fullplot': 'The G.I. Joe team is framed for crimes against the country by Zartan, disguised as the President, and Cobra Commander has all the world leaders under his influence, with their advanced warheads headed towards innocent populaces around the world. Outnumbered and outgunned, the surviving team members form a plan with their original leader, General Joseph Colton, to rescue the President and face off Cobra Commander, his accomplices and the world leaders.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 3, 28, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jon M. Chu'], 'writers': ['Rhett Reese', 'Paul Wernick'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 11, 'text': '1 win & 11 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-31 00:03:17.327000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.8, 'votes': 135182, 'id': 1583421}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd7ee2a'), 'plot': 'After a highly unusual zombie saves a still-living girl from an attack, the two form a relationship that sets in motion events that might transform the entire lifeless world.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Horror', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 98, 'metacritic': 59, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': ['Nicholas Hoult', 'Teresa Palmer', 'Analeigh Tipton', 'Rob Corddry'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQ4MjY2MjMzOV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMDUxNzIwOQ@@._V1._CR43,43.16667175292969,1298,1960.9999542236328_SX89_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Warm Bodies', 'fullplot': 'With much of the world\\'s population now an undead horde, R is a young and oddly introspective zombie. While fighting with and feeding on a human scavenger party, R meets Julie and feels an urge to protect her. What happens next is the beginning of a strangely warm relationship that allows R to begin regaining his humanity. As this change spreads through the local undead population like a virus, Julie and R eventually have to face a larger issue when the very nature of their friendship is challenged. Caught between the paranoid human forces and the ferocious \"Bonies\", zombies who are a mutual threat, R and Julie must find a way to bridge the differences of each side to fight for a better world no one thought possible.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 2, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jonathan Levine'], 'writers': ['Jonathan Levine (screenplay)', 'Isaac Marion (novel)'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 9, 'text': '1 win & 9 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-10 17:03:16.093000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 170737, 'id': 1588173}, 'countries': ['USA', 'Canada'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
