            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd8004e'), 'plot': '14th-century knights transport a suspected witch to a monastery, where monks deduce her powers could be the source of the Black Plague.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Adventure', 'Fantasy'], 'runtime': 95, 'metacritic': 28, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': ['Nicolas Cage', 'Ron Perlman', 'Stephen Campbell Moore', 'Stephen Graham'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMzc3MjYxNzg2N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzQyMTkwNA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Season of the Witch', 'fullplot': \"A 14th century Crusader returns to a homeland devastated by the Black Plague. A beleaguered church, deeming sorcery the culprit of the plague, commands the two knights to transport an accused witch to a remote abbey, where monks will perform a ritual in hopes of ending the pestilence. A priest, a grieving knight, a disgraced itinerant and a headstrong youth who can only dream of becoming a knight join a mission troubled by mythically hostile wilderness and fierce contention over the fate of the girl. When the embattled party arrives at the abbey, a horrific discovery jeopardises the knight's pledge to ensure the girl fair treatment, and pits them against an inexplicably powerful and destructive force.\", 'languages': ['English', 'Latin'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 1, 7, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Dominic Sena'], 'writers': ['Bragi F. Schut'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-11 02:15:46.647000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.4, 'votes': 71683, 'id': 479997}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.seasonofthewitchfilm.com', 'viewer': {'rating': 2.7, 'numReviews': 79596, 'meter': 31}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2011, 6, 28, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 3.6, 'numReviews': 116, 'meter': 9}, 'boxOffice': '$24.8M', 'consensus': 'Slow, cheap-looking, and dull, Season of the Witch fails even as unintentional comedy.', 'rotten