            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd80483'), 'plot': \"While on a trip to Paris with his fiancèe's family, a nostalgic screenwriter finds himself mysteriously going back to the 1920s every day at midnight.\", 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 94, 'metacritic': 81, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': ['Owen Wilson', 'Rachel McAdams', 'Kurt Fuller', 'Mimi Kennedy'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTM4NjY1MDQwMl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNTI3Njg3NA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Midnight in Paris', 'fullplot': \"Gil and Inez travel to Paris as a tag-along vacation on her parents' business trip. Gil is a successful Hollywood writer but is struggling on his first novel. He falls in love with the city and thinks they should move there after they get married, but Inez does not share his romantic notions of the city or the idea that the 1920s was the golden age. When Inez goes off dancing with her friends, Gil takes a walk at midnight and discovers what could be the ultimate source of inspiration for writing. Gil's daily walks at midnight in Paris could take him closer to the heart of the city but further from the woman he's about to marry.\", 'languages': ['English', 'French', 'Spanish', 'German'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 6, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Woody Allen'], 'writers': ['Woody Allen'], 'awards': {'wins': 25, 'nominations': 80, 'text': 'Won 1 Oscar. Another 24 wins & 80 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-24 00:19:23.760000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.7, 'votes': 273589, 'id': 1605783}, 'countries': ['Spain', 'USA', 'France'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd8006a'), 'plot': 'Muhad, a Muslim boy from Afghanistan, attends college in California, where he falls in love with an American journalism student, Victoria. Shortly after, his father suffers a stroke and ...', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 90, 'title': 'The Son of an Afghan Farmer', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNjkzMzEyNTU2OV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzA1NDAwNg@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['USA'], 'fullplot': 'Muhad, a Muslim boy from Afghanistan, attends college in California, where he falls in love with an American journalism student, Victoria. Shortly after, his father suffers a stroke and Muhad must return home to tend to the family farm. As time passes, most of the crops are wiped out by the ongoing drought. Muhad is forced to head North with the rest of the farmers to harvest the poppies. Victoria has settled into her new life as a journalist for a local newspaper in San Francisco. When she follows a lead on a story about the ongoing war on drugs in Afghanistan, she is surprised to find her once innocent, first love is now a major player in the opium poppy trade.', 'languages': ['English'], 'cast': ['Tui Asau', 'Jamie Tisdale', 'Maya Hazen', 'Garen Boyajian'], 'directors': ['Mathew Levin II'], 'writers': ['Mathew Levin II (original story and script)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-03-05 01:45:15.280000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.4, 'votes': 37, 'id': 1602575}, 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd801b3'), 'plot': 'A serial killer is preying on the rich and influential, exposing their sexual proclivities, dismembering them and dumping them and their severed body parts in various locations around ...', 'genres': ['Thriller'], 'runtime': 99, 'cast': ['Arak Amornsupasiri', 'Sonthaya Chitmanee', 'Jessica Pasaphan', 'Chatchai Plengpanich'], 'num_mflix_comments': 3, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTk0MTYzMzQ0MF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNDM3ODcxMzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Slice', 'fullplot': \"A serial killer is preying on the rich and influential, exposing their sexual proclivities, dismembering them and dumping them and their severed body parts in various locations around Thailand. The police officer on the case is not even close to finding the killer, but given an ultimatum to solve it in 15 days, Papa Chin (Chatchai Plenpanich) turns to the one man he doesn't want to use -- an imprisoned hitman named Tai (Arak Amornsupasiri), who thinks the killer is a friend of his from childhood. Tai let out of prison while his girlfriend Noi is kept under close watch by Chin. Tai heads back to his hometown to search for clues about where his old friend might be. As he recalls his childhood and friendship with the troubled boy Nut, the events of the present day crystallize until Tai is confronted with a shocking reality.\", 'languages': ['Thai'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2009, 10, 22, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Kongkiat Khomsiri'], 'writers': ['Kongkiat Khomsiri (screenplay)', 'Wisit Sasanatieng (story)'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 11, 'text': '3 wins & 11 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-10 17:05:46.460000000', 'year': 2009, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 447, 'id': 1603807}, 'countries': ['Thailand'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd80583'), 'plot': 'In World War II-era Korea, rival runners, one Korean (Jang Dong-gun) and one Japanese (Joe Odagiri), go to war together against the Soviets.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Drama', 'History'], 'runtime': 137, 'metacritic': 30, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Dong-gun Jang', 'Joe Odagiri', 'Bingbing Fan', 'In-kwon Kim'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjM2MTI4OTc5OF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNDk1MTAzMjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'My Way', 'fullplot': \"Inspired by a true story. Jun Shik works for Tatsuo's grandfather's farm while Korea is colonized by Japan, but he has a dream to participate in Tokyo Olympics as a marathon runner. Tatsuo also aims to become a marathon runner, so the two are in rivalry. But war breaks out and they both are forced to enlist in the army. Tatsuo becomes the head of defense in Jun Shik's unit and he devises a scheme but fails. Jun Shik and Tatsuo are captured by the Soviets. They run away but soon are captured by Germans and forced to separate. In 1944, they meet again at the shores of Normandy.\", 'languages': ['Korean', 'German', 'Japanese', 'Mandarin', 'Russian', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 4, 20, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Je-kyu Kang'], 'writers': ['Je-kyu Kang', 'Byung-in Kim (screenplay)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-17 04:39:33.777000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.8, 'votes': 6121, 'id': 1606384}, 'countries': ['South Korea'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd7fff5'), 'plot': 'Since 2007, the Hong Kong health authorities have implemented an anti-smoking law that bans people from smoking in all indoor areas, including offices, restaurants, bars, and karaoke ...', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 104, 'cast': ['Miriam Chin Wah Yeung', 'Shawn Yue', 'Singh Hartihan Bitto', 'Yat Ning Chan'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjJmNGQ1YTUtM2M0MS00YmIyLTljYmUtNTJmYzc3NWRlOThlXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNzI1NzMxNzM@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Love in a Puff', 'fullplot': 'Since 2007, the Hong Kong health authorities have implemented an anti-smoking law that bans people from smoking in all indoor areas, including offices, restaurants, bars, and karaoke lounges. Office smokers now have to take their cigarette breaks on the streets outside, which has led to groups of smokers from the same building bonding together in cliques known as \"hot pot packs.\" In an alley packed with loudmouth co-workers spreading the daily gossip, Jimmy, a mild-mannered advertising executive, meets cosmetics salesgirl Cherie. An awkward flirtation ensues amidst their afternoon nicotine rush. As their mutual infatuation intensifies, the couple moves farther and farther away from the rest of the \"hot pot pack\" into their own private alley, where they have conversations of unexpected emotional depth. As smoke gets in their eyes, one thing leads to another', 'languages': ['Cantonese'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 3, 25, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Ho-Cheung Pang'], 'writers': ['Heiward Mak', 'Ho-Cheung Pang'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '2 wins & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-03 00:53:34.553000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.3, 'votes': 1432, 'id': 1602479}, 'countries': ['Hong Kong'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd7fff9'), 'plot': \"Manhattan couple Marion and Mingus, who each have children from prior relationships, find their comfortable family dynamic jostled by a visit from Marion's relatives.\", 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 96, 'metacritic': 61, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Chris Rock', 'Julie Delpy', 'Albert Delpy', 'Alexia Landeau'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjI5NTU2MDgyNl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzk4NDI5Nw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': '2 Days in New York', 'fullplot': \"Marion (Delpy) has broken up with Jack (Two Days in Paris) and now lives in New York with their child. But when her family decides to come visit her, she's unaware that the different cultural background held by her new American boyfriend Mingus (Rock), her eccentric father, and her sister Rose who decided to bring her ex-boyfriend along for the trip, added to her upcoming photo exhibition, will make up for an explosive mix.\", 'languages': ['English', 'French', 'Italian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 3, 28, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Julie Delpy'], 'writers': ['Julie Delpy (scenario)', 'Alexia Landeau (scenario)', 'Alexandre Nahon (participation)'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-05 00:30:11.143000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.0, 'votes': 11179, 'id': 1602472}, 'countries': ['France', 'Germany', 'Belgium'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
