            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd8064f'), 'plot': 'Five best friends, all married, decide to share a loft apartment.', 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 108, 'cast': ['Katja Herbers', 'Barry Atsma', 'Marwan Kenzari', 'Anna Drijver'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNDEwMzEwODcxM15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNjgwNTUwNTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Loft', 'fullplot': 'Five best friends, all married, decide to share a loft apartment. In this loft they meet their mistresses and conquests. Everything seems perfect, until one morning the body of an unknown young woman is found in the loft. The group of friends begin to suspect each other and it soon becomes clear that they know far less about each other than they had initially thought.', 'languages': ['Dutch'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 12, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Antoinette Beumer'], 'writers': ['Bart De Pauw (screenplay)', 'Saskia Noort (screenplay)'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '3 wins & 4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-18 00:07:49.687000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 4137, 'id': 1606789}, 'countries': ['Netherlands'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
