            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ccf29313caabd81793'), 'plot': 'A biography of the civil-rights activist and labor organizer Cesar Chavez.', 'genres': ['Biography'], 'runtime': 102, 'metacritic': 51, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': ['Kerry Adra', 'Maynor Alvarado', 'Yancey Arias', 'Wes Bentley'], 'num_mflix_comments': 3, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTM5NTkyOTMxN15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwODA1MDYwMTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Cesar Chavez', 'fullplot': \"Chronicling the birth of a modern American movement, Cesar Chavez tells the story of the famed civil rights leader and labor organizer torn between his duties as a husband and father and his commitment to securing a living wage for farm workers. Passionate but soft-spoken, Chavez embraced non-violence as he battled greed and prejudice in his struggle to bring dignity to people. Chavez inspired millions of Americans from all walks of life who never worked on a farm to fight for social justice. His triumphant journey is a remarkable testament to the power of one individual's ability to change the world.\", 'languages': ['English', 'Spanish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 3, 28, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Diego Luna'], 'writers': ['Keir Pearson (screenplay)', 'Timothy J. Sexton'], 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '5 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-15 02:07:48.153000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.4, 'votes': 2276, 'id': 1621046}, 'countries': ['USA', 'Mexico'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cbf29313caabd8165b'), 'plot': 'A corrupt police officer faces challenges from his family, gangsters and politicians.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Comedy', 'Crime'], 'runtime': 126, 'cast': ['Salman Khan', 'Sonakshi Sinha', 'Vinod Khanna', 'Dimple Kapadia'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTMyOTQ0Mzg2Ml5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMDcyOTM5NA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Dabangg', 'fullplot': 'Set in Uttar Pradesh, Chulbul Pandey is a young boy who lives with his mother Naini, stepfather Prajapati, and younger half-brother Makkhi. Chulbul is constantly angry that his step-father is always partial towards his own biological son. 21 years later, Chulbul is a rowdy, mischievous, and sometimes crooked cop, who refers to himself as \"Robin Hood.\" He does everything in his own indomitable way; whether it\\'s dealing with corrupt politician and thug Chedi Singh, fighting a family feud, or romancing stunning Rajo.', 'languages': ['Hindi'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 9, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Abhinav Kashyap'], 'writers': ['Dilip Shukla', 'Abhinav Kashyap'], 'awards': {'wins': 18, 'nominations': 8, 'text': '18 wins & 8 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-13 00:36:53.323000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.3, 'votes': 17625, 'id': 1620719}, 'countries': ['India'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ccf29313caabd817a0'), 'plot': 'Two turkeys from opposite sides of the tracks must put aside their differences and team up to travel back in time to change the course of history - and get turkey off the holiday menu for good.', 'genres': ['Animation', 'Adventure', 'Comedy'], 'runtime': 91, 'metacritic': 38, 'rated': 'PG', 'cast': ['Owen Wilson', 'Woody Harrelson', 'Amy Poehler', 'George Takei'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNjE0NjIwMzAwOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwOTIyMzMzMDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Free Birds', 'fullplot': \"After years of fruitless warning of his farmyard brethren of the coming Thanksgiving doom, Reggie the Turkey finds himself spared as the annual Pardoned Turkey. However, Reggie's easy life is disrupted by Jake, a fanatic turkey who drags him along with the insane idea of going back in time to make sure turkeys are not part of the first Thanksgiving. Through foolhardiness and luck, the pair manage to take an experimental time machine to do just that. Now in 1621 at the Plymouth colony, Reggie and Jake find themselves in the middle of a turkey clan's struggle for survival. In doing so, their preconceptions of the world and themselves are challenged forever in a conflict from which the world will never be the same.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 11, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jimmy Hayward'], 'writers': ['Scott Mosier (screenplay)', 'Jimmy Hayward (screenplay)', 'David I. Stern (story)', 'John J. Strauss (story)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-25 00:07:54.227000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.9, 'votes': 16345, 'id': 1621039}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
