            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ccf29313caabd8265f'), 'plot': 'Two children living in different countries are visited nightly by a faceless being who wants to take possession of them.', 'genres': ['Horror', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 100, 'metacritic': 45, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Clive Owen', 'Carice van Houten', 'Daniel Brèhl', 'Pilar Lèpez de Ayala'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjI1ODQ4NTIyOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzIwOTUzNw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Intruders', 'fullplot': \"In Madrid, the boy Juan is terrified by the monster Hollowface and his mother is unable to protect him so summons Father Antonio to exorcise the monster from their lives. In London, the construction worker John Farrow is very close to his teenage daughter Mia. One day, Mia is spending the day at her grandparents' house in the countryside with her mother Susanna and she finds a box with the story of Hollowface hidden in a tree. Soon Mia sees the monster Hollowface in the closet of her bedroom and John defends her. When they are attacked for the second time, the security camera that John has installed does not show any intruder. Are Mia and John delusional?\", 'languages': ['English', 'Spanish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 10, 7, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Juan Carlos Fresnadillo'], 'writers': ['Nicolès Casariego (screenplay)', 'Jaime Marques (screenplay)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-17 04:52:03.043000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.4, 'votes': 16571, 'id': 1634121}, 'countries': ['USA', 'UK', 'Spain'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ccf29313caabd8297f'), 'plot': 'Sara, 14, is the only daughter of well-off parents. She is often alone at home as her parents are kept very busy with their jobs. Sara is obsessed by her weight and is prepared to do ...', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'countries': ['Italy'], 'cast': ['Micol Donghi', 'Isa Barzizza', 'Sonia Bergamasco', 'Benedetta Gargari'], 'title': 'Maledimiele', 'fullplot': 'Sara, 14, is the only daughter of well-off parents. She is often alone at home as her parents are kept very busy with their jobs. Sara is obsessed by her weight and is prepared to do anything to become thinner. She uses all kinds of strategies to avoid eating and when she becomes bulimic she swallows all she finds within her reach and makes herself vomit afterwards. The troubled teenager draws into herself more and more and gradually finds herself cut off from others. Her friends are the first to become aware of her condition...', 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 4, 19, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Marco Pozzi'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-03 01:11:09.913000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.0, 'votes': 30, 'id': 1637699}, 'type': 'movie'}\n",
