            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ccf29313caabd825a7'), 'plot': 'A weekend at a lake house in the Louisiana Gulf turns into a nightmare for seven vacationers as they are subjected to shark attacks.', 'genres': ['Horror', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 90, 'metacritic': 22, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': ['Sara Paxton', 'Dustin Milligan', 'Chris Carmack', 'Katharine McPhee'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjA3Mzc0OTIwOV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzQxOTczNQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Shark Night 3D', 'fullplot': \"When 7 college friends pack their swim suits for a weekend of fun-in-the-sun activities at their friend Sara's lake house, they think it will be the perfect vacation. But the tables immediately turn when the lead football star, Malik, gets his arm ripped off during a water skiing accident. While the friends are to believe his wound was a freak accident, they soon come to discover that there was a primal attack involving a shark. Now while they think that one shark is no problem, they soon come to the realization that 15 species of sharks are lurking in the water, and with no form of boat or transportation, and no signals for phone's, the group of seven now face a fate they would never imagine. Being fed to these sharks by crooks for real life footage on an Internet website.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 9, 2, 0, 0), 'directors': ['David R. Ellis'], 'writers': ['Will Hayes', 'Jesse Studenberg'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-15 00:54:46.083000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 4.0, 'votes': 19655, 'id': 1633356}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ccf29313caabd82911'), 'plot': '3 high school seniors throw a birthday party to make a name for themselves. As the night progresses, things spiral out of control as word of the party spreads.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Crime'], 'runtime': 88, 'metacritic': 48, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Thomas Mann', 'Oliver Cooper', 'Jonathan Daniel Brown', 'Dax Flame'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTc1MTk0Njg4OF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODc0ODkyNw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Project X', 'fullplot': \"It's Thomas Kubb's 17th birthday and all he wants to do is throw a small party with some friends to help raise his social status and maybe even get lucky. But when his best friend Costa starts calling radio stations and putting ads up on Cregs list, you can be sure that this party is going to get reaply out of hand really fast.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 3, 2, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Nima Nourizadeh'], 'writers': ['Matt Drake (screenplay)', 'Michael Bacall (screenplay)', 'Michael Bacall (story)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-01 00:42:46.567000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 145649, 'id': 1636826}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ccf29313caabd829e0'), 'plot': 'Based on an acclaimed graphic novel, Mars & Avril is set in Montreal of the future, at the dawn of the first human landing on Mars, and tells the story of a musician who becomes obsessed with his muse.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Sci-Fi'], 'runtime': 90, 'cast': ['Jacques Languirand', 'Caroline Dhavernas', 'Paul Ahmarani', 'Robert Lepage'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjEwMTY3MTA5MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMDA5OTg2Nw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Mars et Avril', 'fullplot': \"Montreal, the future. Elderly jazz musician Jacob Obus (Jacques Languirand) still draws in audiences with his mesmerizing performances, playing instruments based on female models, designed by his much younger pal Arthur (Paul Ahmarani). The latest model, intriguing artist Avril (Caroline Dhavernas), entices both Arthur and Jacob. In the resulting love triangle, the old musician is ultimately victorious and appears to be in love for the first time in his life. But then Avril is accidentally transported to Mars, where the first manned mission just happened to land. Enter Eugène Spaak (Robert Lepage), inventor, cosmologist and Arthur's father, who unveils a new theory about man's desire to reach Mars and helps Jacob find the true meaning of life and love.\", 'languages': ['French'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 10, 5, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Martin Villeneuve'], 'writers': ['Martin Villeneuve'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 10, 'text': '1 win & 10 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-16 11:49:58.913000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.9, 'votes': 433, 'id': 1638277}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
