            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cdf29313caabd8530c'), 'fullplot': \"Dino is a cat that leads a double life. By day, he lives with Zoe, a little girl whose mother, Jeanne, is a police officer. By night, he works with Nico, a burglar with a big heart. Zoe has plunged herself into silence following her father's murder at the hands of gangster Costa. One day, Dino the cat brings Zoe a very valuable bracelet. Lucas, Jeanne's second-in-command, notices this bracelet is part of a jewelery collection that has been stolen. One night, Zoe decides to follow Dino. On the way, she overhears some gangsters and discovers that her nanny is part of the gangsters' team.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 7644, 'id': 1673702}, 'year': 2010, 'plot': \"In Paris, a cat who lives a secret life as a cat burglar's aide must come to the rescue of Zoe, the little girl he lives with, after she falls into a gangster's clutches.\", 'genres': ['Animation', 'Crime', 'Family'], 'rated': 'PG', 'metacritic': 63, 'title': 'A Cat in Paris', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-12 00:32:26.703000000', 'languages': ['French'], 'writers': ['Alain Gagnol (screenplay)', 'Jacques-Rèmy Girerd (dialogue)', 'Alain Gagnol (dialogue)', 'Michael Sinterniklaas (english adaptation)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.uneviedechat-lefilm.fr/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.7, 'numReviews': 6157, 'meter': 72}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 10, 9, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.8, 'numReviews': 61, 'meter': 82}, 'boxOffice': '$0.3M', 'consensus': 'A Cat in Paris depicts a stylish, imaginative world with a wonderful soundtrack and Hitchcockian overtones.', 'rotten': 11, 'production': 'Gèbèka Films', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 22, 18, 9, 11), 'fresh': 50}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTAzODU0NDExMTNeQTJeQWpwZ15BbWU3MDk2NjMxMzc@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 12, 15, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 5, 'text': '