            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cdf29313caabd858c7'), 'plot': 'The child-duo Rico and Oskar, one of them is quite more sluggish, but precisely because of fantasy and own world view; the other one is a smart whiz, but scared for life.', 'genres': ['Adventure', 'Comedy', 'Family'], 'runtime': 97, 'cast': ['Anton Petzold', 'Juri Winkler', 'Karoline Herfurth', 'Axel Prahl'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOTE0NzczNTQ3OF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDkyNDQ5NTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Pasta Detectives', 'fullplot': \"RICO (10) is an unusual boy. Sometimes he's being laughed at because he mixes things up in his head and doesn't know his left from his right. But Rico is brilliant at noticing the little things. Like a piece of pasta lying on the pavement. Or the strange on-goings in the apartment block where he lives. But it isn't until his new friends, the gifted but anxious OSKAR (8), is kidnapped that Rico gets the chance to put all his special skills - and tenacity - to the test.\", 'languages': ['German'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 7, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Neele Leana Vollmar'], 'writers': ['Christian Lerch (screenplay)', 'Andreas Bradler (screenplay)', 'Klaus Dèring (screenplay)', 'Andreas Steinhèfel (novel)'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '3 wins & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-08 00:50:48.757000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.2, 'votes': 147, 'id': 1679276}, 'countries': ['Germany'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 2.2, 'numReviews': 2}, 'production': '20th Century Fox Pictures International', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 11, 18, 11, 4)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cdf29313caabd85513'), 'fullplot': 'In Paris, the aristocratic and intellectual Philippe is a quadriplegic millionaire who is interviewing candidates for the position of his carer, with his red-haired secretary Magalie. Out of the blue, the rude African Driss cuts the line of candidates and brings a document from the Social Security and asks Phillipe to sign it to prove that he is seeking a job position so he can receive his unemployment benefit. Philippe challenges Driss, offering him a trial period of one month to gain experience helping him. Then Driss can decide whether he would like to stay with him or not. Driss accepts the challenge and moves to the mansion, changing the boring life of Phillipe and his employees.', 'imdb': {'rating': 8.6, 'votes': 421017, 'id': 1675434}, 'year': 2011, 'plot': 'After he becomes a quadriplegic from a paragliding accident, an aristocrat hires a young man from the projects to be his caregiver.', 'genres': ['Biography', 'Comedy', 'Drama'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 57, 'title': 'The Intouchables', 'lastupdated': '2015-08-22 00:06:37.593000000', 'languages': ['French', 'English'], 'writers': ['Olivier Nakache', 'Eric Toledano'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://weinsteinco.com/sites/the-intouchables/', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.3, 'numReviews': 43299, 'meter': 93}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 3, 5, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.7, 'numReviews': 119, 'meter': 75}, 'boxOffice': '$13.2M', 'consensus': 'It handles its potentially prickly subject matter with kid gloves, but Intouchables gets by thanks to its strong cast and some remarkably sensitive direction.', 'rotten': 30, 'production': 'The Weinstein Company', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 12, 17, 48, 29), 'fresh': 89}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTYxNDA3MDQwNl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNTU4Mzc1Nw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 2, 0, 0), 'aw