            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cdf29313caabd857cc'), 'plot': \"The untold stories of female jazz and big band instrumentalists and their journeys from the late 1930's to the present day.\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography', 'History'], 'runtime': 81, 'metacritic': 90, 'cast': ['Geri Allen', 'Jane Ira Bloom', 'Clora Bryant', 'Terry Lyne Carrington'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQwODM4ODYzNV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODY4OTI1Ng@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Girls in the Band', 'fullplot': \"In the world of jazz, women have long been marginalized as singers or piano players. Little has ever been documented about the enormously talented female trumpet players, saxophonist and drummers who struggled for recognition but were cut off from any meaningful employment by men who didn't want women on their bandstands. This film traces the history of the all-girl bands and the struggles of the handful who broke through the male bastions, and brings us into the present day, where brilliantly gifted young women are going toe-to-toe with the finest jazz musicians of their day.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 5, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Judy Chaikin'], 'writers': ['Judy Chaikin', 'Edward Osei-Gyimah'], 'awards': {'wins': 4, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '4 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2014-11-23 23:02:40.547000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.9, 'votes': 40, 'id': 1677642}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.thegirlsintheband.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.4, 'numReviews': 133, 'meter': 91}, 'critic': {'rating': 8.0, 'numReviews': 10, 'meter': 100}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 4, 19, 19, 19, 31), 'rotten': 0, 'production': 'Independent Pictures', 'fresh': 10}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cdf29313caabd85d07'), 'plot': 'Ion Barladeanu is on his way to becoming an important contemporary artist, but in May 2008 he was still a tramp on the streets of Bucharest.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 60, 'cast': ['Ion Barladeanu'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'title': 'The World According to Ion B.', 'fullplot': \"A homeless man in his sixties has lived for years on a mattress among the bins in the courtyard of a Bucharest apartment building. His name is Ion Barladeanu and he is currently one of the most sought-after modern Romanian artists. In an old suitcase, he has stashed his brilliant collages, which were displayed at an exhibition in London in 2009, right beside the work of Andy Warhol and Marcel Duchamp. A year later, he had a solo exhibition dedicated to his work in Paris. Without the help of gallery owner Dan Popescu, however, Ion Barladeanu's fairytale progression from the streets of Bucharest to prestigious international galleries would have been unthinkable. Alexander Nanau's sensitive portrait introduces us to a man whose difficult journey through life has seen him hit rock bottom. Nonetheless, he is also a distinctive artist, who manages to mock human pettiness and the cruelty of the Ceausescu regime in collages steeped in irony.\", 'languages': ['Romanian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2009, 12, 18, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Alexander Nanau'], 'writers': ['Alexander Nanau'], 'awards': {'wins': 4, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '4 wins & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-06 01:05:14.853000000', 'year': 2009, 'imdb': {'rating': 8.1, 'votes': 258, 'id': 1683890}, 'countries': ['Romania'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.5, 'numReviews': 6}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 16, 18, 15, 12)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cdf29313caabd8603d'), 'plot': \"When history has a different script from the one in your films, who wouldn't invent a country to fool themselves? The collapsing sets of Tito's Hollywood of the East take us on a journey ...\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'History'], 'runtime': 100, 'title': 'Cinema Komunisto', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTExNTI1NzIwNDFeQTJeQWpwZ15BbWU4MDE1MzA2OTEx._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['Serbia'], 'fullplot': \"When history has a different script from the one in your films, who wouldn't invent a country to fool themselves? The collapsing sets of Tito's Hollywood of the East take us on a journey through the rise and fall of the illusion called Yugoslavia. Exploring the ruins of the forgotten film sets and talking to directors, producers, policemen and Tito's projectionist about the state run film studios and Tito's personal love for cinema and it's stars, 'Cinema Komunisto' uses film clips to go back to the film when 'His story' became the official history.\", 'languages': ['Serbo-Croatian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 2, 2, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Mila Turajlic'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-21 00:57:41.970000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.9, 'votes': 351, 'id': 1686660}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.cinemakomunisto.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.9, 'numReviews': 57}, 'critic': {'rating': 6.9, 'numReviews': 7, 'meter': 100}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 5, 26, 18, 59, 17), 'rotten': 0, 'production': 'Music Box Films', 'fresh': 7}}\n",
