            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cef29313caabd86112'), 'plot': 'A documentary shot by film-makers all over the world that serves as a time capsule to show future generations what it was like to be alive on the twenty-fourth of July, 2010.', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 95, 'metacritic': 58, 'cast': ['Hiroaki Aikawa', 'Cindy Baer', 'Teagan Bentley', 'Ester Brym'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjE4MDQ2NTM3Nl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMDQ1MDY1NQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Life in a Day', 'fullplot': 'What do you get when you ask the people of the world to chronicle a single day in their lives? You get 80,000 submissions, 4500 hours of footage, from 192 countries. Kevin Macdonald has taken this raw material, all shot on July 24, 2010, and created a 90-minute paean to what it means to be human in the world today.', 'languages': ['English', 'Italian', 'Japanese', 'German', 'Spanish', 'Indonesian', 'Balinese', 'Portuguese', 'Ukrainian', 'Vietnamese', 'Creole', 'Catalan', 'Dutch', 'Bengali', 'Masai', 'Hindi', 'Arabic', 'Quechua', 'Russian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 1, 27, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Ferran Brooks', 'Kevin Macdonald', 'Alejandro Romeo', 'Hiroaki Aikawa', 'Natalia Andreadis', 'Jack Attridge', 'Cristina Bocchialini', 'Zillah Bowes', 'Andrea Dalla Costa', 'Lisa Cottrell-Bentley', 'Alejo Crisèstomo', 'Ayman El Gazwy', 'Jane Haubrich', 'Soma Helmi', 'Jennifer M. Howd', 'Aditya Kolli', 'Gabor Kukucska', 'Francesco La Regina', 'Frederic Lumiere', 'Marek Mackovic', 'Linda Matarasso', 'Kevin McMahon', 'Joseph Michael', 'Joaquin Montalvan', 'Lilit Movsisyan', 'Emmanuelle Pickett', 'Alaa Sheikh Hassan', 'Marcus Tedenryd', 'Zuqy'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '1 win & 4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-07 00:31:59.347000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.7, 'votes': 12535, 'id': 1687247}, 'countries': ['UK', 'USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes'