            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd88822'), 'fullplot': 'THE BUTCHER, THE CHEF AND THE SWORDSMAN follows the journey of a mystical blade as it passes through the hands of three ambitious men. As the interwoven story unfolds, they find that the blade possesses the power to dramatically change the fate of each of its owners. The Butcher is a simple man in love with a beautiful courtesan, but is rebuffed each time he approaches her. The Chef is a handsome loner obsessed with seeking vengeance for the slaughter of his family. The Swordsman, the son of a legendary warrior, is consumed by the desire to eclipse his father in both power and fame. Their stories comes full circle as each man takes possession of the mystical blade and discovers its double edge--- the great power it bestows is matched by even greater danger.', 'imdb': {'rating': 5.8, 'votes': 512, 'id': 1722513}, 'year': 2010, 'plot': 'A tale of revenge, honor and greed follows a group of misfits that gets involved with a kitchen cleaver made from the top five swords of the martial arts world in this wild and brash action comedy.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Comedy'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'metacritic': 25, 'title': 'The Butcher, the Chef, and the Swordsman', 'lastupdated': '2015-08-25 00:16:42.447000000', 'languages': ['Mandarin'], 'writers': ['Changhe An (short story)', 'Luoshan Ma (screenplay)', 'Que Tang (screenplay)', 'Wuershan (screenplay)', 'Jiajia Zhang (screenplay)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://legacy.davidsuzuki.org', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 188, 'meter': 85}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 2, 13, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 7.1, 'numReviews': 17, 'meter': 82}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 16, 18, 54, 9), 'rotten': 3, 'production': 'Shadow Distribution', 'fresh': 14}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTg3NTM0NDA1MF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzY3Nzk1NA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'released': datetime.datetime(20