            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd89360'), 'fullplot': 'The Earth was ravaged by the Formics, an alien race seemingly determined to destroy humanity. Seventy years later, the people of Earth remain banded together to prevent their own annihilation from this technologically superior alien species. Ender Wiggin, a quiet but brilliant boy, may become the savior of the human race. He is separated from his beloved sister and his terrifying brother and brought to battle school in orbit around earth. He will be tested and honed into an empathetic killer who begins to despise what he does as he learns to fight in hopes of saving Earth and his family.', 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 167857, 'id': 1731141}, 'year': 2013, 'plot': 'Young Ender Wiggin is recruited by the International Military to lead the fight against the Formics, a genocidal alien race which nearly annihilated the human race in a previous invasion.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Sci-Fi'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'metacritic': 51, 'title': \"Ender's Game\", 'lastupdated': '2015-08-18 00:55:56.890000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Gavin Hood (screenplay)', \"Orson Scott Card (based on the book Ender's Game by)\"], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 13, 18, 11, 30)}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjAzMzI5OTgzMl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMTU5MTAwMDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 11, 1, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 6, 'text': '1 win & 6 nominations.'}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'cast': ['Asa Butterfield', 'Harrison Ford', 'Hailee Steinfeld', 'Abigail Breslin'], 'directors': ['Gavin Hood'], 'runtime': 114}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd89079'), 'plot': 'Die Verlorene Zeit (Remembrance) depicts a remarkable love story that blossomed amidst the terror of a German concentration camp in 1944 Poland. This impossible passion fuels the courage of...', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Romance', 'War'], 'runtime': 105, 'cast': ['Alice Dwyer', 'Dagmar Manzel', 'Mateusz Damiecki', 'Susanne Lothar'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTM5NTk0NzA3MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwOTk1MzAxNQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Remembrance', 'fullplot': 'Die Verlorene Zeit (Remembrance) depicts a remarkable love story that blossomed amidst the terror of a German concentration camp in 1944 Poland. This impossible passion fuels the courage of a Polish prisoner who manages to rescue his Jewish girlfriend. Against all odds, they escape the camp and survive a treacherous journey to freedom. But during the chaos of the end of the war, they are forcibly separated and each is convinced that the other has died. More than thirty years later in New York, the happily married 52-year-old woman accidentally finds out that her former Polish lover is still alive. And she has to see him again.', 'languages': ['German', 'English', 'Polish', 'Russian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Anna Justice'], 'writers': ['Pamela Katz (screenplay)', 'Anna Justice (collaborator on screenplay)', 'Pamela Katz'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-06 00:10:07.197000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.2, 'votes': 1153, 'id': 1728620}, 'countries': ['Germany'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd892de'), 'plot': 'A documentary on the late Elia Kazan.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 60, 'cast': ['Martin Scorsese', 'Elia Kazan', 'Elias Koteas'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQ0Mzk2NDIxN15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNTk4NDI5Mw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'A Letter to Elia', 'fullplot': 'Director Martin Scorsese speaks candidly and passionately about one of his formative filmmaking influences: the late Elia Kazan. Utilizing precisely chosen clips from Kazan\\'s signature films including \"On the Waterfront,\" \"A Streetcar Named Desire,\" \"Gentleman\\'s Agreement,\" \"Baby Doll,\" \"A Tree Grows in Brooklyn,\" \"A Face in the Crowd,\" \"America, America,\" and \"The Last Tycoon,\" and interview footage of the director himself, co-directors Scorsese and Kent Jones recount the director\\'s tumultuous journey from the Group Theatre to the Hollywood A-list to the thicket of the blacklist. But most of all, they make a powerful case for Kazan as a profoundly personal artist working in a famously impersonal industry.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 10, 4, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Kent Jones', 'Martin Scorsese'], 'writers': ['Kent Jones', 'Martin Scorsese'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 0, 'text': 'Nominated for 1 Primetime Emmy. Another 1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-12 06:56:27.443000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.7, 'votes': 550, 'id': 808245}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 129}, 'production': 'Fox', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 13, 18, 0, 36)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd88f9f'), 'plot': 'The eastern Ukrainian town of Snezhnoje, which prospered during the Soviet era when miners there were spoiled with all kinds of privileges, now lives in poverty.', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 95, 'title': 'Auk Nr. 8', 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjIzNzkzNDgwMl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODAzMzQ5Mw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['Estonia', 'Ukraine'], 'fullplot': \"In the heart of a once thriving Ukrainian coal-mining region the town's desperate residents decided to start mining illegally; they excavate everywhere: under the basements of demolished buildings, in the leisure parks, as well as in their own vegetable gardens. The story focuses on the Sikanov family, which has three children. 15-year-old Yura is the head of the family working as a miner in the illegal pit. Most Yura wants to run his own cafe somewhere far from home, but the responsibility for the two sisters and looming economic crisis pushes his dreams in the distant future.\", 'languages': ['Russian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 4, 22, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Marianna Kaat'], 'writers': ['Marianna Kaat'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-22 01:06:39.267000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.6, 'votes': 52, 'id': 1727854}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.1, 'numReviews': 5}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 6, 16, 18, 13, 48)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd8904e'), 'plot': 'Four slackers decide to avenge their humiliation at the hands of a con-man.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Crime', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 138, 'cast': ['Sanjay Dutt', 'Javed Jaffrey', 'Riteish Deshmukh', 'Mallika Sherawat'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMzEwNjIxOTI4NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODk0ODg0NQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Double Dhamaal', 'fullplot': \"After losing a huge sum to a police officer, Kabir Nayak; four slackers: Aditya Shrivastav, Boman Contractor, Manav Shrivastav and Deshbandhu Roy find themselves unemployed and broke. Then they come upon Kabir, who apparently lives a wealthy lifestyle now along with his wife, Kamini, and sister, Kiya. They intrude in his life, find out he is having an affair with a woman named Gulabo, and blackmail him into making them partners. They also rope in a gangster-turned-Sadhu, Bata Bhai, into investing in an oil project - but are humiliated and go on the run after finding that Kabir has conned them. With an enraged Bata on their tail, the hapless foursome manage to escape to Macau with the help of a gangster, Mohsin Bhai. It is here they will run into Kabir - who is now the owner of 'Four Jokers' Casino - and make elaborate plans to avenge their humiliation as well as ensure that he winds up alone and penniless.\", 'languages': ['Hindi', 'Gujarati', 'Marathi', 'Panjabi', 'Tamil', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 7, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Indra Kumar'], 'writers': ['Farhad Bhiwandiwala (dialogue)', 'Tushar Hiranandani (story)', 'Sajid (dialogue)'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-16 11:49:50.987000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 3.8, 'votes': 2018, 'id': 1728239}, 'countries': ['India'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.doubledhamaalmovie.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 2.3, 'numReviews': 680, 'meter': 24}, 'critic': {'rating': 4.7, 'numReviews