            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd88f32'), 'plot': 'The film follows a girl named Sintel who is searching for a baby dragon she calls Scales. A flashback reveals that Sintel found Scales with its wing injured and helped care for it, forming ...', 'genres': ['Animation', 'Short', 'Fantasy'], 'runtime': 14, 'cast': ['Halina Reijn', 'Thom Hoffman'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMzc5NTUzNTgzMF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODcwMzQ5Mw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Sintel', 'fullplot': \"The film follows a girl named Sintel who is searching for a baby dragon she calls Scales. A flashback reveals that Sintel found Scales with its wing injured and helped care for it, forming a close bond with it. By the time its wing recovered and it was able to fly, Scales was caught by an adult dragon. Sintel has since embarked on a quest to rescue Scales, fending off beasts and warriors along the way. She eventually comes across a cave housing an adult and baby dragon, the latter of which she believes to be Scales. The adult dragon discovers and attacks Sintel, but hesitates to kill her. Sintel slays the dragon, only to recognize the scar on its wing and realize the dragon is an adult Scales, and that she too has aged considerably. Sintel leaves the cave heartbroken, unknowingly followed by Scales's baby.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 9, 27, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Colin Levy'], 'writers': ['Martin Lodewijk (idea)', 'Esther Wouda'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '3 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-14 02:15:49.477000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.6, 'votes': 2688, 'id': 1727587}, 'countries': ['Netherlands'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.6, 'numReviews': 91, 'meter': 74}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 21, 18, 48, 44)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd89317'), 'plot': 'Through archival footage Nicholson tells the story of the real Warriors that walked the streets of New York City in the 1970s and the harsh reality of gang life in a city that seemed to be falling apart.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 71, 'metacritic': 62, 'title': 'Rubble Kings', 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTAzNTk5NjM1NjZeQTJeQWpwZ15BbWU4MDEzMDIzODUx._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['USA'], 'fullplot': 'From 1968 to 1975, gangs ruled New York City. Beyond the idealistic hopes of the civil rights movement lay a unfocused rage. Neither law enforcement nor social agency could end the escalating bloodshed. Peace came only through the most unlikely and courageous of events that would change the world for generations to come by giving birth to hip-hop culture. Rubble Kings, the most comprehensive documentation of life during this era of gang rule to date, tells the story of how a few extraordinary, forgotten people did the impossible, and how their actions impacted the world over.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 10, 23, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Shan Nicholson'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-04 00:04:40.257000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.8, 'votes': 110, 'id': 1730714}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://rubblekings.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.4, 'numReviews': 143, 'meter': 57}, 'critic': {'rating': 6.0, 'numReviews': 14, 'meter': 71}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 14, 17, 14, 24), 'rotten': 4, 'production': 'Saboteur Media', 'fresh': 10}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
