            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd891a0'), 'plot': 'A 20-year-old homeless girl is suffering from post traumatic stress syndrome on the streets of Hollywood and Venice beach.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 88, 'cast': ['Shenae Grimes-Beech', 'Marshall Allman', 'Austin Williams', 'Will Peltz'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTYzMjQwNTQ2OV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNjY3MjY3OQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Sugar', 'fullplot': \"Based on true events, Sugar is the story of a young girl with a troubled past trying to survive on the streets of Venice Beach. Sugar suffers from PTSD after losing her entire family in a horrific car crash. She survives with her group of outcast friends on the streets of Venice Beach trying to find their own place in the world. Like so many homeless youth, Sugar is running from the pain of her past and will do anything to escape it. However with the help of Bishop, her counselor in the youth shelter, she is able to reconnect with her uncle who has been searching for her. Sugar's new world starts to crumble when forced to confront the demons she's run from for the last two years. Sugar is an all too common story of a troubled youth learning how to stop hiding, and to start healing.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 4, 6, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Rotimi Rainwater'], 'writers': ['Tony Aloupis', 'Rotimi Rainwater'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-29 01:01:21.360000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.4, 'votes': 263, 'id': 1729615}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.8, 'numReviews': 43, 'meter': 76}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2014, 5, 6, 0, 0), 'website': 'http://www.thesugarmovie.com/', 'production': 'Inception Media Group', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 26, 18, 3, 22)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd88d7c'), 'fullplot': \"Finding himself in considerable debt, Chris a Texan drug dealer, decides the only solution is to murder his mother to collect the insurance money. Getting together with his father, the ex-husband of Chris' mother, they decide to hire Joe Cooper a contract killer, who also happens to be a police detective. The plan is that the money will go to Chris' sister Dottie. However due to the size of the contract fee, Chris agrees that Joe can take Dottie as a retainer until the insurance comes through.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 54661, 'id': 1726669}, 'year': 2011, 'plot': \"When a debt puts a young man's life in danger, he turns to putting a hit out on his evil mother in order to collect the insurance.\", 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama', 'Thriller'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 62, 'title': 'Killer Joe', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-07 00:40:10.510000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Tracy Letts (screenplay)', 'Tracy Letts (play)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.killerjoethemovie.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.4, 'numReviews': 79517, 'meter': 61}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 12, 21, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.8, 'numReviews': 159, 'meter': 78}, 'boxOffice': '$0.9M', 'consensus': \"Violent, darkly comic, and full of strong performances, Killer Joe proves William Friedkin hasn't lost his touch, even if the plot may be too lurid for some.\", 'rotten': 35, 'production': 'Independent Pictures', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 12, 18, 52, 37), 'fresh': 124}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BN2JhZDlmY2MtOWM4Yi00ODNlLWI4NjItOTY4MjEyYzQ0ZGI2XkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNTQzOTc3MTI@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 6, 29, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 9, 'nominations': 19, 'text': '9 wins & 19 nominations.'}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'cast': ['Matthew McConaughey', 'Emile Hirsch', 'Juno Temple', 'Thomas Haden Ch