            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd89dfc'), 'plot': \"All fourteen-year-old Robbie Hendrick ever wanted was a family. Yet as another Mississippi summer begins, his wayward mother has run off again fearing a breakdown and he's left to burn the ...\", 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 73, 'title': 'The Dynamiter', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMzE3NDExNTc1OV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMTUwOTExNw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['USA'], 'fullplot': \"All fourteen-year-old Robbie Hendrick ever wanted was a family. Yet as another Mississippi summer begins, his wayward mother has run off again fearing a breakdown and he's left to burn the days caring for his half brother, Fess. As the deep days and nights pass without her return and with older brother Lucas dangerously in their lives again, Robbie must face the fact that his dream of a family may only be a dream and he might just lose the only family he's ever had: Fess.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'cast': ['William Ruffin', 'John Alex Nunnery', 'Patrick Rutherford', 'Ciara McMillan'], 'directors': ['Matthew Gordon'], 'writers': ['Matthew Gordon (story)', 'Brad Ingelsby (story)', 'Brad Ingelsby'], 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '5 wins & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-13 00:28:55.723000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 398, 'id': 1738366}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.7, 'numReviews': 168, 'meter': 79}, 'website': 'http://elysiumfilm.com/', 'production': 'Film Movement', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 3, 18, 51, 22)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd89a51'), 'plot': \"As a writer stymied by past success, writers block, substance abuse, relationship problems and a serious set of father issues, Elliott's cracked-out chronicle of a bizarre murder trial ...\", 'genres': ['Action', 'Drama', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 105, 'metacritic': 46, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Amber Heard', 'James Franco', 'Christian Slater', 'Ed Harris'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'title': 'The Adderall Diaries', 'fullplot': \"As a writer stymied by past success, writers block, substance abuse, relationship problems and a serious set of father issues, Elliott's cracked-out chronicle of a bizarre murder trial amounts to less than the sum of its parts. Not long into the 2007 trial of programmer Hans Reiser, accused of murdering his wife, the defendant's friend Sean Sturgeon obliquely confessed to several murders (though not the murder of Reiser's wife). Elliott, caught up in the film-ready twist and his tenuous connection to Sturgeon (they share a BDSM social circle), makes a gonzo record of the proceedings. The result is a scattered, self-indulgent romp through the mind of a depressive narcissist obsessed with his insecurities and childhood traumas.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 4, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Pamela Romanowsky'], 'writers': ['Stephen Elliott (memoir)', 'Pamela Romanowsky (screenplay)', 'Pamela Romanowsky'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-22 00:09:29.297000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.4, 'votes': 44, 'id': 1735907}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd898db'), 'plot': \"Voss entices local gamers to create a Utopian society in an attempt to impress a potential employer, but paradise is disrupted when his nemesis lays claim to the city and Voss's true love.\", 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 103, 'rated': 'PG', 'cast': ['Jon Gries', 'Matt Mattson', 'Clint Vanderlinden', 'Steve Berg'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTc4MDYzOTY0MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNjM0MjQwOA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Unicorn City', 'fullplot': \"Voss is a gamer who is unemployed and looking for work. When a management position opens up at a gaming company, he interviews but lacks evidence of leadership abilities necessary to land the job. Given a week to prove himself, Voss does the only thing rational adult would do; create a Utopian society for gamers. Voss convinces his gaming guild to follow him into the mountains and has Marsha, his best friend, document his abilities. However things get complicated when Shadow Hawk, his gaming nemesis, arrives to over throw Voss' kingdom.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 2, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Bryan Lefler'], 'writers': ['Cameron Dayton (story)', 'Adrian Lefler', 'Bryan Lefler'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-19 00:27:35.297000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.7, 'votes': 1048, 'id': 1734589}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 2, 18, 16, 2)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd89c2b'), 'fullplot': \"If Carol Channing didn't exist, no one could have made her up. One in a billion, Carol , at 89, remains an unstoppable, megawatt dynamo. Broadway diva extraordinaire is just the icing. Carol Channing hovered at the pinnacle of the entertainment world from the late-1950's through the 1960's and beyond, living life sensationally large. As Carol has observed, '...if you're lucky enough to have two hit shows, the world passes through your dressing room'. At 89, she remains irrepressible.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 7.5, 'votes': 206, 'id': 1737122}, 'year': 2012, 'plot': 'A documentary on Broadway legend Carol Channing.', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography', 'Comedy'], 'rated': 'PG', 'metacritic': 67, 'title': 'Carol Channing: Larger Than Life', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-04 00:41:17.350000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Dori Berinstein', 'Adam Zucker'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.carolchanningthemovie.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 262, 'meter': 86}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 5, 21, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 7.2, 'numReviews': 27, 'meter': 89}, 'boxOffice': '$15.5k', 'rotten': 3, 'production': 'Dramatic Forces', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 17, 17, 20, 50), 'fresh': 24}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTk2NTEzMjc0MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODAxMTgxNw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 1, 20, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '1 win & 2 nominations.'}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'cast': ['Carol Channing', 'Loni Anderson', 'Mary Jo Catlett', 'Marge Champion'], 'directors': ['Dori Berinstein'], 'runtime': 87}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd8962d'), 'plot': 'The film follows the follies that ensue when a man and his wife shack up with a family that owns a printing press in their building, the husband takes it over, and the couple begin inviting a motley crew of friends.', 'genres': ['Comedy'], 'runtime': 96, 'cast': ['Kenji Yamauchi', 'Kiki Sugino', 'Kanji Furutachi', 'Bryerly Long'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTc3NTE5MDUzOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwOTAzMjM5OA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Hospitalitè', 'fullplot': \"In suburban Tokyo, the Kobayashis - Mikio, his young second wife Natsuki, and his young adolescent daughter Eriko, who was borne out of his first marriage - live in a small flat above the family printing business. Mikio inherited the business and the flat from his father who passed away two years ago. Temporarily living with them is Mikio's divorced sister Seiko, who is there until she decides what to do, which is in her mind - unrealistically - to go abroad to learn English. Their rather dull and staid lives are punctuated by Eriko's pet parakeet having recently flown away, it which they are scouring the neighborhood looking for, and their neighbors organizing a neighborhood watch to keep out undesirables, namely foreigners who they believe are causing no good to their society. Into their lives stumbles Hanataro Kagawa, the son of their father's old friend. Before they know it, Kagawa has talked his way into a job working at the print shop and room and board in their flat. Kagawa turns their lives upside down and inside out with one surprising move after another. But he also uncovers some core issues which are slowly tearing the Kobayashis apart without them really knowing it. What they are unaware of is that Kagawa had a grand plan in his entrance into their lives and home, that will forever change their lives, if only deep in their souls.\", 'languages': ['Japanese', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 4, 2, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Kèji Fukada'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '2 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-07 00:10:34.600000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 186, 'id': 1733147}, 'countries': ['Japan'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.3, 'numReviews': 23}, 'production': 'Film Movement', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 18, 18, 24, 22)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13cff29313caabd8981f'), 'plot': \"A documentary about young Eastern European women who've been drawn into a netherworld of sex trafficking and abuse. It is a story told by survivors; a film that gives a voice to women who ...\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Crime', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 72, 'cast': ['Mimi Chakarova'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'title': 'The Price of Sex', 'fullplot': \"A documentary about young Eastern European women who've been drawn into a netherworld of sex trafficking and abuse. It is a story told by survivors; a film that gives a voice to women who were supposed to be silenced by shame, fear and intimidation. Mimi Chakarova, a photojournalist who grew up in Bulgaria, takes us on a personal, investigative journey into the shadowy world of sex trafficking from Eastern Europe to Turkey, Dubai and Greece. Told through the personal accounts of trafficked women, undercover footage, and still photography, this documentary exposes the root causes of why women continue to be sold into prostitution against their will and examines what can be done to stop it.\", 'languages': ['English', 'Turkish', 'Romanian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 4, 9, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Mimi Chakarova'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-07-04 00:02:54.667000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.5, 'votes': 104, 'id': 1734163}, 'countries': ['USA', 'United Arab Emirates', 'Bulgaria', 'Moldova', 'Turkey'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'website': 'http://www.neasahardiman.com/', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 1, 4, 23, 43, 1)}}\n",
