            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d0f29313caabd8d8ed'), 'plot': 'The Hughes cottage vacation is violently interrupted by a family on a murderous and identity stealing journey, in search of the \"perfect\" life.', 'genres': ['Horror', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 97, 'cast': ['Selma Blair', 'Joshua Close', \"James D'Arcy\", 'Rachel Miner'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTU3ODczMTcwMF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzg1MTA3OA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'In Their Skin', 'fullplot': 'After the accidental death of their six-year-old daughter, the Hughes family escape their busy upscale suburban life and head to their isolated cottage for some quality time. An evening with their friendly neighbors is suddenly interrupted when one mans obsession with perfection escalates into a violent struggle, forcing the families to go beyond what they ever thought they were capable of in order to survive.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 11, 9, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jeremy Power Regimbal'], 'writers': ['Joshua Close (story)', 'Justin Tyler Close (story)', 'Jeremy Power Regimbal (story)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-12 00:40:09.670000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.3, 'votes': 3715, 'id': 1790869}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.intheirskinmovie.com', 'viewer': {'rating': 2.4, 'numReviews': 924, 'meter': 15}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 3, 11, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.3, 'numReviews': 11, 'meter': 45}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 10, 19, 4, 7), 'rotten': 6, 'production': 'IFC Midnight', 'fresh': 5}}\n",
