            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d0f29313caabd8d4bc'), 'plot': 'An urban mystery unfurls as one man pieces together the surreal meaning of hundreds of cryptic tiled messages that have been appearing in city streets across the U.S. and South America.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 86, 'metacritic': 60, 'cast': ['Justin Duerr', 'Marc Duerr', 'Kevin Riley', 'Abby Miller'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTMxODc4MDA1M15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwOTI3MTUyNg@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Resurrect Dead: The Mystery of the Toynbee Tiles', 'fullplot': \"Strangeness is afoot. Most people don't notice the hundreds of cryptic tiled messages about resurrecting the dead that have been appearing in city streets over the past three decades. But Justin Duerr does. For years, finding an answer to this long-standing urban mystery has been his obsession. He has been collecting clues that the tiler has embedded in the streets of major cities across the U.S. and South America. But as Justin starts piecing together key events of the past he finds a story that is more surreal than he imagined, and one that hits disturbingly close to home.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 8, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jon Foy'], 'writers': ['Jon Foy', 'Colin Smith'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-14 10:28:40.420000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.4, 'votes': 1452, 'id': 1787791}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.resurrectdead.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.9, 'numReviews': 619, 'meter': 82}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 1, 30, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.2, 'numReviews': 20, 'meter': 65}, 'boxOffice': '$21.2k', 'rotten': 7, 'production': 'Argot Pictures', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 15, 19, 46, 52), 'fresh': 13}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d0f29313caabd8d8f3'), 'fullplot': \"Maya is a CIA operative whose first experience is in the interrogation of prisoners following the Al Qaeda attacks against the U.S. on the 11th September 2001. She is a reluctant participant in extreme duress applied to the detainees, but believes that the truth may only be obtained through such tactics. For several years, she is single-minded in her pursuit of leads to uncover the whereabouts of Al Qaeda's leader, Osama Bin Laden. Finally, in 2011, it appears that her work will pay off, and a U.S. Navy SEAL team is sent to kill or capture Bin Laden. But only Maya is confident Bin Laden is where she says he is.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 7.4, 'votes': 200594, 'id': 1790885}, 'year': 2012, 'plot': 'A chronicle of the decade-long hunt for al-Qaeda terrorist leader Osama bin Laden after the September 2001 attacks, and his death at the hands of the Navy S.E.A.L.s Team 6 in May 2011.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'History', 'Thriller'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 95, 'title': 'Zero Dark Thirty', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-05 00:24:22.127000000', 'languages': ['English', 'Arabic'], 'writers': ['Mark Boal'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.zerodarkthirty-movie.com/site/', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 194633, 'meter': 80}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 3, 19, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 8.6, 'numReviews': 254, 'meter': 93}, 'boxOffice': '$95.7M', 'consensus': 'Gripping, suspenseful, and brilliantly crafted, Zero Dark Thirty dramatizes the hunt for Osama bin Laden with intelligence and an eye for detail.', 'rotten': 17, 'production': 'Columbia Pictures', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 12, 18, 8, 1), 'fresh': 237}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQ4OTUyNzcwN15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMTQ1NDE3OA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 1, 11, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 108, 'nominations': 128, 'text': 'Won 1 Oscar. A