            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d0f29313caabd8d480'), 'plot': 'A series of vignettes involving memories of companionship and sexual awakening shared by two second cousins.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 83, 'metacritic': 71, 'cast': ['Sarah Hagan', 'Austin Vickers', 'Haley Strode', 'Haley Parker'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTc0NjY5OTY0NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMjk5NTQ0Nw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Jess + Moss', 'fullplot': \"Jess (18) and Moss (12) are second cousins who have spent their summers together since either of them can remember. Without immediate families that they can relate to, and lacking friends their own age, all they have is each other. Through a series of memories and vignettes, 'Jess + Moss' recounts the events of the last summer they shared together. Shot entirely on location with a variety of expired and often degraded film stocks, 'Jess + Moss' captures the evocative and haunting character of the dark fire tobacco fields of rural Western Kentucky.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 2, 17, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Clay Jeter'], 'writers': ['Clay Jeter (story)', 'Debra Jeter (story)', 'Nikki Jeter Wilbanks (story)', 'Clay Jeter (screenplay)', 'Will Basanta (screenplay)', 'Isaac Hagy (screenplay)', 'Debra Jeter (screenplay)'], 'awards': {'wins': 4, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '4 wins & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-18 00:09:33.423000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.3, 'votes': 526, 'id': 1787731}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.jessandmoss.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.5, 'numReviews': 165, 'meter': 66}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 3, 19, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.6, 'numReviews': 5, 'meter': 80}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 22, 18, 29, 14), 'rotten': 1, 'production': 'Strand Releasing', 'fresh': 4}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d0f29313caabd8d8eb'), 'plot': 'Thomas is deposited in a community of boys after his memory is erased, soon learning they\\'re all trapped in a maze that will require him to join forces with fellow \"runners\" for a shot at escape.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Mystery', 'Sci-Fi'], 'runtime': 113, 'metacritic': 56, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': [\"Dylan O'Brien\", 'Aml Ameen', 'Ki Hong Lee', 'Blake Cooper'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjUyNTA3MTAyM15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwOTEyMTkyMjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Maze Runner', 'fullplot': 'Thomas wakes up in an elevator, remembering nothing but his own name. He emerges into a world of about 60 teen boys who have learned to survive in a completely enclosed environment, subsisting on their own agriculture and supplies. A new boy arrives every 30 days. The original group has been in \"The Glade\" for three years, trying to find a way to escape through the Maze that surrounds their living space. They have begun to give up hope. Then a comatose girl arrives with a strange note, and their world begins to change. There are some great, fast-paced action scenes, particularly those involving the nightmarish Grievers who plague the boys.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 9, 19, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Wes Ball'], 'writers': ['Noah Oppenheim (screenplay)', 'Grant Pierce Myers (screenplay)', 'T.S. Nowlin (screenplay)', 'James Dashner (novel)'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 10, 'text': '3 wins & 10 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-31 00:11:37.090000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.8, 'votes': 242220, 'id': 1790864}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://themazerunnermovie.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.7, 'numReviews': 90041, 'meter': 68}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2014, 12, 16, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.9, 'numReviews': 145, 'meter': 63}, 'boxOffice': '$102.4M', 'consensus': 'With strong acting, a solid premise, and a refreshingly dark approach to its dystopian setting, The Maze Runner stands out from the crowded field of YA sci-fi adventures.', 'rotten': 53, 'production': '20th Century Fox', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 25, 18, 4, 27), 'fresh': 92}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d1f29313caabd8e224'), 'plot': 'During the Occupation, a young woman whose husband disappeared during the war decides to hide a little Jewish girl. To save the child, she gets into a romance with a German.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'War'], 'runtime': 110, 'cast': ['Urszula Grabowska', 'Sara Knothe', 'Stanislawa Celinska', 'Kinga Preis'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'title': 'Joanna', 'fullplot': 'The main character Joanna (Urszula Grabowska), waiting in vain for a letter from her husband who is in an Oflag, gives shelter to a little Jewish girl whose mother was caught during a round-up. Thus she becomes burdened with a secret she cannot reveal to anyone, even to her relatives. Joanna knows that she cannot keep Rose with her as she is already under observation, but she fails to find a hiding spot for Rose and is forced to become the lover of a German officer in return for protection. Forced by necessity, she has to cooperate with her enemies, becoming a traitor in the eyes of \"her people\". The final, symbolic image is suggestive - in a tearful and religious manner - of the fact that sheltering little Roza was Joanna\\'s personal torture referring to Golgotha. However, the deeper meaning of that story is perverse and bitter: hiding the child was even more dangerous because of Joanna\\'s \"own people\", mutually controlling the patriotic decency.', 'languages': ['Polish', 'French', 'German'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 11, 26, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Feliks Falk'], 'writers': ['Feliks Falk'], 'awards': {'wins': 6, 'nominations': 6, 'text': '6 wins & 6 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-01 00:17:07.270000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.8, 'votes': 310, 'id': 1799110}, 'countries': ['Poland'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2014, 9, 27, 8, 30, 48)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d1f29313caabd8dcb5'), 'plot': 'Two ghosts walk along the Camino of Santiago.', 'genres': ['Fantasy'], 'runtime': 80, 'cast': ['Pau Nubiola', 'Santi Serra', 'Pavel Lukiyanov', 'Yuri Mykhaylychenko'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTk3NzAyNDgyMl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMjQ0MjcxNQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Finisterrae', 'fullplot': 'Finisterrae tells the story of two ghosts who, tired of wandering through limbo, decide to take the Way of Saint James, to the end of the world (Finisterra) so that once there, they may begin a fleeting, earthly journey through the land of the living. An introspective journey through uninhabited lands in which they are to find themselves with strange beings, wild animals and characters never before heard of. They must confront unexpected situations, battle with their own fears and struggle with the obstacles of their own phantasmagoric condition.', 'languages': ['Russian', 'Catalan', 'Finnish', 'German'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 6, 11, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Sergio Caballero'], 'writers': ['Sergio Caballero'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-06-28 00:03:40.080000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.6, 'votes': 442, 'id': 1794790}, 'countries': ['Spain'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.0, 'numReviews': 74, 'meter': 42}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 1, 19, 11, 58)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d1f29313caabd8e123'), 'plot': 'A woman subject to mental, physical, and sexual abuse on a remote island seeks a way out.', 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama', 'Horror'], 'runtime': 115, 'cast': ['Yeong-hie Seo', 'Seong-won Ji', 'Min-ho Hwang', 'Min Je'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjAyNDEwMDgzMl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNzMyMTYwNQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Bedevilled', 'fullplot': \"Hae-won is a beautiful single woman in her thirties who works at a bank in the Seoul city. She leads a busy life until she becomes a witness to an attempted murder case, and at the same time, things get complicated at work. When things get out of hand she is forced to take a vacation so she heads for 'Moodo', a small undeveloped island, where she had once visited to see her grandparents. And where she had befriended a girl named Bok-nam who stills writes to Hae-won asking her to visit despite the fact that Hae-won never bothered to reply. Upon arriving at the island, Hae-won is shocked to see everyone treating Bok-nam like a slave. As practically the only young woman on the island, she is a plaything for all the men and a free laborer for the women. Sick of all the inhumane treatment, Bok-nam had tried to escape the island several times in the past but had failed each time. She begs Hae-won to help her escape the place, but Hae-won remains indifferent not wanting to be involved in complicated situations. When Bok-nam realizes that her own daughter will follow her footsteps, she tries to escape the island with her daughter.\", 'languages': ['Korean'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2010, 9, 2, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Cheol-soo Jang'], 'writers': ['Kwang-young Choi'], 'awards': {'wins': 10, 'nominations': 5, 'text': '10 wins & 5 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-12 18:33:16.107000000', 'year': 2010, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.3, 'votes': 8028, 'id': 1646959}, 'countries': ['South Korea'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d1f29313caabd8de75'), 'plot': 'Out on parole after 8 years inside Bill Hayward returns home to find his now 11 and 15 year old sons abandoned by their mother and fending for themselves. Unwilling to play Dad, an uncaring...', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 98, 'cast': ['Charlie Creed-Miles', 'Will Poulter', 'Sammy Williams', 'Iwan Rheon'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTg5NzQ1Mzg5N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzM5OTc0Nw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Wild Bill', 'fullplot': \"Out on parole after 8 years inside Bill Hayward returns home to find his now 11 and 15 year old sons abandoned by their mother and fending for themselves. Unwilling to play Dad, an uncaring Bill is determined to move on. Although Dean the older boy has found a job and is doing his best to be a father to his younger brother Jimmy, the arrival of Bill has brought them to the attention of social services. With the danger of being put into care looming, Dean forces his feckless Dad to stay by threatening to grass him up for dealing. If there's one thing Bill doesn't want it's to go back to prison. He reluctantly agrees to stay for a week o help fool social services that the boys are being cared for. Having never really grown up himself Bill quickly connects with Jimmy and through this new bond starts to realize what he's been missing. He has a family, a place in the world. He is a father. However, their happy family set up is short lived when Jimmy gets into trouble with Bill's dangerous old cohorts. To sort it out would breach the terms of his license and risk sending him back to Jail. Bill's next steps will show what sort of a Dad he wants to be. A good one or a free one.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 3, 23, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Dexter Fletcher'], 'writers': ['Danny King', 'Dexter Fletcher'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 6, 'text': 'Nominated for 1 BAFTA Film Award. Another 1 win & 6 nominations.