            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d1f29313caabd8f84b'), 'plot': \"The eleven year old cycling talent Freddy is the son of a butcher in an idyllic village in no man's land. His isolated life is turned upside down completely in 1975 when the first ...\", 'genres': ['Comedy'], 'runtime': 100, 'cast': ['Jelte Blommaert', 'Peter Van den Begin', 'Barbara Sarafian', 'Mathias Vergels'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'Allez, Eddy!', 'fullplot': \"The eleven year old cycling talent Freddy is the son of a butcher in an idyllic village in no man's land. His isolated life is turned upside down completely in 1975 when the first supermarket in the village opens its doors. To mark the opening the supermarket organizes a cycling race and the winner of that match will meet Eddy Merckx. Freddy's father is a fervent opponent of the supermarket and the competition, but Freddy subscribes behind his back. By participating in the race a new world opens, not only for Freddy, but also for all those around him.\", 'languages': ['Dutch', 'French'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 3, 28, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Gert Embrechts'], 'writers': ['Gert Embrechts'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 6, 'text': '3 wins & 6 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-01 00:40:15.317000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.3, 'votes': 561, 'id': 1817088}, 'countries': ['Belgium'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 2.4, 'numReviews': 7}, 'website': 'http://www.allezeddy.be/', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 18, 18, 57, 28)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d1f29313caabd8f808'), 'plot': 'A man steals the Mona Lisa from the Louvre in 1911. His 84-year-old daughter thought he did it for patriotic reasons. A filmmaker spends more than 30 years trying to find the truth.', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Crime', 'History'], 'runtime': 85, 'cast': ['Celestina Peruggia', 'Joe Medeiros', 'Benito Mussolini', 'Robert Wittman'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTkwOTgxNjgwOV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMzU2OTcwMzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Missing Piece: Mona Lisa, Her Thief, the True Story', 'fullplot': 'How did an unassuming house painter from Italy pull off \"the greatest little known art heist in modern time?\" Was his motivation more than money? Writer-director Joe Medeiros traces the path of Vincenzo Peruggia, charged with the 1911 theft of Leonardo da Vinci\\'s Mona Lisa from The Louvre, and finds the story of a daughter mourning the father she never knew and a country recovering from old wounds. Combining historical photographs, animation and interviews with Peruggia\\'s descendants, Medeiros answers why and how the man called \"Macaroni\" by his French co-workers absconded with and kept the legendary painting for two years. This riveting, often humorous documentary portrays a man struggling to find his way in the world and make his family proud. Most touching are the scenes of Peruggia\\'s 84-year-old daughter, Celestina, who grew up on stories about her father and longed for the truth.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 10, 20, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Joe Medeiros'], 'writers': ['Joe Medeiros'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-25 01:01:33.320000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.4, 'votes': 88, 'id': 1816681}, 'countries': ['USA', 'UK', 'Italy', 'France'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.8, 'numReviews': 56, 'meter': 75}, 