            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d2f29313caabd913f4'), 'plot': 'Five substance-abusing friends decide to fake a kidnapping in order to bribe a police constable for covering-up a hit-and-run accident.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Crime', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 121, 'cast': ['Kalki Koechlin', 'Shiv Pandit', 'Gulshan Devaiah', 'Rajeev Khandelwal'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'title': 'Shaitan', 'fullplot': \"After the passing of her mother, and the entry of a step-mother, Amrita Jayshankar retreats into herself. Her father is summoned to her school and is told that his daughter may require counseling, but he refuses to believe and instead makes a donation to the school. Then Amrita meets with three males and a female, namely Zuben, Dushant Sahu, Karan Chaudhary; and Tanya Sharma respectively. Together they live it up with drugs and alcohol until things get out of control when they accidentally kill a couple. A corrupt police constable demands Rs.25 Lakhs to eliminate their involvement. Unable to come up with so much cash, the five decide to fake a kidnapping, demand the cash from Amrita's father, and clear their respective names. Amrita accordingly goes 'missing', and her father involves the police, who assign this case to once-suspended police inspector, Arvind Mathur. With the media getting involved, Arvind begins his investigation, but will soon find it hampered - complicating not only his assignment - but also his personal life.\", 'languages': ['Hindi', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 6, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Bejoy Nambiar'], 'writers': ['Abhijeet Deshpande (dialogue)', 'K.S. Krishnan (lyrics)', 'Bejoy Nambiar', 'Megha Ramaswamy', 'Colin Terrence (lyrics)'], 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 12, 'text': '5 wins & 12 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-02 00:26:40.523000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.4, 'votes': 4561, 'id': 1836912}, 'countries': ['India'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.5, 'numReviews': 118}, '