            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d2f29313caabd91b1a'), 'plot': 'In 1998, thirty four unidentified bodies were found in shallow graves in a remote Siberian forest. After subsequent investigations, no official explanation by the Russian authorities was ...', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Horror', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 87, 'cast': ['Dervla Kirwan', 'Charlotte Riley', 'Branko Tomovic', 'Rupert Hill'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYjIzMzc4MGItYTNkZi00ZmYyLTlhZTgtYzQxYzEwNGY2NmUyXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNzQ5MzY0NjM@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Entity', 'fullplot': \"In 1998, thirty four unidentified bodies were found in shallow graves in a remote Siberian forest. After subsequent investigations, no official explanation by the Russian authorities was ever offered about the circumstances of the deaths. The case was closed. In 2010, a small English TV crew from the show 'Darkest Secrets' set out for the Siberian forest. 'Darkest Secrets' focuses on revisiting the sites of unsolved crimes and they employ the gifts of a psychic whose extraordinary powers may help shed new light on cold cases. The last communication to their production office in London stated that they were approaching the Siberian region where the bodies were found. Nothing was heard from them again. 'Entity' is the story of what happened to them. The forest was only the beginning....\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 6, 11, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Steve Stone'], 'writers': ['Steve Stone'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '3 wins & 4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-23 01:03:48.990000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 4.6, 'votes': 1283, 'id': 1842356}, 'countries': ['UK'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 2.3, 'numReviews': 129, 'meter': 14}, 'website': 'http://entitythemovie.com/', 'production': 'Fangoria', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 17, 18, 31, 49)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d2f29313caabd91fb7'), 'fullplot': \"AI WEIWEI: NEVER SORRY is the first feature-length film about the internationally renowned Chinese artist and activist, Ai Weiwei. In recent years, Ai has garnered international attention as much for his ambitious artwork as his political provocations. AI WEIWEI: NEVER SORRY examines this complex intersection of artistic practice and social activism as seen through the life and art of China's preeminent contemporary artist. From 2008 to 2010, Beijing-based journalist and filmmaker Alison Klayman gained unprecedented access to Ai Weiwei. Klayman documented Ai's artistic process in preparation for major museum exhibitions, his intimate exchanges with family members and his increasingly public clashes with the Chinese government. Klayman's detailed portrait of the artist provides a nuanced exploration of contemporary China and one of its most compelling public figures.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 7.6, 'votes': 3019, 'id': 1845773}, 'year': 2012, 'plot': 'A documentary that chronicles artist and activist Ai Weiwei as he prepares for a series of exhibitions and gets into an increasing number of clashes with the Chinese government.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 81, 'title': 'Ai Weiwei: Never Sorry', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-15 03:22:14.147000000', 'languages': ['English', 'Mandarin'], 'writers': ['Alison Klayman'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://aiweiweineversorry.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.1, 'numReviews': 5209, 'meter': 87}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 12, 3, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 8.0, 'numReviews': 76, 'meter': 97}, 'boxOffice': '$0.5M', 'rotten': 2, 'production': 'IFC Films', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 15, 17, 8, 57), 'fresh': 74}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjE4NjEwNDAyN15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNDk5MTIxOA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 6, 14, 0, 0), 'award