            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d2f29313caabd939f9'), 'plot': 'Alice lives in a beautiful villa. She has a husband who makes a lot of money, a nine-year-old son and three servants who happen to be immigrants. She is superficial, haughty and racist. But...', 'genres': ['Comedy'], 'runtime': 95, 'cast': ['Paola Cortellesi', 'Raoul Bova', 'Rocco Papaleo', 'Anna Foglietta'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTY5NDU0Njg0NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwOTE0ODI5NA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Escort in Love', 'fullplot': 'Alice lives in a beautiful villa. She has a husband who makes a lot of money, a nine-year-old son and three servants who happen to be immigrants. She is superficial, haughty and racist. But everything changes the day her husband gets killed in an accident: the young woman suddenly finds herself debt-ridden. Forced to leave their magnificent house, she goes to live in a small apartment in a working-class neighborhood. To repay her debts she also has to find work. When she gets to know Eva, a call girl who works in the West End of the town, she follows her example. In parallel, during her free time, Alice meets a certain number of good people in her new area. And she feels closer and closer to one of them called Giulio.', 'languages': ['Italian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 3, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Massimiliano Bruno'], 'writers': ['Massimiliano Bruno (screenplay)', 'Edoardo Maria Falcone (screenplay)', 'Fausto Brizzi (collaborating writer)', 'Fausto Brizzi (story)', 'Riccardo Cassini (additional dialogue)'], 'awards': {'wins': 6, 'nominations': 14, 'text': '6 wins & 14 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-05 00:35:56.990000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.1, 'votes': 1366, 'id': 1866205}, 'countries': ['Italy'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 1}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 6, 25, 18, 25, 30)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
