            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d3f29313caabd96934'), 'plot': \"Before the body-threatening antics of Jackass came crashing into public consciousness, there was Ontario's Ralph Zavadil, aka Cap'n Video, who cascaded off roofs into snowbanks, jumped off ...\", 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 92, 'cast': ['Ralph Zavadil', 'Robert Buick', 'Nancy Dewar', 'Barbara Zavadil'], 'num_mflix_comments': 3, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjI4NTYwNjYxNl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwOTY1MTMzNQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Beauty Day', 'fullplot': \"Before the body-threatening antics of Jackass came crashing into public consciousness, there was Ontario's Ralph Zavadil, aka Cap'n Video, who cascaded off roofs into snowbanks, jumped off ladders into half-empty swimming pools, and drank eggs through his nostrils. Beauty Day is a rambunctious documentary about this irrepressible pioneer of local-access cable shenanigans who entertained and outraged viewers in the small city of St. Catharines-until a special Easter Show, featuring a fat rabbit and adorable puppies (none of which were hurt), got him kicked off the air for good. With a nod to Werner Herzog, Cheel follows the life and times of Cap'n Video and finds that the Cap'n is still quite a firecracker.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2011, 6, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jay Cheel'], 'writers': ['Jay Cheel'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-07 00:20:29.430000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.3, 'votes': 320, 'id': 1922555}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 102, 'meter': 85}, 'production': 'FilmBuff', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 17, 18, 3, 37)}}\n",
