            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d4f29313caabd9947b'), 'plot': 'Conversations with death row inmate Michael Perry and those affected by his crime serve as an examination of why people - and the state - kill.', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Crime'], 'runtime': 107, 'metacritic': 74, 'cast': ['Werner Herzog', 'Richard Lopez', 'Michael Perry', 'Damon Hall'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNTQyODM2MzMxMV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNDIzNjY5Ng@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Into the Abyss', 'fullplot': \"Into the abyss explores a triple murder which occurred in the small Texas City of Conroe in 2001. Michael Perry and Jason Burkett, under the influence of alcohol and drugs, murdered a middle-aged housewife; they then gunned down her stepson and his friend. The film features Conversations with the two inmates and those affected by their crime. Unlike many of the films that deal with crimes, into the abyss isn't concerned with figuring out exactly what happened, but rather serves as an examination of why people - and the state - kill.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 3, 30, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Werner Herzog'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'awards': {'wins': 4, 'nominations': 10, 'text': '4 wins & 10 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-21 00:02:40.923000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.3, 'votes': 11213, 'id': 1972663}, 'countries': ['USA', 'UK', 'Germany'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.ifcfilms.com/films/into-the-abyss', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.8, 'numReviews': 8098, 'meter': 76}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 4, 10, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 7.7, 'numReviews': 105, 'meter': 91}, 'boxOffice': '$0.2M', 'consensus': 'Another probing, insightful look at an interesting subject, Werner Herzog explores the American prison system with passion and not politics.', 'rotten': 9, 'production': 'IFC Films', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 13, 17, 32, 50), 'fresh': 96}}\n",
