            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d5f29313caabd9c530'), 'plot': 'A Romanian police officer teams up with a small crew of old friends from the World War II Jewish Resistance to pull off a heist by convincing everyone at the scene of the crime that they are only filming a movie.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 112, 'metacritic': 47, 'cast': ['Vera Farmiga', 'Mark Strong', 'Harry Lloyd', 'Anton Lesser'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTU3NjAzOTAxOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNjE5MTUxNTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Closer to the Moon', 'fullplot': 'Bucharest 1959. A spectacular Bank heist has the country in an uproar. In post-war Communist Romania it is an unimaginable slap in the face to the iron fisted authorities. Four men and a woman are arrested, tried, convicted and while waiting for their execution... are forced to star in a propaganda film about the crime. All five protagonists were heroes of the resistance during the Second World War and highly placed members of Romanian society. They clearly knew they would be caught and executed.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 4, 17, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Nae Caranfil'], 'writers': ['Nae Caranfil'], 'awards': {'wins': 9, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '9 wins & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-02 00:11:11.850000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.7, 'votes': 1508, 'id': 2017486}, 'countries': ['Romania', 'USA', 'Italy', 'Poland', 'France'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.ifcfilms.com', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.9, 'numReviews': 93, 'meter': 80}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 14, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.7, 'numReviews': 8, 'meter': 38}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 1, 18, 28, 5), 'rotten': 5, 'production': 'IFC Films', 'fresh': 3}}\n",
