            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d5f29313caabd9c268'), 'plot': 'A documentary about three unique restaurants and their respective owners.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 93, 'metacritic': 65, 'cast': ['Grant Achatz', 'Cindy Breitbach', 'Mike Breitbach', 'Thomas Keller'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMzA0ODYwODIxNV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNDE1OTE0MDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Spinning Plates', 'fullplot': 'Spinning Plates is a documentary about three extraordinary restaurants and the incredible people who make them what they are. A cutting-edge restaurant named the seventh-best in the world whose chef must battle a life-threatening obstacle to pursue his passion. A 150-year-old family restaurant still standing only because of the unbreakable bond with its community. A fledgling Mexican restaurant whose owners are risking everything just to survive and provide for their young daughter. Their unforgettable stories of family, legacy, passion and survival come together to reveal how meaningful food can be, and the power it has to connect us to one another.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 10, 25, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Joseph Levy'], 'writers': ['Joseph Levy'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '3 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-04 00:17:32.727000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.1, 'votes': 623, 'id': 2014351}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.spinningplatesmovie.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.1, 'numReviews': 967, 'meter': 84}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2014, 2, 11, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.5, 'numReviews': 33, 'meter': 85}, 'boxOffice': '$0.1M', 'rotten': 5, 'production': 'The Film Arcade', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 16, 20, 20, 12), 'fresh': 28}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d5f29313caabd9c4ea'), 'fullplot': \"The evil wizard Gargamel creates a couple of mischievous Smurf-like creatures called the Naughties that he hopes will let him harness the all-powerful, magical Smurf-essence. But when he discovers that only a real Smurf can give him what he wants, and only a secret spell that Smurfette knows can turn the Naughties into real Smurfs, Gargamel kidnaps Smurfette and brings her to Paris, where he has been winning the adoration of millions as the worldès greatest sorcerer. It's up to Papa, Clumsy, Grouchy, and Vanity to return to our world, reunite with their human friends Patrick and Grace Winslow, and rescue her! Will Smurfette, who has always felt different from the other Smurfs, find a new connection with the Naughties Vexy and Hackus or will the Smurfs convince her that their love for her is True Blue?\", 'imdb': {'rating': 5.4, 'votes': 24746, 'id': 2017020}, 'year': 2013, 'plot': \"The Smurfs team up with their human friends to rescue Smurfette, who has been kidnapped by Gargamel since she knows a secret spell that can turn the evil sorcerer's newest creation - creatures called the Naughties - into real Smurfs.\", 'genres': ['Animation', 'Adventure', 'Comedy'], 'rated': 'PG', 'metacritic': 34, 'title': 'The Smurfs 2', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-17 04:47:09.900000000', 'languages': ['English', 'French'], 'writers': ['J. David Stem (screenplay)', 'David N. Weiss (screenplay)', 'Jay Scherick (screenplay)', 'David Ronn (screenplay)', 'Karey Kirkpatrick (screenplay)', 'J. David Stem (story)', 'David N. Weiss (story)', 'Jay Scherick (story)', 'David Ronn (story)', 'Peyo (characters and works)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.smurfhappens.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.5, 'numReviews': 73066, 'meter': 57}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 12, 3, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 88, 'meter': 14}, 'boxOffice': '$71.0M', 'consensus': \"Like its predecessor, Smurfs 2 may am