            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d5f29313caabd9c50c'), 'fullplot': \"Deep into a solo voyage in the Indian Ocean, an unnamed man (Redford) wakes to find his 39-foot yacht taking on water after a collision with a shipping container left floating on the high seas. With his navigation equipment and radio disabled, the man sails unknowingly into the path of a violent storm. Despite his success in patching the breached hull, his mariner's intuition and a strength that belies his age, the man barely survives the tempest. Using only a sextant and nautical maps to chart his progress, he is forced to rely on ocean currents to carry him into a shipping lane in hopes of hailing a passing vessel. But with the sun unrelenting, sharks circling and his meager supplies dwindling, the ever-resourceful sailor soon finds himself staring his mortality in the face.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 53712, 'id': 2017038}, 'year': 2013, 'plot': 'After a collision with a shipping container at sea, a resourceful sailor finds himself, despite all efforts to the contrary, staring his mortality in the face.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Adventure', 'Drama'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'metacritic': 87, 'title': 'All Is Lost', 'lastupdated': '2015-08-31 00:05:01.107000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['J.C. Chandor'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 2.2, 'numReviews': 12}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 9, 18, 27, 51)}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjI0MzIyMjU1N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwOTk1MjQxMDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 11, 7, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 7, 'nominations': 36, 'text': 'Nominated for 1 Oscar. Another 6 wins & 36 nominations.'}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'cast': ['Robert Redford'], 'directors': ['J.C. Chandor'], 'runtime': 106}\n",
