            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d5f29313caabd9dc6e'), 'plot': 'A glimpse into the lives of an ensemble of characters leading up to the moment the world changed forever - 8:46 a.m. Tuesday September 11, 2001.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 55, 'cast': ['Shelly Shenoy', 'Mike DiGiacinto', 'Lizzy Plimpton', 'Jzaneen Damji'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNjQ3Mzg4NTk5NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNjk0MDQ4MDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': '8:46', 'fullplot': '8:46 is a moving and heartfelt drama following an ensemble of characters into the moment the world changed forever - 8:46 a.m. Tuesday, September 11, 2001. This film was created to draw a more intimate, humane look at the tragic events of 9/11. Nearly 3,000 innocent people lost their lives that fateful Tuesday morning and each of them had a story, people who loved them, something to live for... a life of value. As we delve into the world of each character, we witness the terror, but also the hope, tenderness, acts of bravery and compassion, and the power of the human spirit. This film is dedicated in loving memory to all those who lost their lives as a result of the September 11 attacks, as well as the brave men and women who responded to the emergency. They will never be forgotten.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 9, 4, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jennifer Azano'], 'writers': ['Jennifer Azano'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '3 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-07-17 02:07:40.723000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.1, 'votes': 306, 'id': 2048688}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.5, 'numReviews': 736, 'meter': 55}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 9, 4, 0, 0), 'website': 'http://www.846themovie.com/', 'production': 'Virgil Films', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 11, 17, 7, 9)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d5f29313caabd9d4e7'), 'plot': 'A documentary on the life and current times of artist Wayne White.', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography', 'Comedy'], 'runtime': 88, 'metacritic': 72, 'cast': ['Wayne White', 'Paul Reubens', 'Mimi Pond', 'Mark Mothersbaugh'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQwNTM2OTM4NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNjUzMjQ4Nw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Beauty Is Embarrassing', 'fullplot': \"Raised in the Tennessee mountains, Wayne White started his career as a cartoonist in NYC. He quickly found success as one of the creators of the Pee-wee's Playhouse TV show which soon led to more work design some of the most arresting and iconic images in pop culture. Recently his word paintings featuring pithy and and often sarcastic text statements finely crafted onto vintage landscape paintings have made him a darling of the fine art world. The movie chronicles the vaulted highs and crushing lows of an artist struggling to find peace and balance between his professional work and his personal art. This is especially complicated for a man who struggles with the virtues he most often mocks in his art...Vanity, ego and fame.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 3, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Neil Berkeley'], 'writers': ['Neil Berkeley', 'Chris Bradley', 'Kevin Klauber'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-15 02:12:49.050000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.5, 'votes': 857, 'id': 2040281}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://beautyisembarrassing.com', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.1, 'numReviews': 756, 'meter': 89}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 1, 21, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 7.4, 'numReviews': 30, 'meter': 90}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 15, 17, 43, 16), 'rotten': 3, 'production': 'Independent Pictures', 'fresh': 27}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d5f29313caabd9d5fc'), 'fullplot': \"Nichole Barlow comes to San Pedro with her daughter Eva to attend the funeral of her mother. She calls her estranged sister Annie to help her to resolve pending businesses, but Annie is too traumatized with the bad treatment spent by their mother and does not want to return to their childhood home. Nichole convinces her sister to come and she arrives to the funeral. However, Nichole goes missing and Eva stays with Nichole's cousin Liz. When Liz also disappears, Annie claims that supernatural events happen in the house but she becomes the prime-suspect. The open-minded detective Bill Creek assumes the investigation and realizes that there is something weird in the house. Meanwhile Annie summons the medium Stevie believing that the ghost of her mother is responsible for the vanishing of Nichole and Liz. But the woman warns Annie that there is a great danger in the house. Annie decides to go further in her investigation and discovers dark secrets from the past of her family.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 5.8, 'votes': 17727, 'id': 2040560}, 'year': 2012, 'plot': \"As a woman struggles to come to grips with her past in the wake of her mother's death and the disappearance of her sister, an unsettling presence emerges in her childhood home.\", 'genres': ['Horror', 'Mystery', 'Thriller'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 54, 'title': 'The Pact', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-15 05:38:44.637000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Nicholas McCarthy'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.ifcfilms.com/films/the-pact', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.0, 'numReviews': 9680, 'meter': 41}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 11, 6, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.7, 'numReviews': 33, 'meter': 67}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 17, 18, 10, 58), 'rotten': 11, 'production': 'IFC Films', 'fresh': 22}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTU1NDI4ODA4N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNDMyMzk4Nw@@._V1_SY1000_SX67