            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d7f29313caabda2bf7'), 'plot': 'Summer war games between neighborhood kids turn deadly serious when jealousy and betrayal enter the mix.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Comedy', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 94, 'metacritic': 58, 'cast': ['Siam Yu', 'Gage Munroe', 'Michael Friend', 'Aidan Gouveia'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOTg4NTQyODIyM15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMjI1OTQ4OQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'I Declare War', 'fullplot': \"Armed with nothing more than twigs, their imaginations and a simple set of rules, a group of 12-year-olds engaged in a lively game of Capture the Flag in the neighborhood woods start dangerously blurring the lines between make-believe and reality. Paint-filled balloons = Grenades. Trees = Control towers. Sticks = Sub-machine guns. The youthful innocence of the game gradually takes on a different tone as the quest for victory pushes the boundaries of friendship. The would-be warriors get a searing glimpse of humanity's dark side as their combat scenario takes them beyond the rules of the game and into an adventure where fantasy combat clashes with the real world.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 6, 6, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jason Lapeyre', 'Robert Wilson'], 'writers': ['Jason Lapeyre'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-19 00:26:48.953000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.0, 'votes': 2246, 'id': 2133239}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.ideclarewar.ca/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.2, 'numReviews': 1854, 'meter': 52}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 11, 12, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 6.6, 'numReviews': 37, 'meter': 70}, 'boxOffice': '$14.9k', 'rotten': 11, 'production': 'Drafthouse Films', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 12, 19, 31, 56), 'fresh': 26}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d7f29313caabda2694'), 'plot': 'A documentary that follows a billionaire couple as they begin construction on a mansion inspired by Versailles. During the next two years, their empire, fueled by the real estate bubble and cheap money, falters due to the economic crisis.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 100, 'metacritic': 80, 'cast': ['Lorraine Barrett', 'June Downs', 'Phillip Froehlich', 'Marissa Gaspay'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTM0MzY0NDc3NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMTAyODY4Nw@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Queen of Versailles', 'fullplot': 'In 2008, the Siegel family was top of the heap with the wealthy and politically influential David Siegel running the successful Westgate Resorts time-share business. To enjoy their good life, he and his engineer turned beauty queen trophy wife, Jackie, were building the largest single family private home in America. Suddenly, both the US economy and Westgate were rocked by the devastating sub-prime mortgage collapse. In the new economic reality with the business teetering on ruin, we follow the Siegels as they struggle to scale down their grotesquely ostentatious lifestyle. For this overprivileged family, accepting that situation proved a dispiriting struggle even as their unfinished dream home became a monument of their superficial values.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 8, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Lauren Greenfield'], 'rated': 'PG', 'awards': {'wins': 10, 'nominations': 23, 'text': '10 wins & 23 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-13 00:42:25.173000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.1, 'votes': 9939, 'id': 2125666}, 'countries': ['USA', 'Netherlands', 'UK', 'Denmark'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.magpictures.com/queenofversailles/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.7, 'numReviews': 15322, 'meter': 73}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 11, 13, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 8