            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d7f29313caabda2662'), 'fullplot': \"In the early 1970s, Sixto Rodriguez was a Detroit folksinger who had a short-lived recording career with only two well received but non-selling albums. Unknown to Rodriguez, his musical story continued in South Africa where he became a pop music icon and inspiration for generations. Long rumored there to be dead by suicide, a few fans in the 1990s decided to seek out the truth of their hero's fate. What follows is a bizarrely heartening story in which they found far more in their quest than they ever hoped, while a Detroit construction laborer discovered that his lost artistic dreams came true after all.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 8.2, 'votes': 44398, 'id': 2125608}, 'year': 2012, 'plot': \"Two South Africans set out to discover what happened to their unlikely musical hero, the mysterious 1970s rock 'n' roller, Rodriguez.\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography', 'Music'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'metacritic': 79, 'title': 'Searching for Sugar Man', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-17 02:49:29.623000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Malik Bendjelloul', \"Stephen 'Sugar' Segerman (article)\", 'Craig Bartholomew Strydom (article)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.sonyclassics.com/searchingforsugarman/', 'viewer': {'rating': 4.3, 'numReviews': 18511, 'meter': 92}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 1, 22, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 8.0, 'numReviews': 118, 'meter': 94}, 'boxOffice': '$3.1M', 'consensus': 'A fascinating portrait of a forgotten musical pioneer, Searching for Sugar Man is by turns informative and mysterious.', 'rotten': 7, 'production': 'Sony Pictures Classics', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 12, 18, 28, 31), 'fresh': 111}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMWYyMzgxNDQtMDI2Mi00NmMzLWI5MTAtMmUwNDg3Yjg3N2U3XkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNzI1NzMxNzM@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 7, 26, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wi