            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d7f29313caabda481d'), 'plot': 'Adam, and a dog, in the Garden of Eden.', 'genres': ['Animation', 'Short'], 'runtime': 16, 'title': 'Adam and Dog', 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMzc1NzcyNzY4Nl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNTEwMDIwOQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['USA'], 'fullplot': 'Dog walks Eden. Then one day he meets a strange creature, Adam. Side by side, they spend their days in the flourishing garden, and become inseparable companions - until a new creature arrives: Eve. After meeting this new companion, who is similar to him, Adam neglects Dog. But after the Fall of Man, when the two Humans must leave the Garden, he consorts with them into the realm of hardship.', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 2, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Minkyu Lee'], 'writers': ['Minkyu Lee'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 0, 'text': 'Nominated for 1 Oscar. Another 1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-15 00:57:34.410000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 1862, 'id': 2162565}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 2.2, 'numReviews': 9, 'meter': 17}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2014, 7, 14, 0, 0), 'website': 'http://www.artofdarknessmovie.com/', 'production': 'Viva Pictures', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 6, 29, 20, 9, 59)}}\n",
