            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d8f29313caabda6a94'), 'plot': 'A father and a son live in a poor area, near the Bulgarian-Turkish-Greek border.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 107, 'cast': ['Assen Blatechki', 'Ovanes Torosian', 'Ina Nikolova', 'Predrag Manojlovic'], 'title': 'The Judgement', 'fullplot': \"This is the story of Mityo and his son Vasko, who live in a poor area near the Bulgarian-Turkish-Greek border. Mityo has lost his wife, the respect of his 18-year-old son and the job that enabled him to pay off the loan for his mortgaged house. Desperate, he accepts a proposal from his former military commander (Predrag Manojlovic) to smuggle illegal Syrian immigrants across the border he once had to defend. The road leads across a peak called The Judgment, a place full of dark memories from thousands of years of history, but also from Mityo's own past. The revelation of his terrible secret will force him to face the past, in order to regain his internal peace and find forgiveness from his son.\", 'languages': ['Bulgarian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 10, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Stephan Komandarev'], 'writers': ['Marin Damyanov', 'Stephan Komandarev', 'Emil Spahiyski'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-01 01:09:34.850000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.0, 'votes': 125, 'id': 2199436}, 'countries': ['Bulgaria', 'Germany', 'Croatia'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 1, 6, 10, 5, 44)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
