            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d8f29313caabda783b'), 'plot': 'The everyday lives of teenagers, coming from various social backgrounds. For them, sexuality has become a substitute for love, resulting from emotional neglect.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 90, 'cast': ['Muriel Wimmer', 'Antonia Putiloff', 'Joseph Konrad Bundschuh', 'Isabell Gerschke'], 'title': 'Little Thirteen', 'fullplot': \"Sarah is 13. She and her best friend Charly (16) have already lost count of the men they have been to bed with: one night stands, nameless, and interchangeable - no commitments. Then Sarah meets 18-year-old Lukas in a chat room, and for the first time in her life she longs for a real relationship, for true love even. But is Lukas really interested in her? Or is he just using Sarah for a reason that lies far beyond love and affection? Meanwhile, Charly has to find a father for her unborn child, and Sarah's mother has to cope with the fact that she's not a teenager anymore... Three days in the lives of a group of teenagers struggling to grow up and to find their places in life.\", 'languages': ['German'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 7, 5, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Christian Klandt'], 'writers': ['Catrin Lèth'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 8, 'text': '1 win & 8 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-27 00:46:59.557000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.4, 'votes': 418, 'id': 2215267}, 'countries': ['Germany'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 2.2, 'numReviews': 13}, 'website': 'http://www.facebook.com/littlethirteen', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 5, 18, 31, 35)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
