            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d9f29313caabda92a9'), 'plot': 'The misadventures of a teenager girl in her new life as zombie.', 'genres': ['Animation', 'Comedy', 'Fantasy'], 'runtime': 80, 'rated': 'PG', 'cast': ['Paula Ribè', 'Nèria Trifol', 'Ivan Labanda', 'Elisabeth Bergallè'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNzA0MTkxMjgzN15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNzM4NjA2MDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': \"Daddy, I'm a Zombie\", 'fullplot': 'Dixie is a 13-year-old girl, unhappy with her life: five years ago her mother divorced from her father, a coroner, and in her college she is considered weird due to her gothic aspect. One night, Dixie suffers an accident when a tree crashes against her during a storm. Dixie wakes up later in the middle of a cemetery, turned in a zombie. With the help of Isis, an Egyptian mummy, and Gonner, a pirate zombie, Dixie tries to return to life, looking for Vitriol, a strange man who roams by the forest close to the cemetery. However, her search is followed by Negrida, an evil zombie witch who wants the Azoth, a mystical item which, according to the legend, will open the portal between the living world and the dead realm, giving Negrida the chance to accomplish her evil plans to invade the living world with her zombie armies.', 'languages': ['Spanish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 1, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Joan Espinach', 'Ricardo Ramèn'], 'writers': ['Daniel Torres'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-11 00:07:08.257000000', 'year': 2011, 'imdb': {'rating': 4.4, 'votes': 318, 'id': 2243469}, 'countries': ['Spain'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 6, 26, 20, 8, 47)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d9f29313caabda9273'), 'plot': \"When an encounter with the swinging scene has an unexpected impact on David's impotence, Alice thinks she might have found the solution to all their problems, but the poly-amorous world is a difficult place for a love story to flourish.\", 'genres': ['Romance'], 'countries': ['UK'], 'cast': ['Elena Anaya', 'Owen McDonnell', 'Elizabeth McGovern', 'Gerry McLaughlin'], 'title': 'Swung', 'fullplot': \"David's life is on the slide: he's in the middle of a divorce, broke and 'can't get it up'. His girlfriend, Alice, is his rock, but the magazine she writes for is going down and the pressure is on to find a story. While job hunting online, David stumbles across the perfect antidote to his boredom: a 'Swingers' site. The resulting inbox of lewd invitations on the home-laptop justifiably upsets Alice, until she realises this could be just the 'story' she needs. The idea of uncovering the swinging scene causes quite a stir in Alice's office and, much to David's chagrin, she is urged to pursue the story. Their first reluctant foray is an hysterically low-rent initiation, however, an unexpected upturn for David's manhood is all the extra encouragement they need. As events accelerate beyond their control the once adoring couple become lost and fundamental questions are asked of their relationship and them as individuals. In darkness, touched by many others, they will have to find themselves or lose each other forever. SWUNG is a graphic, touching and funny drama about the secret underside of a very modern relationship taken to its emotional and sexual limits.\", 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 6, 19, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Colin Kennedy'], 'writers': ['Ewan Morrison'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-19 00:42:17.703000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.9, 'votes': 7, 'id': 2243260}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.8, 'numReviews': 16}, 'website': 'http://santosvstetona.com/', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 21, 18, 25, 19)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
