            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d9f29313caabda9e1a'), 'plot': 'A woman goes on the hunt for her dream man, armed with her wild imagination, her passion for Masala-films, and her ultra-sensitive sense of smell.', 'genres': ['Comedy'], 'countries': ['India'], 'cast': ['Rani Mukerji', 'Prithviraj Sukumaran', 'Nirmiti Sawant', 'Subodh Bhave'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'Aiyyaa', 'fullplot': \"Wildly imaginative and film-obsessed, Meenakshi Deshpande has an extra sensitive nose. After she is hired to work in a local college's library, she catches a wonderful scent in the air. The source is Surya, a handsome and enigmatic art student from a Tamil family. Meanwhile, Meenakshi's eccentric Marathi family has arranged for her marriage to Madhav, a kind and sensible man. Meenakshi is torn between marrying her parents' choice for a seemingly ideal husband, or following her nose and chasing the hunky stranger who may or may not be all that he seems.\", 'languages': ['Hindi'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 10, 12, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Sachin Kundalkar'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-02 00:19:57.803000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 4.3, 'votes': 1087, 'id': 2255934}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 2.3, 'numReviews': 117, 'meter': 29}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2012, 12, 11, 0, 0), 'production': 'Viva Entertainment', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 11, 19, 4)}}\n",
