            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d9f29313caabdaa0ff'), 'plot': 'Two young women follow completely divergent paths in the new, modernizing India-one wants to become Miss India, the other is a fierce Hindu Nationalist prepared to kill and die for her beliefs.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 90, 'metacritic': 77, 'rated': 'TV-PG', 'cast': ['Pooja Chopra', 'Marc Robinson', 'Ankita Shorey', 'Ruhi Singh'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNzAyOTEyMzc4Nl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMjg4NjI0OA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The World Before Her', 'fullplot': \"Ruhi Singh is a small town girl with big city dreams. She sets off to Bombay to win the title of Miss India--a launching pad to fame and a surefire way to stand out in a country of 1.2 billion people. Just hours from the Miss India beauty boot camp is another training ground for girls--that of the Durga Vahini, a Hindu nationalist group exclusively for women. Here we meet Prachi Trivedi, a young, fearsome drill sergeant training Indian girls to fight against Western culture, Islam and Christianity by any means necessary including violence. Gliding back and forth between the action of the two camps, the dreams and conflicts of India and young Indian women are laid bare-- the two opposing worlds aren't as far away from each other as they seem.\", 'languages': ['English', 'Hindi'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 4, 8, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Nisha Pahuja'], 'writers': ['Nisha Pahuja'], 'awards': {'wins': 6, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '6 wins & 4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-07 00:11:05.803000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.5, 'votes': 595, 'id': 2258685}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.worldbeforeher.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.9, 'numReviews': 350, 'meter': 79}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 8, 5, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 8.1, 'numReviews': 5, 'meter': 100}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 11, 17, 16, 57), 'rotten': 0, 'production': 'Cinedigm Entertainment', 'fresh': 5}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d9f29313caabdaa37b'), 'plot': 'Toby has always been unlucky with girls. Ever since being stabbed in the throat after asking a girl out in a cafè, Toby has resolved to learn everything he can about girls before meeting them - so he can become the man of their dreams.', 'genres': ['Comedy'], 'runtime': 85, 'cast': ['Richard Falkner', 'Scarlet Hemingway', 'Jonny Brugh', 'Aidee Walker'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjAxODQ4Mzk1OV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMTU2MzQyOA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'How to Meet Girls from a Distance', 'fullplot': \"Toby has always been unlucky with girls. Ever since getting stabbed in the throat after asking a girl out, Toby has resolved to learn everything he can about girls before meeting them. So he can become the man of their dreams. After faking yet another girlfriend, his mother takes matters into her own hands and signs him up with a dating coach. But Toby has finally found Phoebe. She's intelligent, enchanting and she's hot, everything Toby has been looking for. But this girl brings challenges that Toby hasn't had to face before including a boyfriend. Toby finds himself crossing lines he never thought he'd cross. Then there's the problem of how to keep her, without her finding out that he knows everything about her. How far would you go for a crush?\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 11, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Dean Hewison'], 'writers': ['Sam Dickson', 'Richard Falkner', 'Dean Hewison'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 5, 'text': '5 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-02 00:59:21.840000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.0, 'votes': 307, 'id': 2261542}, 'countries': ['New Zealand'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.0, 'numReviews': 13}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 4, 30, 19, 4, 25)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d9f29313caabdaa029'), 'plot': 'A murdered man is reincarnated as a housefly and seeks to avenge his death.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama', 'Fantasy'], 'runtime': 145, 'cast': ['Sudeep', 'Nani', 'Samantha Ruth Prabhu', 'Hamsa Nandini'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNzhiN2YzZDYtYjQzMy00YTVkLTk4OTItYTQ0ODllMGM5NjA1XkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMzU0ODc1MTQ@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Eega', 'fullplot': \"Sudeep is a high profile industrialist who gets whatever he wants and he has a special eye for beautiful women. To get them, he will not hesitate to do anything. That desire gets triggered when Sudeep sees Bindu, a micro artist who runs a non-profit organization. However, Bindu is loved by Nani who keeps following her everywhere. Though Bindu loves him, she doesn't express it to him and enjoys the attention. The story takes a turn when Sudeep discovers the feelings of Bindu for Nani and is unable to digest his defeat. He kills Nani. But Nani is born again as 'Eega'(fly) and he wants to take vengeance on Sudeep.\", 'languages': ['Telugu', 'Tamil', 'Hindi', 'Malayalam', 'Chinese', 'Urdu', 'Thai', 'Japanese', 'Portuguese', 'Kannada'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2012, 7, 5, 0, 0), 'directors': ['S.S. Rajamouli', 'J.V.V. Sathyanarayana'], 'writers': ['S.S. Kanchi (story)', 'Janardhan Maharshi (dialogue)', 'Crazy Mohan (dialogue)', 'Vijayendra Prasad (ideas of)', 'S.S. Rajamouli (story)', 'S.S. Rajamouli'], 'awards': {'wins': 33, 'nominations': 25, 'text': '33 wins & 25 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-17 00:51:59.267000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 8.0, 'votes': 10145, 'id': 2258337}, 'countries': ['India'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 2801, 'meter': 84}, 'production': 'Ficus', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 16, 18, 21, 20)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d9f29313caabdaa1f7'), 'plot': 'TAPIA takes us inside the tortured soul of Johnny Tapia, the 5-time world champion boxer whose unprecedented success was overshadowed by a volatile drug addiction brought on by the brutal ...', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Sport'], 'runtime': 82, 'cast': ['Johnny Tapia'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjIzNDU1MjY0OV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwODMxMTAyOA@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Tapia', 'fullplot': \"TAPIA takes us inside the tortured soul of Johnny Tapia, the 5-time world champion boxer whose unprecedented success was overshadowed by a volatile drug addiction brought on by the brutal rape and murder of his mother at the tender age of 8 years old. Director Eddie Alcazar candidly reveals Tapia's public struggles through intimate interviews, archival footage, and photos that showcase his vivacious personality and child-like gusto. With the love and support of his wife by his side, the film follows Johnny Tapia's rise to one of the most legendary fighters of our time, in and out of the ring.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 4, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Eddie Alcazar'], 'writers': ['Eddie Alcazar (story)', 'Eddie Alcazar', 'Eddie Alcazar'], 'awards': {'wins': 4, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '4 wins & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-07-05 00:23:55.427000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.6, 'votes': 119, 'id': 2260052}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.6, 'numReviews': 12}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 15, 18, 52, 2)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13d9f29313caabdaa010'), 'fullplot': \"Forest Whitaker plays a parolee, who finds Allah inside, and tries to get his life on track after 18 years. He's off to a good start with a job, a bank account, and a good woman. Of course his old partner in crime tries hard to get him to come back to his old ways, but the real problem is the sheriff in town who won't let him forget his dark past.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 5.6, 'votes': 1038, 'id': 2258285}, 'year': 2014, 'plot': 'A Muslim ex-con forms a friendship with his parole officer.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'rated': 'R', 'metacritic': 56, 'title': 'Two Men in Town', 'lastupdated': '2015-08-22 00:24:10.030000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Olivier Lorelle (adaptation)', 'Yasmina Khadra (adaptation)', 'Rachid Bouchareb (adaptation)', 'Josè Giovanni (original screenplay)', 'Daniel Boulanger (original screenplay)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.cohenmedia.net/films/2-men-in-town', 'viewer': {'rating': 2.8, 'numReviews': 164, 'meter': 30}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2015, 5, 12, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.4, 'numReviews': 16, 'meter': 44}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 10, 19, 18, 59), 'rotten': 9, 'production': 'Cohen Media Group', 'fresh': 7}, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQzNzE4NTkyOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwOTE1NDAzNDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 3, 6, 0, 0), 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'countries': ['France', 'Belgium', 'Algeria', 'USA'], 'cast': ['Forest Whitaker', 'Harvey Keitel', 'Ellen Burstyn', 'Reg E. Cathey'], 'directors': ['Rachid Bouchareb'], 'runtime': 120}\n",
