            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13daf29313caabdaca52'), 'plot': 'When a high school football star is suddenly stricken with irreversible total blindness, he must decide whether to live a safe handicapped life or bravely return to the life he once knew and the sport he still loves.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Family', 'Sport'], 'runtime': 98, 'metacritic': 45, 'rated': 'PG-13', 'cast': ['Mark Hapka', 'Bram Hoover', 'Stephen Lang', 'Max Adler'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTYwNjIxOTc4NF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMTI0MDA5MjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': '23 Blast', 'fullplot': 'In the prime of his youth, up and coming football star, Travis Freeman, lost his sight due to a sinus infection caused by a rare disease. Overnight, he became irreversibly blind, and had to cope with all the new trials and changes awaiting him. With the love and support of his family and closest friends he learned to push himself to extraordinary heights. Relying on his other senses and his instincts, he did the unthinkable! Displaying unconditional determination he proved nothing could dampen the spirit of a champion!', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 10, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Dylan Baker'], 'writers': ['Bram Hoover', 'Toni Hoover'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-16 07:18:33.280000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.1, 'votes': 629, 'id': 2304459}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.23Blast.com', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.9, 'numReviews': 4103, 'meter': 71}, 'critic': {'rating': 4.9, 'numReviews': 21, 'meter': 38}, 'boxOffice': '$0.5M', 'consensus': 'The real life story that inspired 23 Blast is undeniably heartwarming -- but the movie itself is too predictable and amateurish to recommend.', 'rotten': 13, 'production': 'Ocean Avenue Entertainment', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 24, 18, 35, 1), 'fresh': 8}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
