            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13daf29313caabdad0af'), 'plot': 'Inspired by true events, HEALING is a story of redemption, the discovery of hope and the healing of the spirit - in the most unlikely place for the most unlikely men.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 112, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Hugo Weaving', 'Don Hany', 'Xavier Samuel', 'Mark Leonard Winter'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTgwNTUyNzA2Nl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMjI2Nzc4NTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Healing', 'fullplot': 'Viktor Kahdem is a man who has almost given up on life, sentenced to a low-security prison farm, a completely non-threatening environment where it is still felt that some individuals can be reformed. At Won Wron, Case Worker Matt Perry has established a unique program to rehabilitate broken men through giving them the responsibility for the rehabilitation of injured raptors - beautiful, fearsome proud eagles, falcons and owls. Against all odds, Matt takes on Viktor as his number one test case, introducing him to Yasmine, the majestic wedge tailed eagle with a 2 metre wingspan. If these two can tame each other, anything is possible.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 5, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Craig Monahan'], 'writers': ['Craig Monahan', 'Alison Nisselle'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 6, 'text': '1 win & 6 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-20 00:24:22.720000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 443, 'id': 2310792}, 'countries': ['Australia'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.7, 'numReviews': 103}, 'fresh': 8, 'critic': {'rating': 6.4, 'numReviews': 11, 'meter': 73}, 'rotten': 3, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 15, 19, 0, 29)}}\n",
