            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13dbf29313caabdb0047'), 'plot': 'A restless teenager explores the wilderness of his city while struggling with the absence of his father.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 85, 'metacritic': 54, 'cast': ['Kodi Smit-McPhee', 'Virginia Madsen', 'Isabelle Fuhrman', 'Evan Ross'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjI5MTU3NTE5NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDA3NjkwNDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'All the Wilderness', 'fullplot': 'James has shut himself off from his surroundings, falling into a world of imagination and darkness. Visits with his psychiatrist have proven unhelpful - though he takes a liking to fellow patient, Val. As James begins to rebel against his single mother, he ventures into the night where he meets a mysterious kid who welcomes him into an eccentric city. Relationships are put to the test as James navigates unfamiliar territory, wrestling with the reality of his own personal wilderness.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 2, 20, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Michael Johnson'], 'writers': ['Michael Johnson'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-18 00:44:01.283000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.8, 'votes': 732, 'id': 2357770}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.thewildernessofjames.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.2, 'numReviews': 370, 'meter': 40}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2015, 5, 18, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.9, 'numReviews': 22, 'meter': 68}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 2, 19, 19, 54), 'rotten': 7, 'production': 'Screen Media Films', 'fresh': 15}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13dbf29313caabdb0083'), 'plot': \"Caroll Spinney has been Sesame Street's Big Bird and Oscar the Grouch since 1969; at 78-years-old, he has no intention of stopping.\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 90, 'metacritic': 72, 'cast': ['Frank Oz', 'Jim Henson', 'Steve Whitmire', 'Caroll Spinney'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTkyMDEyMjYxMF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwODE2Mzc3NDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'I Am Big Bird: The Caroll Spinney Story', 'fullplot': \"Think you know everything there is to know about Sesame Street? You don't. You might know that Frank Oz turned down an offer to play Big Bird, but you probably don't know that until a last minute change of heart by NASA, Big Bird was supposed to go to space aboard the Challenger. Or you may know that Oscar the Grouch got his voice from a cantankerous cabbie, but you'd be surprised to learn that a fire in his trash can almost led to Caroll's untimely demise. Caroll's stories are the stuff of legend. He has been a constant presence in our lives for over 40 years, his path weaving through American history like that of Forrest Gump. His time inside the Bird has taught him about the world and about himself. I AM BIG BIRD will peel away the instances in Caroll's life that inspired his creation of characters that influenced generations of children. And, as the yellow feathers give way to gray hair, it is the man, not the puppet, who will steal your heart.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 5, 6, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Dave LaMattina', 'Chad N. Walker'], 'writers': ['Dave LaMattina'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '2 wins & 4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-18 00:20:21.187000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.2, 'votes': 379, 'id': 2358456}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': da