            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13dff29313caabdb849f'), 'plot': 'In a time of starvation, a survivalist lives off a small plot of land hidden deep in forest. When two women seeking food and shelter discover his farm, he finds his existence threatened.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Sci-Fi', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 104, 'cast': ['Mia Goth', 'Martin McCann', 'Andrew Simpson', 'Douglas Russell'], 'title': 'The Survivalist', 'fullplot': 'The story of a man in a time of starvation, living off the grid since before the grid went down. Growing food on a small farm hidden deep in a forest, he protects his land from thieves and foragers with man traps and a shotgun. But the long years alone have taken their toll on him, and he is beginning to lose his grip on reality. His isolation is broken by two visitors; Kathryn and her teenage daughter, Milja. They are starving and desperate for food. Initially reluctant to share any, he relents when they offer a night with Milja. The exchange becomes an uneasy ongoing arrangement; as Kathryn schemes to take control of the farm, and the Survivalist finds his feelings growing for her daughter. When the farm comes under attack from outsiders, they find they must work together to survive, developing loyalties which will be tested when food runs short.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 4, 18, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Stephen Fingleton'], 'writers': ['Stephen Fingleton', 'Stephen Fingleton'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-15 00:55:54.100000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.5, 'votes': 22, 'id': 2580382}, 'countries': ['UK'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 1, 8, 23, 1, 19)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
