            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13dff29313caabdb82c5'), 'plot': 'Comic and tragic scenes from the lives of police officers in the Warsaw Traffic Department.', 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 118, 'cast': ['Bartlomiej Topa', 'Arkadiusz Jakubik', 'Julia Kijowska', 'Eryk Lubos'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'Traffic Department', 'fullplot': 'Seven friends, officers of the Traffic Police Department in Warsaw lead seemingly fulfilled lives. They work together, party together, together they play jokes, cut small deals and sport fast cars. Their small world gets rocked when one of them is found murdered. Seargent Krèl becomes a chief suspect in the case. He manages to escape arrest and as a fugitive tries to prove his innocence. Slowly he begins to uncover a corruption scheme which points towards high circles of authority in police and politics.', 'languages': ['Polish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 2, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Wojciech Smarzowski'], 'writers': ['Wojciech Smarzowski'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 6, 'text': '2 wins & 6 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-04 00:01:07.537000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.5, 'votes': 1776, 'id': 2577150}, 'countries': ['Poland'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.brookstreetpictures.com/features-1/girl-house/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.2, 'numReviews': 338, 'meter': 49}, 'critic': {'rating': 5.3, 'numReviews': 10, 'meter': 70}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 16, 17, 53, 2), 'rotten': 3, 'production': 'Entertainment One Films', 'fresh': 7}}\n",
