            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13dff29313caabdb9093'), 'plot': 'In a small Turkish town, two young tuberculous poets try to survive while publishing their poems. As they both fall in love, their life would never be the same.', 'genres': ['Biography', 'Drama', 'History'], 'runtime': 138, 'cast': ['Kivanè Tatlitug', 'Mert Firat', 'Belèim Bilgin', 'Farah Zeynep Abdullah'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMGI2ZTc4NzQtNmI0OS00ODI0LTgyMmYtZWY1MjJiMzc2NzkzXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNjIxMDkyODY@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': \"The Butterfly's Dream\", 'fullplot': 'Last days of 1941 summer, the era of Obligation, during the famine atmosphere of the Second World War. In the middle of all this poverty and turmoil, there are two poets in their early twenties: Muzaffer Tayyip Uslu and Rustu Onur. They have been carrying tuberculosis germs in their lungs and love of poetry in their hearts for years. Two poets who have the constant habit of making bets on things that they do not own, make a bet on a beautiful girl. They will both write a poem for her and whichever Suzan likes, the other will fade from the scene..', 'languages': ['Turkish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 2, 22, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Yilmaz Erdogan'], 'writers': ['Yilmaz Erdogan'], 'awards': {'wins': 13, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '13 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-06 00:43:04.070000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 8.0, 'votes': 11458, 'id': 2608224}, 'countries': ['Turkey'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.1, 'numReviews': 85}, 'website': 'http://www.kelebeginruyasifilm.com/', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 24, 18, 46, 41)}}\n",
