            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e1f29313caabdbc97b'), 'plot': \"Combining over twelve years of footage and narrated by their twin sons, TWO: The Story of Roman & Nyro, follows legendary songwriter Desmond Child and his lifelong partner's loving journey to create their new modern family.\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 71, 'cast': ['Univ. Miami Indian Students Assoc.', 'Karl Bakke', 'John Barrett', 'Jon Bon Jovi'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQ0MDY5MjYyOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNjU5ODMzMDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Two: The Story of Roman & Nyro', 'fullplot': \"TWO: The Story Of Roman and Nyro documents the 12-year journey of legendary songwriter Desmond Child and his lifelong partner Curtis Shaw, and the extraordinary way they met and connected with Angela Whittaker, the woman who would carry their twin sons, Roman and Nyro, into the world. From preconception through the boys' first 10 years, TWO is the personal and powerful story of these unique individuals whose lives become inextricably woven together in magical and unexpected ways. TWO is testament to the universal power and ultimate triumph of love - that it is love that makes a family, affirming modern families may be modern in their making, but timelessly human at their core.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 9, 28, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Heather Winters'], 'writers': ['Desmond Child', 'Curtis Shaw Child', 'Heather Winters'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-14 00:09:44.833000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 28, 'id': 2740874}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.7, 'numReviews': 18, 'meter': 67}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2014, 8, 18, 0, 0), 'website': 'http://www.twothedocumentary.com/', 'production': 'Deston Entertainment', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 5