            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e3f29313caabdc0990'), 'plot': 'Via a magic mirror, Twilight Sparkle travels into an alternate universe in order to recover a crown that was stolen from the Crystal Empire. Upon her arrival she is horrified to learn that she has turned into a human.', 'genres': ['Animation', 'Comedy', 'Family'], 'runtime': 72, 'rated': 'G', 'cast': ['Tara Strong', 'Ashleigh Ball', 'Andrea Libman', 'Tabitha St. Germain'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTg4MzI3MzA3NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNjc2NzM2OQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls', 'fullplot': 'In Equestria, the newly crowned Princess Twilight Sparkle is still trying to adjust to her new status and wings. However, Sunset Shimmer a renegade former student of Princess Celestia, steals her magic crown and escapes to another world. Twilight is charged with recovering the crown and she and her companion, Spike, pursue the thief. Crossing over, Twilight finds that she has been changed into a powerless human in a high school world populated with teenage human counterparts of her friends. To save both worlds, Twilight must rediscover the magic of friendship that transcends everything she imagined possible.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 8, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jayson Thiessen', 'Noelle Benvenuti'], 'writers': ['Meghan McCarthy', 'Lauren Faust (television series: \"My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic\")'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-01 00:05:56.210000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.1, 'votes': 3182, 'id': 2908228}, 'countries': ['Canada', 'USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 3273, 'meter': 77}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2013, 8, 6, 0, 0), 'website': 'http://www.MLPEG.com', 'production': 'Screenvision', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 11, 17, 30, 6)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e3f29313caabdc09b4'), 'fullplot': \"One choice can transform you-or it can destroy you. But every choice has consequences, and as unrest surges in the factions all around her, Tris Prior must continue trying to save those she loves--and herself--while grappling with haunting questions of grief and forgiveness, identity and loyalty, politics and love. Tris's initiation day should have been marked by celebration and victory with her chosen faction; instead, the day ended with unspeakable horrors. War now looms as conflict between the factions and their ideologies grows. And in times of war, sides must be chosen, secrets will emerge, and choices will become even more irrevocable--and even more powerful. Transformed by her own decisions but also by haunting grief and guilt, radical new discoveries, and shifting relationships. Tris must fully embrace her Divergence, even if she does not know what she may lose by doing so.\", 'imdb': {'rating': 6.4, 'votes': 93387, 'id': 2908446}, 'year': 2015, 'plot': 'Beatrice Prior must confront her inner demons and continue her fight against a powerful alliance which threatens to tear her society apart with the help from others on her side.', 'genres': ['Adventure', 'Sci-Fi', 'Thriller'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'metacritic': 42, 'title': 'Insurgent', 'lastupdated': '2015-09-05 00:31:56.753000000', 'languages': ['English'], 'writers': ['Brian Duffield (screenplay)', 'Akiva Goldsman (screenplay)', 'Mark Bomback (screenplay)', 'Veronica Roth (novel)'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.thedivergentseries.com/', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.6, 'numReviews': 72411, 'meter': 62}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 4, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.1, 'numReviews': 165, 'meter': 30}, 'boxOffice': '$130.1M', 'consensus': 'Shailene Woodley gives it her all, but Insurgent is still a resounding step back for a franchise struggling to distinguish itself from the dystopian YA crowd.', 'rotten': 116, 'prod