            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e3f29313caabdc0884'), 'plot': \"MI5 agent on the tax-exile islands (Turks and Caicos) encounter a CIA agent and some American businessmen, on the islands for a conference. When one of them falls in the sea, another of them seems to know more than she's sharing.\", 'genres': ['Action', 'Drama', 'Mystery'], 'runtime': 95, 'cast': ['Winona Ryder', 'Christopher Walken', 'Bill Nighy', 'Hansel Piper'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BZTQzNWExNjMtMDc0Ni00YTZiLTkwM2MtYjU4YjU3OTFmNzcyXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNDE4OTY5NzI@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Turks & Caicos', 'fullplot': \"Johnny Worricker is hiding out from his work at MI5 on the tax-exile islands, Turks & Caicos. But an encounter with a CIA agent forces him into the company of some ambiguous American businessmen who claim to be on the islands for a conference on the global financial crisis. When one of them falls in the sea, then it's their financial PR who seems to know more than she's letting on. But will she help Johnny come to an understanding of what these men do and why they're here?\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 11, 9, 0, 0), 'directors': ['David Hare'], 'writers': ['David Hare'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-22 00:27:13.563000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.6, 'votes': 2812, 'id': 2904608}, 'countries': ['UK'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.2, 'numReviews': 86}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 21, 18, 47, 33)}}\n",
