            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e5f29313caabdc3ff1'), 'plot': 'About Nae-kyung who is able to assess the personality, mental state and habits of a person by looking at his face. Because of his abilities, he gets involved in a power struggle between Prince Sooyang and Kim Jong-Seo.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'History'], 'runtime': 142, 'cast': ['Kang-ho Song', 'Jung-jae Lee', 'Yun-shik Baek', 'Jung-suk Jo'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BM2NhMjUwMDItYTg2YS00NDRlLWExNzQtMWZjMDJiOTIxODE5XkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNTAyODkwOQ@@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Face Reader', 'fullplot': \"Set during the seizure of the throne by Sejo of Joseon in the year 1455, the movie follows the life of Nae-Kyung. Nae-Kyung, the son of a ruined noble family, goes all around Joseon and studies physiognomy. He is able to assess the personality, mental state and habits of a person by looking at someone's face. Because of his abilities, he gets involved in a power struggle between Prince Sooyang and Kim Jong-Seo.\", 'languages': ['Korean'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 10, 4, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jae-rim Han'], 'writers': ['Dong-Hyuk Kim (screenplay)', 'Jae-rim Han (screenplay)'], 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 10, 'text': '5 wins & 10 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-02 00:20:47.023000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.8, 'votes': 955, 'id': 3008014}, 'countries': ['South Korea'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.7, 'numReviews': 290, 'meter': 74}, 'website': 'http://www.face-reader.co.kr', 'production': 'Pan Media & Entertainment', 'boxOffice': '$0.5M', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 14, 17, 13, 40)}}\n",
