            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e6f29313caabdc460d'), 'plot': \"Bank teller Till Reiners' life is torn out of a rut by a series of offbeat coincidences, which ultimately lead him to find himself and realize: His life isn't so bad after all...\", 'genres': ['Action', 'Adventure', 'Comedy'], 'runtime': 110, 'cast': ['Moritz Bleibtreu', 'Axel Stein', 'Jasmin Gerat', 'Anna Maria Mèhe'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTk4NDQ1ODgwNF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDMzNDEwMzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Not My Day', 'fullplot': 'Till Reiners, mid-30s, has been a teller at Osthofen Mutual Bank for almost 15 years, leading a settled, regular life. His marriage to ambitious purse designer MIRIAM is happy, but in danger of getting into a rut after all those years of harmony. The die hard hard rock lover\\'s life is not exactly exciting, except for when his 4-year-old son has a crying fit because he lost his favorite snuggle bunny. All of a sudden, Till is torn from his daily routine when a bank robber storms his branch and takes Till hostage after his getaway car breaks down. When the kidnapper takes his mask off, Till recognizes NAPPO, a former con who just got out of jail and wanted a loan from Till to buy a new car the other day, but Till turned him down for professional reasons. As the police set up roadblocks and Miriam awaits her husband\\'s call, Nappo decides to abandon Till in the trunk of the car the next morning and disappear with his loot. But it doesn\\'t work out that way. Till and Nappo have to flee together. Pretty soon, Till has had enough. He summons all his courage and demands to call his wife, but the call turns into a fiasco. Due to a misunderstanding, Till gets the impression his wife doesn\\'t care for him at all. Completely confused after this phone call, Till throws caution to the wind and dives into adventure with his kidnapper, Nappo. The odd couple even discovers a shared passion, their mutual love for hard rockers \"Donar\". Till really starts having a good time when he\\'s able to use his banking skills to arrange an extremely lucrative deal for Nappo. More and more, Till relishes the gangster life and his newfound freedom, which takes him across the border to Holland. Little does Till realize the police are already treating him as a suspect and accomplice in the bank robbery. Miriam refuses to believe her husband is in cahoots with the gangster, and sets out for Amsterdam to find her husband without the help of the police. However, Miriam winds up in danger due to the shady deal Till has arranged. Her husband, meanwhile, has realized his old, \"square\" life maybe wasn\\'t so bad after all, and has to risk all to rescue his beloved wife in a dramatic showdown.', 'languages': ['German', 'English', 'Dutch', 'Albanian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 1, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Peter Thorwarth'], 'writers': ['Stefan Holtz', 'Ralf Husmann (novel)', 'Peter Thorwarth (screenplay)', 'Peter Thorwarth'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-31 00:01:38.107000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 2326, 'id': 3019694}, 'countries': ['Germany'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.1, 'numReviews': 23}, 'production': 'Westside Filmproduktion GmbH', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 8, 10, 18, 6, 26)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e5f29313caabdc4077'), 'plot': \"A long hot summer in rural Norfolk and a rough coming of age for Goob Taylor,fighting with brutal,womanizing stock car racer Gene Womack for his mother's attention ,and falling for the exotic charms of a pretty foreign field worker.\", 'genres': ['Drama', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 84, 'cast': ['Sean Harris', 'Sienna Guillory', 'Hannah Spearritt', 'Marama Corlett'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMGNkOTFiZjItNmI5NC00MTM4LWJjMzctZWMxODI5OWY3OTBlXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMTMxMTY0OTQ@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Goob', 'fullplot': \"Young Goob, 16 years old, returns home to his mother where he grew up in the countryside, between a small restaurant and a field of pumpkins. His mother's new companion and Goob don't get along. This summer Goob will mature in many ways, dealing with a girl in the stock-car circuit, a gay cousin who dances, and problems with a seasonal woman fieldworker.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 5, 29, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Guy Myhill'], 'writers': ['Guy Myhill'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 6, 'text': '3 wins & 6 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-10 17:39:03.790000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.1, 'votes': 150, 'id': 3009070}, 'countries': ['UK'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 3.5, 'numReviews': 78}, 'fresh': 11, 'critic': {'rating': 6.4, 'numReviews': 12, 'meter': 92}, 'rotten': 1, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 10, 18, 25, 28)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e6f29313caabdc45ff'), 'plot': \"In the badlands of Delhi's dystopic underbelly, Titli, the youngest member of a violent car-jacking brotherhood, plots a desperate bid to escape the 'family' business.\", 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 124, 'cast': ['Shashank Arora', 'Lalit Behl', 'Shivani Raghuvanshi', 'Ranvir Shorey'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNDE1OTA0OTE3NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMzgyNTE4MTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Titli', 'fullplot': '\"In the badlands of Delhi\\'s dystopic underbelly, Titli, the youngest member of a violent car-jacking brotherhood plots a desperate bid to escape the \\'family\\' business. His struggle to do, so is countered at each stage by his indignant brothers, who finally try marrying him off to \\'settle\\' him. Titli finds an unlikely ally in his new wife, Neelu, who nurtures her own set of frustrated dreams. They form a strange, mutually exploitative partnership in a desperate bid to escape the stranglehold of their family roots. But is escape the same as freedom?', 'languages': ['Hindi'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 10, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Kanu Behl'], 'writers': ['Kanu Behl', 'Sharat Katariya', 'Olivia Stewart (script collaborator)'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 5, 'text': '1 win & 5 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-24 01:07:00.493000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.4, 'votes': 138, 'id': 3019620}, 'countries': ['India'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.0, 'numReviews': 6}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 6, 29, 18, 50, 21)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e6f29313caabdc4dcb'), 'plot': 'American boy Peter and blind minstrel Ivan are thrown together by fate amidst the turbulent mid-30s Soviet Ukraine.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'History'], 'runtime': 122, 'cast': ['Stanislav Boklan', 'Jeff Burrell', 'Anton Sviatoslav Greene', 'Andriy Haddad'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNDA5MDA3NzQ2N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMzA2Nzg1MzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Guide', 'fullplot': \"Early 1930th. Peter is ten years old boy in the midst of turbulent Soviet Ukraine. His father, American engineer, is killed for obtaining secret documents about repressions, which now are hidden in Peter's book. Boy flees from police with a blind Kobzar (Ukrainian folk minstrel), Ivan Kocherga. Ivan does everything to help his young guide to grow up and survive with a kind and clear soul that will not be hardened by what his eyes have seen. He tells his young guide elaborate stories that make him believe there can be a different reality from what he sees around him. We are challenged to admit the blind Kobzar may see the world with greater clarity than those with perfect eyes.\", 'languages': ['Ukrainian', 'Russian', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 11, 12, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Oles Sanin'], 'writers': ['Olexandr Irvanets', 'Iren Razdobudko', 'Oles Sanin', 'Paul Wolansky'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '3 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-07-14 00:37:41.007000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 8.5, 'votes': 1546, 'id': 3037582}, 'countries': ['Ukraine'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.5, 'numReviews': 5}, 'website': 'http://povodyr.com/', 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 13, 18, 6, 6)}, 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e6f29313caabdc5478'), 'plot': \"Robert Kenner is a lonely man looking for love. Today, if he can actually get his boss to give him some time off, he is going on his first date for 6 years. Oh, and he is also the world's only SuperHero.\", 'genres': ['Action', 'Comedy', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 85, 'cast': ['Brett Goldstein', 'Catherine Tate', 'Natalia Tena', 'Laura Haddock'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'SuperBob', 'fullplot': 'Faster than a Speeding Bullet, Crap with Girls: After a freak meteor storm turns postman Bob into a superhero, he must face his greatest challenge: going on his first date in six years. Featuring stellar support from top tier comedic talent, Bob must balance international politics, saving the world and getting the girl.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 10, 16, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jon Drever'], 'writers': ['William Bridges', 'Jon Drever (story)', 'Brett Goldstein'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-25 00:19:50.620000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': '', 'votes': '', 'id': 3055402}, 'countries': ['UK'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 4.7, 'numReviews': 4}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 2, 18, 14, 13)}}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e6f29313caabdc5824'), 'plot': 'A policeman father gets a repeat juvenile offender to be a cross country running partner for his blind high school son.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Family'], 'runtime': 89, 'rated': 'PG', 'cast': ['Richard Harmon', 'Jaren Brandt Bartlett', 'Craig Bierko', 'Jill Hennessy'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTY3MTc1OTY1MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDUyODk4MDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'If I Had Wings', 'fullplot': \"Seventeen-year-old Alex Taylor dreams of running for his high school's cross-country team, a dream that's a bit out of reach for this gifted runner as Alex has been blind since the age of two. Determined to run, he practices with his father, Probation Officer Geoff Taylor. Geoff, with additional girth and age working against him, finds he no longer can keep up with his son. He must find a running partner at the school who's fast enough to help Alex make the cross-country team. This help comes from the unlikeliest of sources. Brad Coleman, a schoolmate of Alex's, spends most of his time running from the law. Caught in a pathetic daytime robbery attempt, Brad faces incarceration for repeat offenses. To keep Brad out of jail and in school, Geoff makes a deal and pairs the two boys, opposite in many ways. Despite a rocky start over their many differences, an unlikely friendship forms.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 12, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Allan Harmon'], 'writers': ['Michael Markus', 'Tim Stubinski'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 9, 'text': '1 win & 9 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-24 00:16:21.947000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.3, 'votes': 475, 'id': 3063462}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'website': 'http://www.BadGrandpa.com', 'viewer': {'rating': 3.5, 'numReviews': 103642, 'meter': 61}, 'dvd': datetime.datetime(2014, 1, 28, 0, 0), 'critic': {'rating': 5.5, 'numReviews': 105, 'meter': 