            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e7f29313caabdc81be'), 'plot': 'Since its triumphant premiere at the Paris Opera in 1928, the Ondes Martenot has generated fascination and inspired legions of musicians. Invented by the musician and educator Maurice ...', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 96, 'title': 'Wavemakers', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjM0MzY4NTkxNl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwODkwMDUzMzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['Canada'], 'fullplot': \"Since its triumphant premiere at the Paris Opera in 1928, the Ondes Martenot has generated fascination and inspired legions of musicians. Invented by the musician and educator Maurice Martenot (1898-1980), this rare and fragile electronic instrument has been widely featured in popular and classical music-from the first film soundtracks, to Hollywood classics, science-fiction TV series and the works of Olivier Messiaen,Edith Piaf and the rock band Radiohead. So extraordinarily sensitive is the Martenot that nearly a century after its invention, musicians, artisans and scientists are still trying to unravel its secrets. Integrating verite and never-before-seen archives, this documentary features a soundtrack that contains a rich repertoire of the Martenot's haunting and lyrical sounds. Lend an ear - Wavemakers is a journey into the very heart of the mystery of of music.\", 'languages': ['French'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 1, 17, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Caroline Martel'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-06-16 00:15:50.997000000', 'year': 2012, 'imdb': {'rating': 8.0, 'votes': 6, 'id': 3146408}, 'type': 'movie', 'tomatoes': {'viewer': {'rating': 0.0, 'numReviews': 0}, 'lastUpdated': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 6, 20, 17, 38)}}\n",
