            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e8f29313caabdc9867'), 'plot': \"Progressive and talented Natasha and Roma dream of a European wedding by the sea - but Natasha's stepfather procured a different scenario. Rough official of the city administration ...\", 'genres': ['Comedy'], 'runtime': 100, 'cast': ['Yuliya Aleksandrova', 'Anastasiya Dobakhova', 'Egor Koreshkov', 'Evgeniy Kushpel'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOTM1MjMyNDYxN15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMjU3NzY3MzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Gorko!', 'fullplot': \"Progressive and talented Natasha and Roma dream of a European wedding by the sea - but Natasha's stepfather procured a different scenario. Rough official of the city administration considers the celebration as a springboard for their careers, and seeks to arrange all the èhow toè. Young awaits an unforgettable evening in the restaurant èGoldenè with a complete set of the tedious rites. Not fight, the guys decide to spend their dream wedding in secret from conservative relatives. But by accident both celebration come together.\", 'languages': ['Russian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 10, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Zhora Kryzhovnikov'], 'writers': ['Aleksey Kazakov', 'Zhora Kryzhovnikov', 'Nikolay Kulikov'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-03 00:38:34.930000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.9, 'votes': 1313, 'id': 3194532}, 'countries': ['Russia'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e8f29313caabdc906a'), 'plot': 'Obsessed with making a movie with Hollywood actress Anne Hathaway, a young man in Romania goes to shocking extremes using three local actresses to shoot scenes from the movie to send to Anne as proof of his filmmaking skills.', 'genres': ['Horror', 'Mystery', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 87, 'cast': ['Adrian Tofei', 'Sonia Teodoriu', 'Florentina Hariton', 'Alexandra Stroe'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNGYzMGIwNDctMTFiMS00NjEyLWEwNmItNWU1NzVkYzBkZTQ1XkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMjIwMjE3ODc@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Be My Cat: A Film for Anne', 'fullplot': \"A young man in Romania becomes obsessed with making a movie with Hollywood actress Anne Hathaway after seeing her catwoman performance in The Dark Knight Rises (2012). He tricks three Romanian actresses into thinking that he's a film director and shoots scenes from the movie he wants to make with Anne in order to send to her as proof of his filmmaking and acting skills, to convince her to come to Romania and play in his movie. The actresses are unaware of his goal towards Anne and think they are making a genuine film. He records not only those scenes, but also the whole process of working with the actresses and his personal messages to Anne, going to shocking extremes to convince her that they are meant to change the world together. He also plays the leading role in his scenes - the role of a guy obsessed with a fictional actress played by the real actresses - and the line between reality and fiction starts to blur, with both devastating consequences and unexpected revelations.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 3, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Adrian Tofei'], 'writers': ['Adrian Tofei'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-08 00:09:06.367000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.2, 'votes': 235, 'id': 3176980}, 'countries':