            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e8f29313caabdc8f57'), 'plot': 'When his lover becomes the latest victim of a serial killer, Guru blurs the line between good and evil in his pursuit of revenge.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Crime', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 129, 'cast': ['Sidharth Malhotra', 'Riteish Deshmukh', 'Shraddha Kapoor', 'Shaad Randhawa'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQzODMxNDU3MF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDAzNjMxMjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Villain', 'fullplot': 'Every love story has a hero, a heroine, and a villain. But this is the love story of a villain. Guru is a quiet, tough, and ruthless man, who works for a crooked politician. A dark past refuses to let Guru sleep at night until he meets Aisha. He falls in love with her and his life changes. Just when things seem perfect, she falls prey to an attack. Devastated, Guru starts hunting the miscreant and is shocked to learn of his seemingly innocuous and simple identity. Does Guru succeed in getting even with the assailant? And what is the motive behind the killings? The plot thickens as the astonishing mystery unveils and new realizations come to the forefront.', 'languages': ['Hindi'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 6, 27, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Mohit Suri'], 'writers': ['Tushar Hiranandani', 'Milap Zaveri (dialogue)'], 'awards': {'wins': 8, 'nominations': 7, 'text': '8 wins & 7 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-28 01:14:10.893000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.4, 'votes': 9874, 'id': 3175038}, 'countries': ['India'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e8f29313caabdc953a'), 'plot': 'A kid saves a dangerous dying fugitive and triggers off a chase between the hunter and the hunted and soon, the definitions blur.', 'genres': ['Crime', 'Mystery', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 141, 'cast': ['Myshkin', 'Sri', 'Adithya Menon', 'Bharath'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'title': 'The Wolf and the Lamb', 'fullplot': \"The entire film happens during one night in Chennai. One night Chandran (Shri) an upright medical student sees a badly injured stranger on a deserted road. Chandran takes the man with bullet injuries on his bike to hospitals which refuse to treat him. And unwittingly the young man's destiny is tied up with man whom he saved a killer on the run.\", 'languages': ['Tamil'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 9, 27, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Myshkin'], 'writers': ['Myshkin'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-22 00:15:29.907000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 8.1, 'votes': 975, 'id': 3185772}, 'countries': ['India'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
