            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e8f29313caabdcb19a'), 'plot': 'The unusual meeting between three deserters from different nationalities (Brazil, German and Italy) during World War II.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'History', 'War'], 'runtime': 107, 'title': 'A Estrada 47', 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjE2NDQ4NDk5OF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNDMyMTkxNTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['Portugal', 'Italy', 'Brazil'], 'fullplot': \"During World War II, looking up the Mountain, in Italy, a Brazilian Expeditionary Force - FEB - mines weeping platoon is hit by a panic-attack that sets them running aimlessly right in the middle of 'no man's land'. Desperate cold and hungry, the ill-prepared soldiers have to choose between facing military court or delve deeper into enemy lines. After a tense discussion, they decide to save their faces with the Brazilian Army by tackling a daring military objective: to disarm the most feared minefield in Italy. On their way there, they end meeting two others deserters; a remorseful Italian soldier trying to join the Partigianos and German officer who is just simply tired of war. with unexpected help of their ex-enemy, the soldiers are set to accomplish a mission that so far had been deemed impossible.\", 'languages': ['Portuguese', 'Italian', 'German'], 'cast': ['Sergio Rubini', 'Daniel de Oliveira', 'Thogun', 'Francisco Gaspar'], 'directors': ['Vicente Ferraz'], 'writers': ['Vicente Ferraz'], 'awards': {'wins': 4, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '4 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-13 16:50:39.233000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.3, 'votes': 184, 'id': 1841490}, 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e8f29313caabdcafba'), 'plot': 'What begins as a exciting camping trip to the legendary Redwood murder site, takes a terrifying turn when the innocent campers discover the legend is about to become a nasty and bloody reality.', 'genres': ['Fantasy', 'Horror'], 'runtime': 82, 'cast': ['Mark Wood', 'Lisa Cameron', 'Lisa Livingstone', 'Rebecca Wilkie'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQ5Mzg5MDM5Nl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwOTY0MjAwNjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Redwood Massacre', 'fullplot': 'For five adventurous friends, visiting the legendary murder site of the Redwood House has all the hallmarks of being an exciting and thrilling camping weekend away. A popular site for revellers and party goers, each year on the exact date of the famous local family massacre, people from around the country head out to the site to have fun and scare each other. Events take a bloody turn for the worse when the innocent campers discover the Redwood legend is in fact a horrible bloody reality, which turns the unsuspecting victims into prey for a mysterious axe wielding maniac that has remained dormant for 20 years.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 9, 28, 0, 0), 'directors': ['David Ryan Keith'], 'writers': ['David Ryan Keith (script)', 'David Ryan Keith (story)', 'David Ryan Keith'], 'awards': {'wins': 4, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '4 wins & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-17 00:43:49.500000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 3.8, 'votes': 1328, 'id': 3242756}, 'countries': ['UK'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e8f29313caabdcb34b'), 'plot': 'From Mars to Earth and underneath. Above and Below is a rough and rhythmic roller coaster ride seating five survivors in their daily hustle through an apocalyptic world. A journey of ...', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Adventure', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 110, 'title': 'Above and Below', 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'countries': ['Switzerland', 'Germany', 'USA'], 'fullplot': 'From Mars to Earth and underneath. Above and Below is a rough and rhythmic roller coaster ride seating five survivors in their daily hustle through an apocalyptic world. A journey of challenges and beauty in uncomfortable places: Rick & Cindy, Godfather Lalo in the flood channels deep down under the shiny strip of Sin City. Dave in the dry and lonesome Californian desert and April in simulation for a Mars mission in the Utah desert. Through the hustle, the pain and the laughs, we are whisked away to an unfamiliar world, yet quickly discover the souls we encounter are perhaps not that different from our own.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 1, 26, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Nicolas Steiner'], 'writers': ['Nicolas Steiner'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '1 win & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-06-18 00:40:43.093000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.4, 'votes': 35, 'id': 3249414}, 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e8f29313caabdcb22e'), 'plot': 'Four children set out on a journey to find a new home.', 'genres': ['Animation', 'Adventure', 'Family'], 'runtime': 86, 'rated': 'G', 'cast': ['Illeana Douglas', 'Mackenzie Foy', 'Zachary Gordon', 'Joey King'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTk3NDUwNjMwNF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMTcyMDMzMjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Boxcar Children', 'fullplot': 'Henry, Jessie, Violet and Benny are four orphaned brothers and sisters who mysteriously appear in a small town on a warm summer night. No one knows who these young wanderers are or where they have come from. Frightened to live with a grandfather they have never met, the children make a home for themselves in an old abandoned red boxcar they discover in the woods. Henry, the oldest, goes to town to earn money and buy food and supplies while the other kids make a home in the boxcar finding old dishes and scraps in a junkyard. Ambitious and resourceful, the plucky children make a happy life for themselves. As time passes, they discover the struggles and rewards of independence as well as the joys of family - until one day Violet gets too sick for her brothers and sister to care for her. They must take Violet to a doctor risking discovery and the loss of their secret home in the forest.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 4, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Daniel Chuba', 'Mark A.Z. Dippè', 'Kyungho Jo'], 'writers': ['Justin Merz', 'Zach Strauss', 'Gertrude Chandler Warner (book)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-01 00:51:53.460000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.8, 'votes': 224, 'id': 3246908}, 'countries': ['USA', 'Guatemala', 'South Korea'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
