            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e9f29313caabdcbbbc'), 'plot': \"Kristian Keskitalo was once a talented hockey player. Now, he's a nobody. Then, after a night spent together, his buddy Alex goes missing. Kristian starts acting increasingly aggressive and...\", 'genres': ['Drama', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 96, 'cast': ['Sverrir Gudnason', 'Peter Andersson', 'Malin Buska', 'Leonard Terfelt'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOTc1NTkzNTA4NF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNzc2MTQ1MzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Blowfly Park', 'fullplot': \"Kristian Keskitalo was once a talented hockey player. Now, he's a nobody. Then, after a night spent together, his buddy Alex goes missing. Kristian starts acting increasingly aggressive and irrational, getting mixed up with local kids, setting up shaky deals, looking to confront wrongdoers. Then, Alex is found dead. In the wake of tragedy, Kristian seems to connect with Alex's father, Berndt. But Kristian also longs for a connection with Diana, Alex's widow. And, he thinks he's the real father of Elias, their son. In fact, taking over his friend's life in all possible ways seem... well, natural, almost. Only, Kristian is a liar. The police are watching him, as is Berndt, both moving closer and closer, as Kristian edges towards breakdown.\", 'languages': ['Swedish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 11, 28, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jens èstberg'], 'writers': ['Jens èstberg'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-06 00:59:36.527000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.5, 'votes': 121, 'id': 3265506}, 'countries': ['Sweden'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e9f29313caabdcb88f'), 'plot': \"Before the West entered World War II, a Japanese death cult called the Temple of Hades is ordered to aid in the spiritual destruction of China. Their method - abduct their enemies' children...\", 'genres': ['Action', 'Fantasy'], 'runtime': 111, 'cast': ['Xing Yu', 'Sung-jun Yoo', 'Heon Jun Nam', 'Baocheng Jiang'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOTAxMDEyMjAxNl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwOTE3Mzg5MDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Wrath of Vajra', 'fullplot': \"Before the West entered World War II, a Japanese death cult called the Temple of Hades is ordered to aid in the spiritual destruction of China. Their method - abduct their enemies' children and train them as killers for the Emperor. Young Vajra was especially gifted, but swears a secret oath of revenge when his brother dies. Now the greatest assassin in the temple, Vajra escapes to China and begins his quest to protect the innocent, and destroy the ones responsible for making him a living weapon. A former Shaolin monk, martial arts action star Xing Yu (aka Shi Yanneng) stars as Vajra in his first leading role.\", 'languages': ['Mandarin', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2013, 9, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Wing-cheong Law'], 'writers': ['Zhenjian Yang'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-10 17:07:28.857000000', 'year': 2013, 'imdb': {'rating': 5.6, 'votes': 1050, 'id': 3259968}, 'countries': ['China'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e9f29313caabdcbb99'), 'plot': \"PULP find fame on the world stage in the 1990's with anthems including 'Common People' and 'Disco 2000'. 25 years (and 10 million album sales) later, they return to Sheffield for their last...\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Music'], 'runtime': 90, 'metacritic': 62, 'cast': ['Nick Banks', 'Jarvis Cocker', 'Candida Doyle', 'Richard Hawley'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMzgzNTQ0NjQyNV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMzE5NzczMjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Pulp: a Film About Life, Death & Supermarkets', 'fullplot': \"PULP find fame on the world stage in the 1990's with anthems including 'Common People' and 'Disco 2000'. 25 years (and 10 million album sales) later, they return to Sheffield for their last UK concert. Giving a career best performance exclusive to the film, the band share their thoughts on fame, love, mortality - & car maintenance. Director Florian Habicht (Love Story) weaves together the band's personal offerings with dream-like specially-staged tableaux featuring ordinary people recruited on the streets of Sheffield. PULP is a music-film like no other - by turns funny, moving, life-affirming & (occasionally) bewildering.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 11, 19, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Florian Habicht'], 'writers': ['Jarvis Cocker (concept by)', 'Florian Habicht (concept by)', \"Peter O'Donoghue\"], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '1 win & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-04 00:19:11.303000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.3, 'votes': 1087, 'id': 3265262}, 'countries': ['UK'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
