            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13e9f29313caabdcb88d'), 'plot': \"By night, Stratos works in a bread factory but by day, he's a professional hit man. He needs the cash to free Leonidas from prison because the latter once saved his life when he was behind ...\", 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 137, 'cast': ['Vangelis Mourikis', 'Petros Zervos', 'Vicky Papadopoulou', 'Yannis Tsortekis'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'Stratos', 'fullplot': \"By night, Stratos works in a bread factory but by day, he's a professional hit man. He needs the cash to free Leonidas from prison because the latter once saved his life when he was behind bars. For Stratos, this is simply a question of honour. We've no idea how many people he's already killed, but we do notice that he still has a conscience. He attentively looks after a neighbour's child, eight-year-old Katharina, as well as her mother and an uncle. At last he has enough money for the prison break-out. But Leonidas is lured into a bloody trap, by his brother of all people, who disappears with the money. At the same time Stratos learns that little Katharina is in danger - both psychologically and physically. He must act, even if this means following one wrongdoing with another.\", 'languages': ['Greek'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 3, 27, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Yannis Economides'], 'writers': ['Yannis Economides', 'Christos V. Konstantakopoulos', 'Harry Lagoussis', 'Vangelis Mourikis', 'Xiros Thanos'], 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 12, 'text': '5 wins & 12 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-12 00:15:54.890000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.8, 'votes': 682, 'id': 3259474}, 'countries': ['Greece', 'Germany', 'Cyprus'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
