            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ebf29313caabdd061c'), 'plot': \"A professional baduk player infiltrates his local underground gambling scene to avenge his brother's death.\", 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 118, 'cast': ['Kil-kang Ahn', 'Sung-kee Ahn', 'Greg Chun', 'Choi Jin-Hyuk'], 'title': 'The Divine Move', 'fullplot': 'Professional baduk player Tae-seok loses a high-stakes game to infamous underground gambler Sal-soo, and ends up framed for the murder of his own brother and locked up in prison. He vows revenge and trains ferociously. After serving his seven-year sentence, he gets in touch with his brother\\'s former associate \"Tricks,\" hermit and blind master player \"The Lord,\" and skillful junkyard owner Mok-su; together, they begin formulating a plan to get back at Sal-soo and his men. Tae-seok slowly penetrates Sal-soo\\'s inner circle and his gambling joint, and eliminates Sal-soo\\'s men one by one. But Sal-soo discovers Tae-seok\\'s true identity and engages him in one final game that will seal the fates of the two men involved.', 'languages': ['Korean'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 7, 25, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Beom-gu Cho'], 'writers': ['Sung-Hyub Yu'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '1 win & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-21 00:21:12.563000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 707, 'id': 3419894}, 'countries': ['South Korea'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
