            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ecf29313caabdd20aa'), 'plot': 'Jack is a young boy who lives in a troubled family with little money.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 103, 'cast': ['Ivo Pietzcker', 'Georg Arms', 'Johann Fohl', 'Luise Heyer'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'Jack', 'fullplot': 'For JACK (10), having a family is the most important thing in the world. Then, one day, his mother disappears. Together with his younger brother MANUEL (6), he embarks on a journey to find her... the journey of a boy who has learnt from an early age to take responsibility. In the end, his brave and startling decision holds up a mirror to all of us.', 'languages': ['German'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 10, 9, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Edward Berger'], 'writers': ['Edward Berger (screenplay)', 'Nele Mueller-Stèfen (screenplay)', 'Nele Mueller-Stèfen'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 6, 'text': '2 wins & 6 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-18 01:01:00.860000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.9, 'votes': 204, 'id': 3469918}, 'countries': ['Germany'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
