            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13ecf29313caabdd2a78'), 'plot': \"Before Tilda's parents can put her beloved grandfather in an old people's home due to his progressing Alzheimer disease, she takes him on one last adventure that subliminally threatens to tear her family apart.\", 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama', 'Family'], 'runtime': 139, 'cast': ['Pasquale Aleardi', 'Marco Boriero', 'Alexa Brunner', 'Belinda Busch'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjQwMzQ1MDE4OV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNjg0ODMyNjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Honig im Kopf', 'fullplot': 'Its a story about a special love, the love between TILDA and her grandfather AMANDUS. Amandus has Alzheimers. He always was the bon vivant, the humorous and beloved head of the family now he starts acting like a child. Only the ten year old Tilda can deal with him and his disease she looks at it with the eyes of a child and a kind of humour and sensitivity that makes it easier to approach Amandus when he is lost in his new own world. This special connection approaches the disease in a humorous but emotional way, without forgetting about its tragedy.', 'languages': ['German', 'Italian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 12, 25, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Til Schweiger', 'Lars Gmehling'], 'writers': ['Hilly Martinek (screenplay)', 'Til Schweiger (screenplay)'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '3 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-17 02:12:09.523000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.8, 'votes': 1761, 'id': 3488462}, 'countries': ['Germany'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
