            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13edf29313caabdd46b1'), 'plot': \"Dior and I brings the viewer inside the storied world of the Christian Dior fashion house with a privileged, behind-the-scenes look at the creation of Raf Simons' first haute couture ...\", 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 90, 'metacritic': 70, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Grace Coddington', 'Marion Cotillard', 'Isabelle Huppert', 'Marc Jacobs'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOTAzMDE4MzMzNl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMjE4MzM2NDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Dior and I', 'fullplot': \"Dior and I brings the viewer inside the storied world of the Christian Dior fashion house with a privileged, behind-the-scenes look at the creation of Raf Simons' first haute couture collection as its new artistic director-a true labor of love created by a dedicated group of collaborators. Melding the everyday, pressure-filled components of fashion with mysterious echoes from the iconic brand's past, the film is also a colorful homage to the seamstresses who serve Simons' vision.\", 'languages': ['English', 'French', 'Italian', 'Flemish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 4, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Frèdèric Tcheng'], 'writers': ['Frèdèric Tcheng'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 4, 'text': '1 win & 4 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-17 00:01:30.687000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.2, 'votes': 787, 'id': 3539664}, 'countries': ['France'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
