            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13eef29313caabdd5890'), 'plot': 'An aspiring director targets a ruthless gangster for making a violent gangster film. His discreet attempts to research the gangster fail miserably. Finally when he gets caught snooping, the tables are turned on him.', 'genres': ['Crime', 'Drama', 'Musical'], 'runtime': 171, 'cast': ['Siddharth', 'Lakshmi Menon', 'Bobby Simha', 'Nasser'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'title': 'Jigarthanda', 'fullplot': \"When Karthik is given a task by his producer to come up with a gripping gangster flick infested with heavy dosage of violence, he focuses on Sethu, a ruthless gangster surrounded by quirky yet scary henchmen. Karthik discreetly tries his best to find out about Sethu to develop a film script, but fails miserably in all his attempts. However when he finally gets the chance to gain an insight into Sethu's life, disaster strikes as he gets caught in the mèlèe following the discovery of a mole within Sethu's gang.\", 'languages': ['Tamil'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 8, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Karthik Subbaraj'], 'writers': ['Karthik Subbaraj (story)', 'Karthik Subbaraj', 'Karthik Subbaraj'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '3 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-25 01:00:58.680000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 8.5, 'votes': 3156, 'id': 3569782}, 'countries': ['India'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
