            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13eef29313caabdd53ce'), 'plot': 'Tensions between two brothers and their families escalate when a video of two teenagers, possibly son of one brother and daughter of the other, beating a homeless woman to death, shows up.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 92, 'cast': ['Alessandro Gassman', 'Giovanna Mezzogiorno', 'Luigi Lo Cascio', 'Barbora Bobulova'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTgzODUyMjc4Ml5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMzU0MzM1NjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Dinner', 'fullplot': 'Story about two brothers and their wives, and the interactions between them and their two high school age children. When the kids get into serious trouble together, how will the parents relationships change with and among each other? Will the parents protect the kids or force them to face the consequences of their actions?', 'languages': ['Italian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 9, 5, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Ivano De Matteo'], 'writers': ['Valentina Ferlan (screenplay)', 'Ivano De Matteo (screenplay)', 'Herman Koch (novel)'], 'awards': {'wins': 6, 'nominations': 5, 'text': '6 wins & 5 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-27 00:13:53.760000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.5, 'votes': 364, 'id': 3561348}, 'countries': ['Italy'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
