            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13eef29313caabdd668c'), 'plot': 'An epistolary feature film: a cinematic discourse between a British director, (Mark Cousins, the celebrated film maker and historian) and an Iranian actress and director (Mania Akbari, ...', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography'], 'runtime': 80, 'cast': ['Mania Akbari', 'Mark Cousins'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'Life May Be', 'fullplot': 'An epistolary feature film: a cinematic discourse between a British director, (Mark Cousins, the celebrated film maker and historian) and an Iranian actress and director (Mania Akbari, famed for her work with Abbas Kiarostami and in her own right as a director) which extends the concept of \"essay film\" with startling confrontations in the arenas of cultural issues, gender politics and differing artistic sensibilities. A unique journey into the minds of two exceptional filmmakers which becomes a love affair on film.', 'languages': ['English', 'Persian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 6, 21, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Mania Akbari', 'Mark Cousins'], 'writers': ['Mania Akbari', 'Mark Cousins'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '1 win & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-05-15 06:12:12.970000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.2, 'votes': 43, 'id': 3592704}, 'countries': ['UK', 'Iran'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13eef29313caabdd6895'), 'plot': 'Northpole, the magical home to Santa & Mrs. Claus, has grown into a huge city powered by the magic of holiday happiness around the world. Yet as people everywhere get too busy to enjoy ...', 'genres': ['Fantasy'], 'runtime': 84, 'rated': 'G', 'cast': ['Trevor Botkin', 'Max Charles', 'Philippe Desormeaux', 'Richard Fitzpatrick'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjA0NjE4NTg4Ml5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMTQ0OTE3MjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Northpole', 'fullplot': \"Northpole, the magical home to Santa & Mrs. Claus, has grown into a huge city powered by the magic of holiday happiness around the world. Yet as people everywhere get too busy to enjoy festive time together, the city is in trouble. Who can help save the cherished traditions of Christmas? One young boy, Kevin, might have a chance if he can convince his protective mom, Chelsea, to rediscover the magic of the season. With a little added help from Kevin's charming teacher Ryan, a mysterious elf-like girl Clementine (Madison) and a gospel singer named Josephine, Kevin is determined to bring his mom in on the fun and prove that one small voice can change the hearts of many.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 11, 15, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Douglas Barr'], 'writers': ['Gregg Rossen', 'Brian Sawyer'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-14 23:58:12.763000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.5, 'votes': 508, 'id': 3595848}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13eef29313caabdd676a'), 'plot': \"In search of the lucrative matsutake mushroom, two former soldiers discover the means to gradually heal their wounds of war. Roger, a self-described 'fall-down drunk' and sniper in Vietnam,...\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Family', 'War'], 'runtime': 78, 'cast': ['Joe Berry', 'Uncle Bob', 'Sam Doungaphay', 'Sokmakara Hang'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTY2NDYzNDcyOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNTAxNjkyMjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Last Season', 'fullplot': \"In search of the lucrative matsutake mushroom, two former soldiers discover the means to gradually heal their wounds of war. Roger, a self-described 'fall-down drunk' and sniper in Vietnam, and Kouy, a Cambodian refugee who fought the Khmer Rouge, bonded in the bustling tent-city known as Mushroom Camp, which pops up each autumn in the Oregon woods. Their friendship became an adoptive family; according to a Cambodian custom, if you lose your family like Kouy, you must rebuilt it anew. Now, however, this new family could be lost. Roger's health is declining and trauma flashbacks rack his mind; Kouy gently aids his family before the snow falls and the hunting season ends, signaling his time to leave.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 4, 25, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Sara Dosa'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2014-09-20 04:04:23.547000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': '', 'votes': '', 'id': 3593932}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13eef29313caabdd6923'), 'plot': \"A journey inside Martin's head. He's on a weekend mountain trip, and we get to know his thoughts. Unsensored, essential, existential and silly about feelings and fantasies. A recognizable film about being human, and how we tick and think.\", 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 80, 'cast': ['Ole Gièver', 'Rebekka Nystabakk', 'Marte Magnusdotter Solem', 'Sivert Gièver Solem'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTQxMzk2MTg0M15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwOTg3NzI2MjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Out of Nature', 'fullplot': \"Depiction of middle-age and first-world anxieties. Martin is clearly out of place both in his office, and at home with his wife and son. As he embarks on a trek searching for solace in the stunning Norwegian wilderness, he can't seem to find peace: his incessant stream of thoughts are endlessly commenting and fantasising about disturbing what ifs: what if he got a divorce? What if his wife died? What if he were a cripple? As the day stretches on, Martin prepares for a drastic change of pace amidst the wildlife in what is both a considered and consistently humorous portrayal of how easy it is to feel alienated in a very stable life.\", 'languages': ['Norwegian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 9, 19, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Ole Gièver', 'Marte Vold'], 'writers': ['Ole Gièver'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '2 wins & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-09 00:38:54.257000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.3, 'votes': 397, 'id': 3596492}, 'countries': ['Norway'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13eef29313caabdd6eba'), 'plot': \"The Sheik is a pop culture documentary that chronicles Khosrow Vaziri's electrifying career. From his upbringing in Iran, to his journey in America, to his unprecedented experiences as America's most hated villain.\", 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 95, 'cast': ['Jack Black', 'Jim Duggan', 'Mick Foley', 'Todd W. Fulkerson'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTg4MjM1Nzk0N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNzU0NTM1MTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'The Sheik', 'fullplot': \"Filmed extensively between 2006 and 2014, this is a touching story about the unlikely revival of a former wrestling superstar. At age 72, the Sheik has embraced an unlikely new career as an outlandish social media sensation; known for hilarious outbursts and massively popular antics. Watch as we recount the Sheik's one-of-a-kind life journey. The film explores the Sheik's personal relationships with those closest to him, and those who know him best: his wife, his children, his grandchildren, his contemporaries and colleagues. Interviews were conducted with the Sheik's family, Wrestling and Iranian historians, friends and over 25 wrestling superstars.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 4, 26, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Igal Hecht'], 'writers': ['Jian Magen (story)', 'Jake Neiman (story)', 'Igal Hecht (story)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-05 00:55:16.213000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.2, 'votes': 442, 'id': 3607812}, 'countries': ['Canada'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
