            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13eff29313caabdd88e1'), 'plot': 'When corrupt Roman leader Tiberius arrives with a giant army to claim the Silk Road, Huo An teams up his army with an elite Legion of defected Roman soldiers led by General Lucius to protect his country and his new friends.', 'genres': ['Action', 'Adventure', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 127, 'rated': 'R', 'cast': ['Jackie Chan', 'John Cusack', 'Adrien Brody', 'Si Won Choi'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTk0MjgxOTQ5MF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwODA3NTUwNjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Dragon Blade', 'fullplot': 'A massive success this year in its native China, \"Dragon Blade\" brings action spectacle on a grand scale to US audiences. Featuring an international cast led by Jackie Chan, John Cusack and Academy Awardè winner Adrien Brody, the film features the fight for the Silk Road when East and West collide. When corrupt Roman leader Tiberius (Adrien Brody) arrives with a giant army to claim the Silk Road, Huo An (Jackie Chan) and his group of trained warriors teams up with an elite legion of defected Roman soldiers led by General Lucius (John Cusack) to maintain the delicate balance of power in the region. To protect his country and his new friends, Huo An gathers the warriors of thirty-six ethnic nations together to fight Tiberius in an incredible epic battle. The film is written and directed by Daniel Lee (\"Black Mask\") and produced by Jackie Chan and Susanna Tsang.', 'languages': ['Mandarin', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 4, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Daniel Lee'], 'writers': ['Daniel Lee'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '2 wins.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-25 00:08:03.197000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.3, 'votes': 5948, 'id': 3672840}, 'countries': ['China'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f0f29313caabdd969c'), 'plot': 'The darkest chapter of the 20th century collides with a contemporary mission of revenge.', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 95, 'cast': ['Dean Norris', 'Christopher Plummer', 'Martin Landau', 'Jèrgen Prochnow'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjM3OTY3Njc1OV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNDY0MzE1NzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Remember', 'fullplot': '\"Remember\" is the contemporary story of Zev, who discovers that the Nazi guard who murdered his family some 70 years ago is living in America under an assumed identity. Despite the obvious challenges, Zev sets out on a mission to deliver long-delayed justice with his own trembling hand. What follows is a remarkable cross-continent road-trip with surprising consequences.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2016, 1, 15, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Atom Egoyan'], 'writers': ['Benjamin August'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-15 04:11:47.973000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.4, 'votes': 36, 'id': 3704050}, 'countries': ['Canada', 'Germany'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
