            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f2f29313caabddda4f'), 'plot': 'Latiaozi was a Farmer who made a living with shepherding with his wife Jinzhizi. One day, their only son had been condemned for the crime. The couple scrabbled up 50000 Yuan to ask Li Datou...', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 103, 'cast': ['Jianjiang Chen'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'title': 'A Fool', 'fullplot': \"Latiaozi was a Farmer who made a living with shepherding with his wife Jinzhizi. One day, their only son had been condemned for the crime. The couple scrabbled up 50000 Yuan to ask Li Datou, the able person of the town, for help, begging if Li Datou could find some big shot to reduce the penalty of their son. But they had been cheated. Latiaozi went to Li Datou's home to argue for his money but he failed. On his way home, he met a fool by accident. He had no choice but to pick him home. After a night spent in sheepfold, the fool was sent back to the town...\", 'languages': ['Chinese'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 5, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jianbin Chen'], 'writers': ['Xuewen Hu'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 3, 'text': '2 wins & 3 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-07-27 00:10:02.433000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.7, 'votes': 21, 'id': 3856504}, 'countries': ['China'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
