            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f4f29313caabde122f'), 'plot': 'One night. One apartment. One missing person. Rami takes his dog on a walk and does not return. He disappeared. His wife, Shir, is clueless as to his whereabouts. Different people come in ...', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Thriller'], 'runtime': 92, 'cast': ['Tamar Alkan', 'Tom Antopolsky', 'Shlomi Avraham', 'Amitay Yaish Benuosilio'], 'title': 'The Man in the Wall', 'fullplot': 'One night. One apartment. One missing person. Rami takes his dog on a walk and does not return. He disappeared. His wife, Shir, is clueless as to his whereabouts. Different people come in and out of the apartment during that night - each for their own reasons. Could one of them hold the key to the mystery?', 'languages': ['Hebrew'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 1, 23, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Evgeny Ruman'], 'writers': ['Evgeny Ruman'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 5, 'text': '2 wins & 5 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-01 01:03:11.817000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.6, 'votes': 37, 'id': 4029356}, 'countries': ['Israel'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f4f29313caabde1138'), 'plot': 'Dedicated home care nurse Vlasta lives for her husband Lada, her daughter, and her patients. But then one day things change and Vlasta comes to realize that she might need some care too.', 'genres': ['Comedy', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 92, 'cast': ['Jan Gogola Sr.', 'Slèvek Horèk', 'Mikulès Kren', 'Zuzana Krènerovè'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOTA2NTkyNjE0N15BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMjU1MDYxNjE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Home Care', 'fullplot': \"Everyone knows about the finality of human existence but the realization of life's actual limits comes to each of us individually and often unexpectedly. Dedicated home care nurse Vlasta lives for her husband Lada, her daughter and her patients. But then one day things change and Vlasta is forced to reach outside of her comfort zone. Drama and gentle humor intertwine as Vlasta realizes that she might need some care too.\", 'languages': ['Czech'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 1, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Slèvek Horèk'], 'writers': ['Slèvek Horèk'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-06 00:20:54.010000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 19, 'id': 4026642}, 'countries': ['Czech Republic', 'Slovakia'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f4f29313caabde24c7'), 'plot': 'A woman who changed the course of history.', 'genres': ['Biography', 'Drama', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 110, 'cast': ['Yuliya Peresild', 'Evgeniy Tsyganov', 'Joan Blackham', 'Anatoliy Kot'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTA0ODAzMDg3MzheQTJeQWpwZ15BbWU4MDc0OTQzOTIx._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Bitva za Sevastopol', 'fullplot': \"The breakout of the war shatters the world of a young student, Lyudmila Pavlichenko, forcing her to enlist in the army in 1941. The maiden turns out to be a natural-born sniper, her impressive skill and prowess make her stand out among men and women alike. Seeing Pavlichenko as a tangible threat, the German High Command gives orders to eliminate the girl whatever the cost. In the meanwhile, Lyudmila meets a man and falls in love. War fades into the background... Soon, however, another misfortune befalls Lyudmila leaving the man she loves on the brink of death and herself seriously wounded. The girl is pulled out of combat and later goes to the United States with a publicity visit. Eleanor Roosevelt welcomes Lyudmila in the White House and the two women soon become close. It won't be long before Pavlichenko stands before an audience in Chicago pressing for a second front. Will her words have the capacity to change the course of war?\", 'languages': ['Russian', 'English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 4, 2, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Sergey Mokritskiy'], 'writers': ['Maksim Budarin', 'Maksim Dankevich', 'Leonid Korin', 'Sergey Mokritskiy', 'Egor Olesov'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 win & 1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-31 00:51:33.717000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.2, 'votes': 1766, 'id': 4084744}, 'countries': ['Ukraine', 'Russia'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
