            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f4f29313caabde230e'), 'plot': 'A former sheriff will stop at nothing to confront the SWAT team he founded.', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'News'], 'runtime': 105, 'title': 'Peace Officer', 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTA0OTMzMDM4MDJeQTJeQWpwZ15BbWU4MDA3Njk1NDYx._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['USA'], 'fullplot': \"Peace Officer is a documentary about the increasingly militarized state of American police as told through the story of 'Dub' Lawrence, a former sheriff who established and trained his rural state's first SWAT team only to see that same unit kill his son-in-law in a controversial standoff 30 years later. Driven by an obsessed sense of mission, Dub uses his own investigation skills to uncover the truth in this and other recent officer-involved shootings in his community, while tackling larger questions about the changing face of peace officers nationwide.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 3, 15, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Brad Barber', 'Scott Christopherson'], 'writers': ['Brad Barber', 'Scott Christopherson', 'David Lawrence', 'Renny McCauley'], 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '5 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-01 00:12:33.460000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.8, 'votes': 41, 'id': 4079142}, 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f4f29313caabde284d'), 'plot': 'Bruno is an architect who has a perfect life: A nice family and a good job. Anyway, Bruno has a deep sense of unease. He decides to leave his wife to be alone and have time to find him self...', 'genres': ['Drama', 'Romance'], 'runtime': 101, 'cast': ['Francisco Celhay', 'Emilio Edwards', 'Sergio Hernèndez', 'Daniela Ramèrez'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'title': 'In the Grayscale', 'fullplot': 'Bruno is an architect who has a perfect life: A nice family and a good job. Anyway, Bruno has a deep sense of unease. He decides to leave his wife to be alone and have time to find him self. A business man offers him to build an iconic landmark in Santiago city. Motivated by this professional challenge, Bruno feels he can find a twist in his life by a vocational route. He start working with a young history teacher named Fer (29) who is agile, energetic, captivating and gay. Starts between them an unexpected and intense romance. At this point he must decide his path. The biggest learning: simplicity is the best way to get up again.', 'languages': ['Spanish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 10, 29, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Claudio Marcone'], 'writers': ['Rodrigo Antonio Norero'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-06 00:01:50.760000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.0, 'votes': 46, 'id': 4097612}, 'countries': ['Chile'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f4f29313caabde2819'), 'plot': 'The main characters of the film have made choices, which change their lives forever. A young man Yigal Amir assassinates the Prime Minister of Israel and becomes the most hated prisoner in ...', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'History'], 'runtime': 80, 'title': 'Beyond the Fear', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'countries': ['Israel', 'Latvia'], 'fullplot': 'The main characters of the film have made choices, which change their lives forever. A young man Yigal Amir assassinates the Prime Minister of Israel and becomes the most hated prisoner in the country. Larissa, who emigrated from Russia, mother of four divorces her first husband, marries the assassin and gives birth to his son. For many years the film authors have been trying to solve and perceive this complicated story. One of them, Hertz Frank, passes away during the shootings remaining on the threshold of the eternal mystery - life, death and love...', 'languages': ['Russian'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 27, 0, 0), 'writers': ['Herz Frank', 'Maria Kravchenko'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-02 00:21:26.570000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.6, 'votes': 8, 'id': 4097108}, 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f5f29313caabde2e6b'), 'plot': \"Curtis Duffy, one of the country's most renowned chefs, is building his dream restaurant at the worst time of his personal life. Already the recipient of two coveted stars from the Michelin...\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography', 'Family'], 'runtime': 92, 'title': 'For Grace', 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTc1MTYzMjUyNV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwODM1OTE2MzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'countries': ['USA'], 'fullplot': \"Curtis Duffy, one of the country's most renowned chefs, is building his dream restaurant at the worst time of his personal life. Already the recipient of two coveted stars from the Michelin Guide, Duffy has ambitions for his Chicago restaurant Grace to become the best in the country. But his laser focus on his cooking career cost Duffy his marriage and two young daughters. 'For Grace' follows the building of Grace from concrete box to its opening night. It's a story about food, family, balance and sacrifice. It also revisits Duffy's turbulent childhood -- How a teacher recognized talent in a troubled teenager, how an unimaginable family tragedy made Duffy seek refuge in the kitchen, and how cooking ultimately exacted a price.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 3, 13, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Mark Helenowski', 'Kevin Pang'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-16 07:18:28.547000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.9, 'votes': 24, 'id': 4125856}, 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f5f29313caabde2e80'), 'plot': 'A physician in Michoacèn, Mexico leads a citizen uprising against the drug cartel that has wrecked havoc on the region for years. Across the U.S. border, a veteran heads a paramilitary ...', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Action', 'Drama'], 'runtime': 100, 'metacritic': 77, 'cast': ['Robert Hetrick'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjE1MzI2MzcxOV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNTE2Mjk4NTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Cartel Land', 'fullplot': \"A physician in Michoacèn, Mexico leads a citizen uprising against the drug cartel that has wrecked havoc on the region for years. Across the U.S. border, a veteran heads a paramilitary group working to prevent Mexico's drug wars from entering U.S. territory.\", 'languages': ['English', 'Spanish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 3, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Matthew Heineman'], 'rated': 'R', 'awards': {'wins': 5, 'nominations': 5, 'text': '5 wins & 5 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-03 00:39:18.163000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.5, 'votes': 429, 'id': 4126304}, 'countries': ['Mexico', 'USA'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f5f29313caabde2ed7'), 'plot': 'On a remote planet a Master watches his Apprentice carryout tests with nanotechnology as she tries to prove herself worthy of advancement.', 'genres': ['Short', 'History', 'Mystery'], 'runtime': 7, 'cast': ['Aidan Gillen', 'Aisling Franciosi'], 'title': 'Ambition', 'fullplot': 'The story of one of the most important space exploration endeavours of this decade. Just as Gillen\\'s enigmatic Master encourages Franciosi\\'s Apprentice to seek out the key to life amidst a rugged alien landscape, ESA has been on a decade-long ambitious journey of its own, to unlock the mysteries of a comet and the origins of our Solar System with its Rosetta spacecraft, hundreds of millions of kilometres from Earth. Ambition complements the ongoing communication about Rosetta and adds a \"human dimension\" to the scientific and technological achievements of the mission, which include curiosity, drive and ambition.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 10, 24, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Tomek Baginski'], 'writers': ['Tomek Baginski (screenplay)', 'Tomek Baginski', 'Jacek Dukaj (story)', 'Afolabi Kuti (screenplay)', 'Tobiasz Piatkowski (story)', 'Jan Pomierny (story)', 'Jan Pomierny (story)'], 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 1, 'text': '1 nomination.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-02 00:29:03.413000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.7, 'votes': 351, 'id': 4127138}, 'countries': ['Poland', 'Ireland', 'Iceland'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f5f29313caabde3601'), 'plot': 'A documentary about fashion icon Iris Apfel from legendary documentary filmmaker Albert Maysles.', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Biography', 'History'], 'runtime': 80, 'metacritic': 80, 'cast': ['Carl Apfel', 'Iris Apfel'], 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNDMzMDY1NTE4MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwODc4NjY3NDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Iris', 'fullplot': \"IRIS pairs the 87-year-old Maysles with Iris Apfel, the quick-witted, flamboyantly dressed 93-year-old style maven who has had an outsized presence on the New York fashion scene for decades. More than a fashion film, the documentary is a story about creativity and how, even at Iris' advanced age, a soaring free spirit continues to inspire. IRIS portrays a singular woman whose enthusiasm for fashion, art and people are life's sustenance and reminds us that dressing, and indeed life, is nothing but an experiment. Despite the abundance of glamour in her current life, she continues to embrace the values and work ethic established during a middle-class Queens upbringing during the Great Depression. I feel lucky to be working. If you're lucky enough to do something you love, everything else follows.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 7, 31, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Albert Maysles'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-30 00:53:50.553000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.5, 'votes': 438, 'id': 4157220}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie', 'num_mflix_comments': 0}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f5f29313caabde396d'), 'plot': 'A story about a broken-hearted girl who meets a boy in a not so normal way. Together, they go to places and find out \"where do broken hearts go?\".', 'genres': ['Romance'], 'runtime': 110, 'cast': ['Angelica Panganiban', 'JM de Guzman', 'Joem Bascon', 'Carlos Castano'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'title': 'That Thing Called Tadhana', 'fullplot': 'The films asks the questions \"Where do broken hearts go?\" and tells the story of a woman struggling to meet airline baggage requirements who meets a man who comes to her aid. Both in despair out of love, they form a charming friendship that will take them to Sagada in their attempts to mend each other\\'s hearts.', 'languages': ['Filipino', 'Tagalog'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 2, 4, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Antoinette Jadaone'], 'writers': ['Antoinette Jadaone'], 'awards': {'wins': 3, 'nominations': 9, 'text': '3 wins & 9 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-22 00:13:36.233000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.9, 'votes': 385, 'id': 4170436}, 'countries': ['Philippines'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f5f29313caabde329f'), 'plot': \"In 1971, a group of friends sail into a nuclear test zone, and their protest captures the world's imagination. Using never before seen archive that brings their extraordinary world to life,...\", 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Adventure', 'Biography'], 'runtime': 110, 'cast': ['Bill Darnell', 'David Garrick', 'Bobbi Hunter', 'Emily Hunter'], 'num_mflix_comments': 0, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjExNTM1OTE5MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMjAxODUwNDE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'How to Change the World', 'fullplot': \"In 1971, a group of friends sail into a nuclear test zone, and their protest captures the world's imagination. Using never before seen archive that brings their extraordinary world to life, How To Change The World is the story of the pioneers who founded Greenpeace and defined the modern green movement.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 9, 10, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jerry Rothwell'], 'writers': ['Jerry Rothwell'], 'awards': {'wins': 2, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 wins & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-07 01:05:46.697000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 7.9, 'votes': 72, 'id': 4144504}, 'countries': ['Canada', 'UK'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f5f29313caabde313d'), 'plot': 'A look at the life and work of the great theatre, radio and film artist.', 'genres': ['Documentary'], 'runtime': 91, 'metacritic': 67, 'cast': ['Peter Bogdanovich', 'Orson Welles'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTkxMjk5MjMxOF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNTk2MTMxMzE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Magician: The Astonishing Life and Work of Orson Welles', 'fullplot': \"Magician: The Astonishing Life and Work of Orson Welles looks at the remarkable genius of Orson Welles on the eve of his centenary - the enigma of his career as a Hollywood star, a Hollywood director (for some a Hollywood failure), and a crucially important independent filmmaker. Orson Welles's life was magical: a musical prodigy at age 10, a director of Shakespeare at 14, a painter at 16, a star of stage and radio at 20, romances with some of the most beautiful women in the world, including Rita Hayworth. His work was similarly extraordinary, most notably Citizen Kane, (considered by many to be the most important movie ever made), created by Welles when he was only 25. In the years following Citizen Kane, Welles's career continued to change as he made film after film (some never finished, many dismissed) and acted in other projects often to earn money in order to keep making his own films. Magician features scenes from almost every existing Welles film, from Hearts of Age, (which he made in a day when he was only 18 years old) to rarely-seen clips from his final unfinished works like The Other Side of the Dream, The Deep, and Don Quixote, as well as his television and commercial work.\", 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2014, 10, 17, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Chuck Workman'], 'rated': 'PG-13', 'awards': {'wins': 0, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-09-06 00:47:00.290000000', 'year': 2014, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.7, 'votes': 306, 'id': 4137324}, 'countries': ['USA'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
