            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f7f29313caabde5e79'), 'plot': 'Kacper, a middle-aged high-school history teacher, begins to lose his eyesight. The medical diagnosis leaves no hope. Initially heartbroken, he attempts to hide his health problems from the outside world.', 'genres': ['Drama'], 'runtime': 106, 'cast': ['Andrzej Chyra', 'Urszula Grabowska', 'Arkadiusz Jakubik', 'Eliza Rycembel'], 'num_mflix_comments': 1, 'poster': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTU1NzE3NjczOV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwNzk4NjY5NTE@._V1_SY1000_SX677_AL_.jpg', 'title': 'Carte Blanche', 'fullplot': \"The true story of a high-school history teacher who decides to hide a progressive sight loss from everyone surrounding him - his colleagues, pupils, even the ones who really care about him, because of the fear of losing his job and trying to save his dignity. Due to a genetic disorder, Kacper is faced with a very real possibility of permanent blindness. Initially heartbroken, he attempts to hide his health problems from his bosses driven by his desire to keep his job and to help his students with the final exams. The only person who knows about Kacper's problem is his best friend Wiktor. Meanwhile, Kacper enters a relationship with his colleague Ewa, and tries to help a rebel student Klara, who hides a secret of her own.\", 'languages': ['Polish'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 1, 23, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jacek Lusinski'], 'writers': ['Jacek Lusinski'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 0, 'text': '1 win.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-09 00:37:01.757000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 6.5, 'votes': 125, 'id': 4329800}, 'countries': ['Poland'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
