            "{'_id': ObjectId('573a13f6f29313caabde54d3'), 'plot': 'Music, art and chaos in the wild West-Berlin of the 1980s. The walled-in city became the creative melting pot for sub- and pop-culture. Before the iron curtain fell, everything and anything...', 'genres': ['Documentary', 'Music'], 'runtime': 92, 'cast': ['Blixa Bargeld', 'Gudrun Gut', 'Annette Humpe', 'Mark Reeder'], 'num_mflix_comments': 2, 'title': 'B-Movie: Lust & Sound in West-Berlin 1979-1989', 'fullplot': 'Music, art and chaos in the wild West-Berlin of the 1980s. The walled-in city became the creative melting pot for sub- and pop-culture. Before the iron curtain fell, everything and anything seemed possible. B-MOVIE is a fast-paced collage of mostly unreleased film and TV footage from a frenzied but creative decade, starting with punk and ending with the Love Parade, in a city where the days are short and the nights are endless. Where it was not about long-term success, but about living for the moment - the here and now.', 'languages': ['English'], 'released': datetime.datetime(2015, 2, 8, 0, 0), 'directors': ['Jèrg A. Hoppe', 'Heiko Lange', 'Klaus Maeck'], 'writers': ['Jèrg A. Hoppe', 'Heiko Lange', 'Klaus Maeck', 'Mark Reeder', 'Mark Reeder (story)'], 'awards': {'wins': 1, 'nominations': 2, 'text': '1 win & 2 nominations.'}, 'lastupdated': '2015-08-15 00:54:48.457000000', 'year': 2015, 'imdb': {'rating': 8.1, 'votes': 206, 'id': 4291066}, 'countries': ['Germany'], 'type': 'movie'}\n",
